<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:09.600" end="00:00:14.000" style="s2">Mom, let me make this clear. Ding Xiao&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.000" end="00:00:15.900" style="s2">been in this family for five years and</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.000" end="00:00:19.400" style="s2">still hasn&#39;t gotten pregnant. She&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.900" end="00:00:19.400" style="s2">a woman who can&#39;t have kids.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.100" end="00:00:28.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I know I come from a humble</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.900" end="00:00:30.400" style="s2">background, but the baby I&#39;m carrying is</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.400" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">your Xiao family&#39;s first grandson in</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.400" end="00:00:35.100" style="s2">nine generations.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.700" end="00:00:36.100" style="s2">You can&#39;t be so heartless.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.100" end="00:00:38.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:40.300" style="s2">did you hear her? She&#39;s carrying your</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.100" end="00:00:42.400" style="s2">own grandson.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.300" end="00:00:43.800" style="s2">If you throw her out today, you&#39;ll end</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.400" end="00:00:45.900" style="s2">the Xiao family line.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.800" end="00:00:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, after all these years of</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.900" end="00:00:50.700" style="s2">marriage, you bring another woman here</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.000" end="00:00:52.000" style="s2">just to humiliate me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.700" end="00:00:54.000" style="s2">It hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.000" end="00:00:55.500" style="s2">My stomach hurts so much.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.000" end="00:00:56.700" style="s2">Save the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.500" end="00:00:58.900" style="s2">Please, save the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.700" end="00:01:00.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, you heartless woman, if</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.900" end="00:01:03.200" style="s2">anything happens to that baby, you and</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.900" end="00:01:05.300" style="s2">your mother will pay with your lives.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.200" end="00:01:06.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao is so jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.300" end="00:01:07.500" style="s2">She can&#39;t even tolerate a pregnant</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.500" end="00:01:09.200" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.500" end="00:01:12.300" style="s2">She&#39;s just that cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:14.400" style="s2">No wonder she can&#39;t have children.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.300" end="00:01:15.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t get worked up and risk the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.400" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">Help her to a guest room downstairs to</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.800" end="00:01:18.600" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:20.100" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry our family business became</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:21.500" style="s2">public today.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.100" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll come by in person another day to</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.500" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.400" end="00:01:31.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, the guest room downstairs is too</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.100" end="00:01:33.600" style="s2">damp.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.200" end="00:01:35.000" style="s2">It&#39;s bad for the baby&#39;s development.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.600" end="00:01:37.000" style="s2">I want the spacious master bedroom</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.000" end="00:01:39.200" style="s2">upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.000" end="00:01:42.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, take Miss Zheng&#39;s bags to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.200" end="00:01:42.600" style="s2">master bedroom upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.200" end="00:01:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.400" end="00:01:52.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Xiao, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.500" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young master, the master bedroom belongs</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.200" end="00:01:55.500" style="s2">to the young madam.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.600" end="00:01:56.700" style="s2">It was part of madam&#39;s dowry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.500" end="00:01:59.200" style="s2">The main house has never been for</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.700" end="00:01:59.200" style="s2">mistresses.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.800" end="00:02:05.592" style="s2">Until madam said otherwise, anyone who</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.892" end="00:02:06.792" style="s2">dares brings so much as one thing in</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.592" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">their can pack up and get out of the</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.792" end="00:02:09.892" style="s2">Xiao family.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.892" end="00:02:12.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it down. The housekeeper is from</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.892" end="00:02:12.692" style="s2">Madam&#39;s family. We can&#39;t afford to cross</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.192" end="00:02:14.792" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.692" end="00:02:17.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just a servant. How dare you talk</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.792" end="00:02:17.592" style="s2">to me like that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.992" end="00:02:27.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.292" end="00:02:30.592" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.592" end="00:02:30.592" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t strong enough.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.992" end="00:02:35.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, look at mom.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.792" end="00:02:35.392" style="s2">Don&#39;t cry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.692" end="00:02:40.492" style="s2">Did you notice when Jiang Ning fell just</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.292" end="00:02:42.392" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.492" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">That red stain on her skirt didn&#39;t smell</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.392" end="00:02:47.292" style="s2">like blood at all.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:47.292" style="s2">It was antiseptic.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.692" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">She was putting on an act, trying to</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:53.092" style="s2">make you lose your cool.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.792" end="00:02:55.292" style="s2">The more you cry, the happier they are.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.092" end="00:02:56.692" style="s2">From now on, when she puts on a show,</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.292" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">play along.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.692" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">Mom&#39;s got your back.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.192" end="00:03:03.892" style="s2">Xiao Wei thinks his father calls the</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.892" end="00:03:05.692" style="s2">shots in this family.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.892" end="00:03:09.292" style="s2">He forgot the Xiao family got its start</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:09.292" style="s2">with the dowry from my Chen family.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.192" end="00:03:15.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What on earth is this?</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.892" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">It smells so fishy. It&#39;s making me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:19.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Miss Jiang, you&#39;re pregnant and</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.892" end="00:03:20.992" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t go hungry. Just tell me what</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.992" end="00:03:22.492" style="s2">you&#39;d like.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.992" end="00:03:23.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Ding Xiao makes great bird&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.492" end="00:03:24.792" style="s2">nest soup.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.692" end="00:03:26.492" style="s2">I&#39;d love to try some.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.792" end="00:03:28.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young mistress, Miss Jiang asked for</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.492" end="00:03:30.592" style="s2">bird&#39;s nest soup made by you. Go to the</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.492" end="00:03:32.792" style="s2">kitchen now. Don&#39;t stay here and upset</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.592" end="00:03:35.292" style="s2">the young master and Miss Jiang. Young</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.792" end="00:03:37.592" style="s2">mistress, no offense, but no matter how</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.292" end="00:03:39.592" style="s2">much Madam protects you, the fact is you</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.592" end="00:03:41.792" style="s2">can&#39;t have children. She&#39;s carrying the</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.592" end="00:03:44.292" style="s2">Xiao family&#39;s future heir. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.792" end="00:03:46.592" style="s2">compete with that? Be smart and go right</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.292" end="00:03:46.592" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.892" end="00:03:49.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.292" end="00:03:56.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.492" end="00:03:56.592" style="s2">It&#39;s just cooking.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.894" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been serving people for so long,</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.794" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">you can&#39;t even handle this?</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.394" end="00:04:18.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Jiang, get an ice pack right now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.994" end="00:04:18.994" style="s2">Xiao, does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.394" end="00:04:23.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An ice pack for such a tiny scratch?</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.794" end="00:04:24.494" style="s2">Stop being so dramatic.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.094" end="00:04:25.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.494" end="00:04:27.394" style="s2">Since when do you have the right to boss</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.794" end="00:04:29.094" style="s2">people around in this house?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.394" end="00:04:30.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I&#39;m not wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.094" end="00:04:34.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom will help you back to your room to</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.594" end="00:04:36.594" style="s2">rest, ice it, and call the doctor over.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.794" end="00:04:38.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t even hold a pot steady. Did</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.594" end="00:04:39.294" style="s2">you burn Min on purpose? How can you be</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.494" end="00:04:41.594" style="s2">so vicious?</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.294" end="00:04:42.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, useless at everything. Can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.594" end="00:04:45.094" style="s2">even serve a pregnant woman.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.794" end="00:04:46.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, she is your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.094" end="00:04:47.594" style="s2">How could you let others humiliate her</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.394" end="00:04:48.694" style="s2">like this?</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.594" end="00:04:50.794" style="s2">Is this how I raised you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.694" end="00:04:52.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if she&#39;s my wife? 5 years and</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.794" end="00:04:54.694" style="s2">she hasn&#39;t even laid an egg. Does she</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:55.994" style="s2">deserve it? Mom, you were the one who</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.694" end="00:04:57.994" style="s2">insisted on bringing her into the</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.994" end="00:04:59.494" style="s2">family. I never wanted to marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.994" end="00:05:00.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao was burned like this, and as her</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.494" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">husband, you don&#39;t even have a single</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.794" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">word of concern.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.094" end="00:05:04.894" style="s2">How could I have a son like you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:06.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t want a mother like you either.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.894" end="00:05:08.994" style="s2">Look at the wife you picked for me. Dull</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.894" end="00:05:09.894" style="s2">as a piece of wood, cold as ice every</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.994" end="00:05:11.394" style="s2">single day.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.894" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.394" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.694" end="00:05:23.194" style="s2">making such a scene at home and scolding</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.794" end="00:05:23.194" style="s2">your own son, all for an outsider.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.594" end="00:05:30.094" style="s2">How old are you now? Losing your temper</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.894" end="00:05:34.094" style="s2">like this in front of the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.094" end="00:05:35.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Mom. Min is carrying my child.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.094" end="00:05:37.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min is carrying the Xiao family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.794" end="00:05:40.094" style="s2">flesh and blood. She&#39;s our greatest</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.894" end="00:05:41.794" style="s2">contributor.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.094" end="00:05:42.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Li Hua, Xiao Hua is your daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.794" end="00:05:44.794" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.994" end="00:05:46.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re screaming at home over a woman</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.794" end="00:05:50.994" style="s2">who can&#39;t even lay an egg. If word gets</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.994" end="00:05:52.594" style="s2">out, how will the Xiao family save face?</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.994" end="00:05:54.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was our son who</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.594" end="00:05:56.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Since Ding Xiao married into our</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.594" end="00:05:58.594" style="s2">family, serving a pregnant mother is her</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.394" end="00:05:59.894" style="s2">duty. If she can &#39;t even handle this,</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.594" end="00:06:01.394" style="s2">why did she climb all over herself to</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.894" end="00:06:01.894" style="s2">marry up into our family in the first</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.394" end="00:06:04.694" style="s2">place?</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.894" end="00:06:04.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Min is my true love.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.694" end="00:06:08.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.895" end="00:06:08.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; either of you have a conscience?</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.895" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Sheng, have some fruit to calm</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:17.895" style="s2">down. The master is right. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.495" end="00:06:20.495" style="s2">precious right now. Don&#39;t get upset over</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.895" end="00:06:22.495" style="s2">irrelevant people.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.495" end="00:06:23.695" style="s2">With the master backing you, some people</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.495" end="00:06:26.295" style="s2">still put on airs like they&#39;re the young</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.695" end="00:06:28.095" style="s2">mistress. Truly shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.295" end="00:06:30.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid, Xiaoer.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.095" end="00:06:30.895" style="s2">Mom has your back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.495" end="00:06:37.295" style="s2">Xiaoer, take out your phone and open the</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.895" end="00:06:37.295" style="s2">camera.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.195" end="00:06:52.095" style="s2">Hurry, take a picture.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:07:00.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why go this far?</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.895" end="00:07:01.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiaoer, this is the very last chance I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.195" end="00:07:02.695" style="s2">giving them.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.095" end="00:07:05.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seeing you hurt yourself breaks my</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.695" end="00:07:07.395" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.095" end="00:07:09.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send the photo to Zhewei.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.395" end="00:07:12.095" style="s2">Tell him I got burned while making soup</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.095" end="00:07:12.095" style="s2">for Sheng Min&#39;s health.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.395" end="00:07:18.495" style="s2">If he and Zheli were still don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:21.695" style="s2">about this, then there&#39;s no need for me</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.495" end="00:07:21.695" style="s2">to show them any mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.995" end="00:07:25.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, how could you be so careless?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.995" end="00:07:27.095" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t you just let the servants do</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.495" end="00:07:28.695" style="s2">it? Why try to be a hero?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.095" end="00:07:31.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was burned this badly, and you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.695" end="00:07:34.295" style="s2">have a single word of concern?</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.295" end="00:07:36.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you to be so careless? Hmph, at</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.295" end="00:07:38.795" style="s2">your age, still being so clumsy. Who</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.795" end="00:07:41.095" style="s2">else can you blame? Stay out of the</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.795" end="00:07:42.695" style="s2">kitchen from now on. You&#39;re just clumsy</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.095" end="00:07:45.695" style="s2">and getting in the way.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.695" end="00:07:47.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, mom. Min is pregnant and can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.695" end="00:07:50.895" style="s2">handle any stress. Just stay in your</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.895" end="00:07:50.895" style="s2">room from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.395" end="00:07:59.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In this house, there is no longer any</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.895" end="00:08:00.895" style="s2">place for us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.395" end="00:08:02.395" style="s2">And my mother-in-law, who was always so</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.895" end="00:08:05.095" style="s2">gentle, seemed to have finally reached</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.395" end="00:08:05.095" style="s2">her breaking point.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.595" end="00:08:08.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Min Xiao, are you dead or something?</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.895" end="00:08:09.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.097" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; see my feet are so sore, I can barely</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.697" end="00:08:12.097" style="s2">move?</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.697" end="00:08:14.697" style="s2">Get over here and bring me a basin of</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.097" end="00:08:16.497" style="s2">hot water to soak my feet.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.697" end="00:08:20.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, I&#39;m Xiao family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.497" end="00:08:20.897" style="s2">daughter-in-law, not your personal maid.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.497" end="00:08:24.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, who do you think you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.697" end="00:08:26.797" style="s2">talking to? Min&#39;s carrying my child, my</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.897" end="00:08:29.297" style="s2">flesh and blood, the Xiao family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.797" end="00:08:30.897" style="s2">precious heir. You can&#39;t even have kids.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.297" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">What gives you the right to act like</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.897" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">some young madam?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.397" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You freeloaded off the Xiao family for</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.397" end="00:08:40.097" style="s2">years, and now you won&#39;t even take care</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.497" end="00:08:41.497" style="s2">of me, the one who&#39;s giving them an</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.097" end="00:08:42.897" style="s2">heir.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.497" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what your parents were</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.897" end="00:08:48.597" style="s2">thinking when they let someone as</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.297" end="00:08:48.597" style="s2">ordinary as you marry into this family.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.397" end="00:08:54.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, don&#39;t push it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.497" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, listen up. Your mom&#39;s on</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.197" end="00:09:01.997" style="s2">imported meds that cost tens of</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.297" end="00:09:03.097" style="s2">thousands a day. I&#39;m the one paying for</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.997" end="00:09:05.397" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.097" end="00:09:07.797" style="s2">Say one word against me, and I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.397" end="00:09:10.097" style="s2">the hospital and cut off her meds. Your</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.797" end="00:09:12.497" style="s2">dying mother will be dead by tonight and</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:16.597" style="s2">on her way to the crematorium. You think</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.497" end="00:09:16.597" style="s2">you can talk back to me? You wish.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:20.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll heat the water.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.997" end="00:09:33.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.897" end="00:09:35.197" style="s2">That&#39;s burning hot.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.397" end="00:09:36.597" style="s2">You genius, you can&#39;t even get the water</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.197" end="00:09:39.197" style="s2">temperature right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.597" end="00:09:41.197" style="s2">Were you trying to scald me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.197" end="00:09:43.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, serving people is all you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.197" end="00:09:45.597" style="s2">good for. You spent five years as the</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.697" end="00:09:47.497" style="s2">Xiao family&#39;s young madam and started</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.597" end="00:09:50.597" style="s2">thinking you were hot stuff. Now you</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.497" end="00:09:52.897" style="s2">know your place, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.597" end="00:09:54.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, look at her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.897" end="00:09:57.397" style="s2">Isn&#39;t she just like a well-trained</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.497" end="00:09:57.397" style="s2">little lapdog?</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.296" end="00:10:04.597" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.397" end="00:10:07.197" style="s2">My foot slipped.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.597" end="00:10:08.897" style="s2">But that face of yours belongs</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.197" end="00:10:10.698" style="s2">Maybe it&#39;ll wash that miserable look off</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.897" end="00:10:14.098" style="s2">your for once.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.698" end="00:10:16.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haha, that&#39;s priceless. Ding Xiao,</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.098" end="00:10:17.898" style="s2">looking like that, you&#39;re no better than</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.298" end="00:10:20.398" style="s2">a beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.898" end="00:10:20.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.498" end="00:10:30.398" style="s2">You old hag.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.898" end="00:10:31.598" style="s2">You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.398" end="00:10:32.798" style="s2">I&#39;m carrying the Xiao family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.598" end="00:10:34.498" style="s2">grandchild.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.798" end="00:10:36.998" style="s2">Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.498" end="00:10:39.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, have you lost your mind? You hit</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.998" end="00:10:42.398" style="s2">Min for an outsider? Do I even matter to</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.498" end="00:10:42.398" style="s2">you as your son?</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.298" end="00:10:56.098" style="s2">You dare splash me? I&#39;m your own son,</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.498" end="00:10:56.098" style="s2">and you splash me for an outsider.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.498" end="00:10:59.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what you deserve, you</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.898" end="00:11:00.598" style="s2">ungrateful son.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.398" end="00:11:02.198" style="s2">The Xiao family is a respected</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.598" end="00:11:03.498" style="s2">household, not some den of bandits from</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.198" end="00:11:04.998" style="s2">the old days.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.498" end="00:11:06.198" style="s2">Ding Xiao married into the Xiao family</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.998" end="00:11:07.598" style="s2">properly.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.198" end="00:11:08.898" style="s2">She&#39;s its daughter-in-law, not some</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.598" end="00:11:10.298" style="s2">slave for you to beat and humiliate</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.898" end="00:11:11.898" style="s2">whenever you please.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.298" end="00:11:13.398" style="s2">Zheng Min, you&#39;re just some woman of</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.898" end="00:11:15.298" style="s2">questionable background who hasn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.398" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">married into the family.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.298" end="00:11:18.198" style="s2">You think the baby you&#39;re carrying gives</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.698" end="00:11:19.398" style="s2">you the right to run wild in the Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.198" end="00:11:20.998" style="s2">home?</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.398" end="00:11:22.598" style="s2">That slap was to teach you your place</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.998" end="00:11:24.098" style="s2">and the rules.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.598" end="00:11:25.398" style="s2">Xiao Wei, you keep using your</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.098" end="00:11:27.098" style="s2">mother-in-law&#39;s medical bills to</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.398" end="00:11:30.298" style="s2">threaten your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.098" end="00:11:30.298" style="s2">What kind of man does that make you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.498" end="00:11:38.198" style="s2">Get up, Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.498" end="00:11:41.998" style="s2">Mom&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.198" end="00:11:41.998" style="s2">No one&#39;s laying a finger on you today.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.698" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.598" end="00:11:49.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.698" end="00:11:52.498" style="s2">Mom, Dad won&#39;t agree to this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.098" end="00:11:52.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell your dad to come talk to me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.998" end="00:12:00.898" style="s2">Xiao Wei, look closely.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.898" end="00:12:03.298" style="s2">This is our only trump card.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.898" end="00:12:04.398" style="s2">Xiao Li was had it easy for years.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.298" end="00:12:05.298" style="s2">He&#39;s forgotten who helped him get</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.398" end="00:12:07.398" style="s2">started.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.298" end="00:12:09.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, are you really going to burn</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.398" end="00:12:10.798" style="s2">bridges with them for me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.298" end="00:12:12.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promised your mother I&#39;d protect you</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.798" end="00:12:14.599" style="s2">for the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.598" end="00:12:17.499" style="s2">If I can&#39;t do that, then all these years</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.599" end="00:12:17.499" style="s2">have been for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.099" end="00:12:28.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncles, I didn&#39;t come here today asking</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.299" end="00:12:31.199" style="s2">for a title.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.999" end="00:12:32.999" style="s2">I just want some security for the baby</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.199" end="00:12:35.499" style="s2">I&#39;m carrying.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.999" end="00:12:39.199" style="s2">The baby is innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.499" end="00:12:39.199" style="s2">They shouldn&#39;t be born with nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.499" end="00:12:43.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, you&#39;ve been married into the</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.099" end="00:12:44.999" style="s2">Xiao family for 5 years and haven&#39;t had</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.199" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">a child. Now that the Xiao family</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.999" end="00:12:49.199" style="s2">finally has an heir, know your place.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:50.899" style="s2">Hand over your 5% stake, file for</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.199" end="00:12:51.399" style="s2">divorce, and stop making a fool of</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.899" end="00:12:53.199" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.399" end="00:12:54.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Li Hua, your son is making a scene at a</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.199" end="00:12:55.999" style="s2">shareholders&#39; meeting and forcing his</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.599" end="00:12:57.099" style="s2">wife out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.999" end="00:12:59.299" style="s2">Are you just going to let him</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.099" end="00:13:01.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Xiao family does need an heir.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.299" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">Ding Xiao, be reasonable.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.199" end="00:13:06.099" style="s2">Give up your shares and sign the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.099" end="00:13:07.299" style="s2">papers. It&#39;s best for everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.099" end="00:13:08.999" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.299" end="00:13:10.399" style="s2">She can&#39;t have children.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.999" end="00:13:11.499" style="s2">She shouldn&#39;t be holding on to those</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.399" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">shares.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.499" end="00:13:16.799" style="s2">Ha,</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.299" end="00:13:16.799" style="s2">hurry up and sign. Don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.999" end="00:13:18.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.899" end="00:13:21.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.999" end="00:13:23.699" style="s2">Ding Xiao, don&#39;t push your luck. If you</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.299" end="00:13:27.299" style="s2">don&#39;t sign, your mom will be kicked out</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.699" end="00:13:27.299" style="s2">of the ICU this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.599" end="00:13:32.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put that pen down.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.299" end="00:13:36.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you done yet?</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.799" end="00:13:40.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.999" end="00:13:40.099" style="s2">You don&#39;t run this family.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.499" end="00:13:53.499" style="s2">Xiao Li Hua, have you forgotten what you</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.099" end="00:13:54.699" style="s2">signed when you knelt before my father</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.499" end="00:13:55.899" style="s2">and begged him to invest in the Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.699" end="00:13:58.099" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.899" end="00:14:00.999" style="s2">The agreement is crystal clear.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.099" end="00:14:03.399" style="s2">Crystal clear. 70% of the shares under</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.999" end="00:14:05.499" style="s2">your name, Xiao Li Hua, the voting and</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.399" end="00:14:07.999" style="s2">disposal rights were pledged to the Chin</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.499" end="00:14:10.999" style="s2">family 20 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.999" end="00:14:12.999" style="s2">I, Chin Yu Er Ru, am the trustee.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.999" end="00:14:15.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is that possible? Hasn&#39;t dad always</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.999" end="00:14:15.501" style="s2">been the one in charge of this family?</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.199" end="00:14:17.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.501" end="00:14:21.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; want to, I can call a board meeting and</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.901" end="00:14:21.701" style="s2">have the chairman removed at any time.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.801" end="00:14:25.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Lihua, you really think?</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.201" end="00:14:34.001" style="s2">Xiao, look closely.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.101" end="00:14:35.201" style="s2">This is our only trump card.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.001" end="00:14:36.501" style="s2">Xiao Lihua has been living it up all</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.201" end="00:14:37.601" style="s2">these years.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.501" end="00:14:38.501" style="s2">He&#39;s forgotten who helped him get</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.601" end="00:14:40.701" style="s2">started.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:42.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, are you really going to fall out</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.701" end="00:14:44.101" style="s2">with them for my sake?</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.601" end="00:14:45.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promised your mother I&#39;d protect you</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.101" end="00:14:48.001" style="s2">for the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.901" end="00:14:50.801" style="s2">If I can&#39;t do that, then all these years</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.001" end="00:14:50.801" style="s2">have been for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.401" end="00:15:02.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncles, I didn&#39;t come here today asking</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.701" end="00:15:04.501" style="s2">for a title.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.301" end="00:15:06.301" style="s2">I just want some security for the baby</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.501" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">I&#39;m carrying.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.301" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">The baby is innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.801" end="00:15:12.901" style="s2">They shouldn&#39;t have to be born with</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.301" end="00:15:12.901" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.201" end="00:15:16.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Jiao, you&#39;ve been married into the</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.601" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">family for five years and haven&#39;t had a</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.601" end="00:15:20.901" style="s2">child. Now that the Xiao family finally</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.701" end="00:15:23.201" style="s2">has an heir, know your place. Hand over</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.901" end="00:15:24.601" style="s2">your 5% stake, file for divorce, and</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.201" end="00:15:26.401" style="s2">stop humiliating yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.601" end="00:15:27.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lihua, your son is making a scene at a</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.401" end="00:15:29.301" style="s2">shareholders&#39; meeting and forcing your</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.801" end="00:15:30.401" style="s2">son&#39;s wife out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.301" end="00:15:32.501" style="s2">Are you just going to let him?</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.401" end="00:15:34.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Xiao family does need an heir.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.501" end="00:15:36.501" style="s2">Ding Xiao, take a step back.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.601" end="00:15:37.701" style="s2">Give up your shares and sign the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.501" end="00:15:39.701" style="s2">papers.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.701" end="00:15:41.801" style="s2">It&#39;s best for everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.701" end="00:15:44.401" style="s2">She can&#39;t have children. Holding on to</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.801" end="00:15:46.701" style="s2">those shares really isn&#39;t appropriate.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.401" end="00:15:49.601" style="s2">Ha, just sign already.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.701" end="00:15:49.601" style="s2">Don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.801" end="00:15:55.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it. Sign it. Ding Xiao, don&#39;t push</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.701" end="00:15:57.001" style="s2">your luck. If you don&#39;t sign, your</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.001" end="00:15:59.801" style="s2">mother will be kicked out of the ICU</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.001" end="00:15:59.801" style="s2">this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.101" end="00:16:05.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put that pen down.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.801" end="00:16:09.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, are you done yet?</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:12.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.501" end="00:16:12.901" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to run this family.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.002" end="00:16:25.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua, have you forgotten what you</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.502" end="00:16:26.902" style="s2">signed when you knelt before my father</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.802" end="00:16:28.002" style="s2">and begged him to bail out the Zhao</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.902" end="00:16:30.002" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.002" end="00:16:32.702" style="s2">The agreement is perfectly clear.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.002" end="00:16:35.002" style="s2">The agreement is perfectly clear. 70% of</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.702" end="00:16:36.502" style="s2">the shares in your name, Zhao Lihua,</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.002" end="00:16:38.702" style="s2">along with the voting and disposal</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.502" end="00:16:40.602" style="s2">rights, were pledged to the Jian family</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.702" end="00:16:43.502" style="s2">20 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.602" end="00:16:45.602" style="s2">I, Jian Yueru, am the trustee.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.502" end="00:16:47.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is that possible? Hasn&#39;t Dad always</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.602" end="00:16:50.302" style="s2">been the one in charge of this family?</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.802" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I want to, I can call a board meeting</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.302" end="00:16:57.702" style="s2">anytime and remove the chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.002" end="00:16:57.702" style="s2">Zhao Lihua, you really think</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.102" end="00:17:06.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairwoman Jian, we support whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.802" end="00:17:08.302" style="s2">decide. The company owes its success to</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.702" end="00:17:11.202" style="s2">the Jian family&#39;s investment. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.302" end="00:17:13.702" style="s2">follow your lead, Chairwoman Jian.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.202" end="00:17:16.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jian, that&#39;s impossible. How can my mom</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.702" end="00:17:18.902" style="s2">be the largest shareholder?</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.802" end="00:17:21.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yueru, look at you. We&#39;re husband and</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.902" end="00:17:24.402" style="s2">wife. Why air our dirty laundry in front</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.802" end="00:17:26.902" style="s2">of the shareholders?</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.402" end="00:17:26.902" style="s2">You little brat.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.502" end="00:17:30.602" style="s2">Who told you to pressure Ding Zhao into</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.902" end="00:17:32.502" style="s2">a divorce? Ding Zhao is the Zhao</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.602" end="00:17:34.402" style="s2">family&#39;s lawful wife. No one can take</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.502" end="00:17:36.102" style="s2">her place.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.402" end="00:17:38.402" style="s2">And the rest of you, what are you all</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.102" end="00:17:40.602" style="s2">chiming in for? This meeting is for</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.402" end="00:17:43.102" style="s2">company business, not for meddling in</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.602" end="00:17:46.802" style="s2">the Zhao family&#39;s affairs. All of you</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.102" end="00:17:46.802" style="s2">quiet. Yes, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.502" end="00:17:58.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lihua,</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.802" end="00:18:01.102" style="s2">since you say this is a family matter,</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.002" end="00:18:02.602" style="s2">we&#39;ll settle it at home.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.102" end="00:18:05.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.602" end="00:18:07.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me say it again. The shares for Ding</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.002" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">Zhao were promised by me. If anyone</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.402" end="00:18:11.102" style="s2">brings this up at a shareholders&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.902" end="00:18:13.802" style="s2">meeting again, don&#39;t expect me to go</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.102" end="00:18:13.802" style="s2">easy on you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.202" end="00:18:23.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yueru, are you tired? I had the kitchen</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.103" end="00:18:26.803" style="s2">make some soup. Have a bowl.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.503" end="00:18:26.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, I&#39;ll get you a bowl.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.303" end="00:18:32.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In all these 20 years, I&#39;ve never seen</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.103" end="00:18:34.003" style="s2">my father-in-law bend over backward for</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.603" end="00:18:35.403" style="s2">my mother-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.003" end="00:18:36.703" style="s2">The way he took her coat just then, he</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.403" end="00:18:38.003" style="s2">looked like he was wearing clothes that</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.703" end="00:18:41.403" style="s2">didn&#39;t fit.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.003" end="00:18:41.403" style="s2">He couldn&#39;t stand naturally at all.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.303" end="00:18:51.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, my stomach really hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.203" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">The baby keeps kicking.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.403" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">Am I going to lose it?</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.703" end="00:19:00.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with all the pain? If you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.503" end="00:19:04.003" style="s2">stand, go lie down in the guest room.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.903" end="00:19:04.003" style="s2">Stop putting on an act.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.103" end="00:19:13.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, mom. Min doesn&#39;t know any better.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.503" end="00:19:15.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t mean to.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.903" end="00:19:18.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.403" end="00:19:18.003" style="s2">Have some tea.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.303" end="00:19:25.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.103" end="00:19:25.503" style="s2">You&#39;re getting old and clumsy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.303" end="00:19:32.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.403" end="00:19:33.803" style="s2">I didn&#39;t marry into the show family just</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.003" end="00:19:35.403" style="s2">to be treated like this.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.803" end="00:19:38.003" style="s2">Once the baby&#39;s born, I&#39;ll have a way to</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.403" end="00:19:38.003" style="s2">get what I want.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.103" end="00:19:45.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Wei, I want a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.203" end="00:19:46.803" style="s2">You and Jiang Min can live your lives</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.503" end="00:19:47.903" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.803" end="00:19:48.603" style="s2">I&#39;m done being the Joe family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.903" end="00:19:51.203" style="s2">daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.603" end="00:19:53.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A divorce? Ding Xiao, what are you going</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.203" end="00:19:57.003" style="s2">to do without me? Live on air? Who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.803" end="00:19:58.503" style="s2">going to pay your mom&#39;s medical bills?</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.003" end="00:20:00.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just try me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.503" end="00:20:04.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, who do you think you are? You</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.803" end="00:20:04.303" style="s2">think you can make demands of me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.803" end="00:20:10.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Wei, I&#39;ve put up with you for years.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.703" end="00:20:12.803" style="s2">Did you really think I had no backbone?</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.303" end="00:20:13.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, keep provoking me and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.803" end="00:20:15.103" style="s2">hit you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.303" end="00:20:16.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Xiao wants a divorce, I won&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.103" end="00:20:17.903" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.103" end="00:20:19.803" style="s2">But first, we need to settle every last</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.903" end="00:20:21.603" style="s2">thing the Joe family shares. The</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.803" end="00:20:24.005" style="s2">accounts from all these years, who owes</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.603" end="00:20:25.705" style="s2">whom, and who has to pay whom back.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.005" end="00:20:26.805" style="s2">You can get divorced, but we won&#39;t leave</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.705" end="00:20:29.005" style="s2">the accounts unsettled.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.805" end="00:20:31.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.005" end="00:20:33.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao is like a daughter to me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.405" end="00:20:34.705" style="s2">If you want to divorce her, then leave</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.205" end="00:20:36.705" style="s2">with nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.705" end="00:20:39.105" style="s2">Get out of this house.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.705" end="00:20:41.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I was just angry. Don&#39;t take it</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.105" end="00:20:43.605" style="s2">to heart. Your mom&#39;s still in the</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.205" end="00:20:44.305" style="s2">hospital. We shouldn&#39;t do anything rash</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.605" end="00:20:46.005" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.305" end="00:20:47.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wasn&#39;t what you were saying just</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.005" end="00:20:49.605" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.405" end="00:20:50.505" style="s2">Xiao Wei, I never knew you could be so</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.605" end="00:20:52.205" style="s2">two-faced.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:54.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t thinking straight. Don&#39;t hold</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.205" end="00:20:57.305" style="s2">it against me. I&#39;ll explain things with</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.105" end="00:20:57.305" style="s2">Xiao Min later, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.705" end="00:21:05.505" style="s2">Dad, what if I actually divorce her now</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.105" end="00:21:07.805" style="s2">and get together with Xiao Min?</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.505" end="00:21:10.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you divorce her now, you&#39;d be playing</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.805" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">right into your mother&#39;s hands.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.305" end="00:21:15.305" style="s2">She controls the voting rights. Once you</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.905" end="00:21:17.205" style="s2">divorce, she can kick both of us out in</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.305" end="00:21:18.905" style="s2">one move.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.205" end="00:21:20.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we do? Ding Xiao wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.905" end="00:21:21.905" style="s2">have brought up divorce in front of</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.205" end="00:21:23.705" style="s2">everyone today unless my mom was backing</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:26.605" style="s2">her. That woman thinks she can do</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.705" end="00:21:26.605" style="s2">whatever she wants now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.905" end="00:21:32.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait until Xiao Min has the baby, then</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.905" end="00:21:33.705" style="s2">give it to Ding Xiao to raise and put it</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.605" end="00:21:36.505" style="s2">under her name.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.705" end="00:21:37.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give my child to Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.505" end="00:21:39.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once the baby&#39;s registered under Ding</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.905" end="00:21:41.105" style="s2">Xiao&#39;s name, even if your mother wants</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.705" end="00:21:43.405" style="s2">to protect her, she&#39;ll have to think of</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.105" end="00:21:45.305" style="s2">her grandson and back off. Once she</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.405" end="00:21:47.305" style="s2">does, the company will be back in my</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.305" end="00:21:49.205" style="s2">hands sooner or later. Then I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.305" end="00:21:51.405" style="s2">the shares and the family fortune under</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.205" end="00:21:53.305" style="s2">my control. I can deal with Ding Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.405" end="00:21:55.705" style="s2">however I want. It&#39;ll be a piece of</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.305" end="00:21:55.705" style="s2">cake.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.605" end="00:22:01.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.405" end="00:22:04.205" style="s2">you really are ruthless, but Xiao Min</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.105" end="00:22:05.805" style="s2">won&#39;t agree to this.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.205" end="00:22:07.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s there to worry about?</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.805" end="00:22:10.105" style="s2">We won&#39;t keep the baby with Ding Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.605" end="00:22:10.105" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.305" end="00:22:17.905" style="s2">But you need to pay more attention to</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.905" end="00:22:17.905" style="s2">Xiao Min for now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.705" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let Ding Xiao raise the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.805" end="00:22:26.506" style="s2">Why should someone who can&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.305" end="00:22:28.706" style="s2">children be my baby&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.506" end="00:22:31.106" style="s2">I carry this baby for 10 months.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.706" end="00:22:33.706" style="s2">It&#39;s a part of me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.106" end="00:22:35.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. My mom&#39;s in charge now. The</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.706" end="00:22:37.406" style="s2">second Ding Xiao brought up divorce</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.306" end="00:22:38.906" style="s2">today. Even my dad had to bow and</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.406" end="00:22:41.206" style="s2">scrape.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.906" end="00:22:42.706" style="s2">Keep this up and we&#39;ll both be out on</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.206" end="00:22:45.006" style="s2">the street tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.706" end="00:22:48.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.006" end="00:22:51.706" style="s2">That&#39;s your own child, Shao Wei.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.006" end="00:22:51.706" style="s2">Don&#39;t you care about him at all?</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.006" end="00:22:55.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Care?</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.306" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">My mom has the Xiao group under her</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.806" end="00:22:59.606" style="s2">thumb, all the voting rights and the</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:01.106" style="s2">cash flow. Ding Xiao slapped the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.606" end="00:23:04.006" style="s2">papers in my face in the living room</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.106" end="00:23:06.806" style="s2">today, right in front of my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.006" end="00:23:08.506" style="s2">Get a grip. If we divorce now, my mom</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.806" end="00:23:10.006" style="s2">can leave us with nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.506" end="00:23:11.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s nonsense.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.006" end="00:23:12.506" style="s2">Your mom wouldn&#39;t really throw you out,</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.506" end="00:23:15.406" style="s2">would she?</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.506" end="00:23:15.406" style="s2">You&#39;re her own son.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.806" end="00:23:22.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she does, you won&#39;t even be able to</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.906" end="00:23:22.206" style="s2">afford the cheapest apartment out there.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.906" end="00:23:29.206" style="s2">When the baby&#39;s born, do you expect us</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.106" end="00:23:29.206" style="s2">to live under a bridge and starve?</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.306" end="00:23:33.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.006" end="00:23:38.906" style="s2">if the baby&#39;s registered under her name,</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.206" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">who will he call mom when he grows up?</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.906" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">Will he even know I&#39;m his mother?</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.506" end="00:23:47.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, he&#39;ll only be registered under her</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.506" end="00:23:49.106" style="s2">name on paper. The baby&#39;s being born</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.506" end="00:23:50.906" style="s2">into the Xiao family and will be right</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.106" end="00:23:51.706" style="s2">under our noses every day. Who do you</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.906" end="00:23:53.306" style="s2">think he &#39;ll call mom?</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.706" end="00:23:55.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean we&#39;ll just pretend and fool</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.306" end="00:23:56.606" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.206" end="00:23:58.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once we sweet-talk them into handing</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.606" end="00:24:00.406" style="s2">over the shares, the family assets, and</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.406" end="00:24:02.206" style="s2">all the power my mom has, Ding Xiao will</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.406" end="00:24:05.506" style="s2">be nothing but a useless rag. Then you</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.206" end="00:24:05.506" style="s2">can do whatever you want with her.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.206" end="00:24:08.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.106" end="00:24:20.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Xiao, I thought it over all night.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.606" end="00:24:22.606" style="s2">I&#39;ve made up my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.606" end="00:24:24.306" style="s2">Once Min has the baby, we&#39;ll put the</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.606" end="00:24:26.706" style="s2">child under Xiao&#39;s name and let her</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.306" end="00:24:26.706" style="s2">raise it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.206" end="00:24:31.507" style="s2">That way, no one can gossip about us.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.007" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a few days ago, you called me</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.908" end="00:24:38.807" style="s2">barren in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.107" end="00:24:40.807" style="s2">And now you want me to be your son&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.807" end="00:24:43.307" style="s2">cheap substitute, mom?</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.807" end="00:24:45.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, I was just angry. I didn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.307" end="00:24:46.408" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.107" end="00:24:49.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were angry?</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.408" end="00:24:52.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was a jerk. I wronged you. Please</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:52.007" style="s2">forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.307" end="00:25:00.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad you feel that way.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.908" end="00:25:00.908" style="s2">I&#39;m fine with it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.007" end="00:25:03.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.107" end="00:25:15.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you worked it out?</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.408" end="00:25:15.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have, dad.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.408" end="00:25:21.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you&#39;ve all made up your minds,</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.107" end="00:25:23.607" style="s2">Xiao and I have no objections either.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.007" end="00:25:26.507" style="s2">What about Zhengmin?</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.607" end="00:25:28.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no objections either.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.507" end="00:25:30.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are Don&#39;t you see how harmonious our</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.807" end="00:25:33.207" style="s2">family is?</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.507" end="00:25:33.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.908" end="00:25:37.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why did you agree so quickly?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.207" end="00:25:41.007" style="s2">If that baby goes under my name, won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.807" end="00:25:41.007" style="s2">that be exactly what they want?</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.107" end="00:25:45.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, think about it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.307" end="00:25:47.307" style="s2">They&#39;re rushing to put the baby under</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.807" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">your name.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.307" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">Something&#39;s definitely up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.807" end="00:25:58.307" style="s2">There&#39;s something else.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.507" end="00:26:00.307" style="s2">Did you notice?</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.307" end="00:26:01.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.307" end="00:26:03.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way your father-in-law looks at</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.707" end="00:26:05.307" style="s2">Zhengmin&#39;s belly.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.507" end="00:26:07.007" style="s2">Why would a grandfather care so much</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.307" end="00:26:09.507" style="s2">about his daughter-in-law&#39;s pregnancy?</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.007" end="00:26:09.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhengmin.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.307" end="00:26:19.807" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.908" end="00:26:25.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Zheng, you should be careful. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.207" end="00:26:27.507" style="s2">just passed the young madam&#39;s room and</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.908" end="00:26:31.307" style="s2">heard her asking the maid which hospital</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.507" end="00:26:31.307" style="s2">you go to for your prenatal checkups.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.007" end="00:26:34.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.309" end="00:26:35.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; she ask about that?</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.909" end="00:26:38.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.809" end="00:26:39.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s jealous. She can&#39;t have kids, so</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.309" end="00:26:42.309" style="s2">she can&#39;t stand seeing anyone else</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.909" end="00:26:42.309" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.309" end="00:26:46.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for the heads up, Mama Jiang.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.509" end="00:26:49.509" style="s2">Let me know right away if you hear</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.809" end="00:26:49.509" style="s2">anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.109" end="00:26:56.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Jiang, call me again next time you</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.909" end="00:26:56.909" style="s2">need a favor like this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.509" end="00:27:03.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Min, here. Eat slowly. I had this</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.109" end="00:27:05.909" style="s2">bird&#39;s nest brought all the way from</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.709" end="00:27:07.309" style="s2">Indonesia. It&#39;s perfect for pregnant</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.909" end="00:27:09.709" style="s2">women.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.309" end="00:27:11.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I can&#39;t eat much more.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.709" end="00:27:13.509" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this too much?</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.509" end="00:27:16.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I also went to see the finest cribs</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.509" end="00:27:18.509" style="s2">today. It&#39;s imported solid wood. When it</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.509" end="00:27:19.809" style="s2">arrives tomorrow, I&#39;ll put it together</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.509" end="00:27:21.609" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.809" end="00:27:23.209" style="s2">I even hired a prenatal music expert</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.609" end="00:27:25.309" style="s2">from overseas and picked out 30</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.209" end="00:27:26.709" style="s2">classical pieces. Starting tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.309" end="00:27:30.609" style="s2">we&#39;ll play them once each morning and</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.709" end="00:27:30.609" style="s2">evening. It&#39;ll help the baby develop.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.109" end="00:27:36.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did Jiang Min&#39;s prenatal checkup go</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.709" end="00:27:37.109" style="s2">today? What did the doctor say? Were all</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.109" end="00:27:39.409" style="s2">her results normal?</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.109" end="00:27:41.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t worry. I went with her. The</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.409" end="00:27:43.309" style="s2">doctor said the baby&#39;s developing</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.109" end="00:27:45.909" style="s2">wonderfully. All the results are better</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.309" end="00:27:49.009" style="s2">than average. She&#39;s Jiang after all. Of</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.909" end="00:27:49.009" style="s2">course it&#39;ll be strong.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.009" end="00:27:54.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I saw it all clearly at dinner</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.109" end="00:27:56.209" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.509" end="00:27:58.409" style="s2">Jiang Wei was so worried about that</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.209" end="00:27:59.809" style="s2">baby, you&#39;d think his own life depended</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.409" end="00:28:02.609" style="s2">on it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.809" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">But Jiang Min looked really guilty.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.609" end="00:28:06.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.509" end="00:28:07.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad was way too concerned about Jiang</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.009" end="00:28:09.009" style="s2">Min&#39;s pregnancy, too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.809" end="00:28:11.309" style="s2">It was excessive.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.009" end="00:28:15.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one does anything without a reason.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.309" end="00:28:16.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.009" end="00:28:18.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, find an excuse to go to the</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.709" end="00:28:20.009" style="s2">hospital tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.509" end="00:28:22.209" style="s2">They think this baby is their ticket to</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.009" end="00:28:23.709" style="s2">turn things around, right?</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.209" end="00:28:26.309" style="s2">Then let&#39;s find out what that ticket is</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.709" end="00:28:26.309" style="s2">really worth.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.709" end="00:28:33.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, it&#39;s all arranged.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.909" end="00:28:35.510" style="s2">Dr. Lu, the deputy head of obstetrics</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.710" end="00:28:37.110" style="s2">and gynecology here is Jiang Min&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.510" end="00:28:39.110" style="s2">prenatal doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.110" end="00:28:42.510" style="s2">I&#39;ve already spoken with her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.110" end="00:28:42.510" style="s2">She&#39;s waiting for us in her office.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.710" end="00:28:51.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Xiao, Lao Xiao, what brings you</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.110" end="00:28:53.310" style="s2">here? Director Xiao finds out.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.310" end="00:28:54.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Lu, let&#39;s be frank.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.310" end="00:28:56.110" style="s2">I came to take a look at Jiang Min&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.710" end="00:28:56.810" style="s2">patient file.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.110" end="00:28:59.110" style="s2">That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.810" end="00:29:00.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid I can&#39;t do that. Mrs. Xiao,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.110" end="00:29:02.210" style="s2">hospital policy forbids us from</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.910" end="00:29:05.910" style="s2">disclosing a patient&#39;s private</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.210" end="00:29:05.910" style="s2">information. It would be illegal.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.510" end="00:29:13.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Lu, if we uncover anything, do you</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.310" end="00:29:13.610" style="s2">think you can get away with it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.910" end="00:29:23.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See for yourselves. When Jiang Min</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.010" end="00:29:25.810" style="s2">registered her pregnancy, she said she</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.110" end="00:29:27.810" style="s2">was 12 weeks along. But when I performed</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.810" end="00:29:29.810" style="s2">the ultrasound, the fetus was clearly</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.810" end="00:29:31.210" style="s2">measuring much larger.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.810" end="00:29:33.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Larger?</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.210" end="00:29:35.410" style="s2">By how much?</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.310" end="00:29:37.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least two weeks. So when she</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.410" end="00:29:39.810" style="s2">registered, she was actually 14 weeks</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.510" end="00:29:43.910" style="s2">pregnant. She deliberately pushed her</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.810" end="00:29:43.910" style="s2">conception date back by two weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.910" end="00:29:51.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she was actually 14 weeks pregnant,</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.010" end="00:29:52.910" style="s2">then Xiao Wei wasn&#39;t even in the country</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.610" end="00:29:54.210" style="s2">during the three weeks she could have</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.910" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">conceived.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.210" end="00:29:59.210" style="s2">He was on a business trip in Europe, in</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.010" end="00:29:59.210" style="s2">France for all three weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.610" end="00:30:04.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam, look at these dates.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.410" end="00:30:05.910" style="s2">The week before Xiao Wei left and the</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.210" end="00:30:08.610" style="s2">week after he returned don&#39;t match the</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.910" end="00:30:11.210" style="s2">conception window at all.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.610" end="00:30:13.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Xiao, I really had no idea. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.210" end="00:30:15.510" style="s2">it was a system error. Maybe the dates</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.610" end="00:30:18.010" style="s2">were off or maybe the fetus was just</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.510" end="00:30:20.410" style="s2">measuring large.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.010" end="00:30:20.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An error?</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.610" end="00:30:27.010" style="s2">Sure, there&#39;s some margin of error in</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.610" end="00:30:31.110" style="s2">medicine, but not a whole three weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.010" end="00:30:31.110" style="s2">Dr. Lu, do you think we&#39;re idiots?</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.810" end="00:30:35.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want a DNA test.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.810" end="00:30:37.412" style="s2">I&#39;ll use Xiao Wei&#39;s sample to establish</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.510" end="00:30:39.112" style="s2">paternity with this baby.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.412" end="00:30:41.812" style="s2">If the baby isn&#39;t Joe Wei&#39;s, then this</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.112" end="00:30:41.812" style="s2">whole charade.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.812" end="00:30:50.012" style="s2">Min, aren&#39;t you going to the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.512" end="00:30:51.712" style="s2">for your routine prenatal checkup today?</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.012" end="00:30:54.512" style="s2">I&#39;m free today.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.712" end="00:30:54.512" style="s2">I&#39;ll go with you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.912" end="00:30:58.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.612" end="00:30:59.112" style="s2">My husband said he&#39;d pick me up after</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.112" end="00:31:00.112" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.112" end="00:31:01.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to put you out.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.112" end="00:31:03.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re family.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.512" end="00:31:05.712" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about putting me out.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.512" end="00:31:07.712" style="s2">Joe Wei has plenty to do at work.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.712" end="00:31:08.912" style="s2">Don&#39;t make him go out of his way.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.712" end="00:31:11.612" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.912" end="00:31:11.612" style="s2">The car&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.112" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Zhong, I didn&#39;t sleep well last</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.912" end="00:31:17.212" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.912" end="00:31:18.612" style="s2">I remember the Tang and Tang in the</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.212" end="00:31:20.212" style="s2">south have specially prepared bird&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.612" end="00:31:21.612" style="s2">nest to help you sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.212" end="00:31:22.212" style="s2">Go there now and bring me back two</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.612" end="00:31:24.912" style="s2">boxes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.212" end="00:31:27.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, well, the south side is dozens of</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:30.012" style="s2">miles away. It&#39;ll take half the day to</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.412" end="00:31:31.912" style="s2">go and come back. What about things here</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.012" end="00:31:34.312" style="s2">at home what?</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.912" end="00:31:35.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As the lady of this house, do I not even</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.312" end="00:31:38.412" style="s2">have the right to send you out to buy</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.912" end="00:31:38.412" style="s2">medicine?</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.512" end="00:31:46.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.912" end="00:31:49.112" style="s2">It&#39;s just a routine extra test during</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.612" end="00:31:49.112" style="s2">pregnancy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.812" end="00:31:56.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Min, what are you doing? You&#39;re carrying</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.512" end="00:31:59.912" style="s2">my precious baby boy. Who upset you so</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.812" end="00:31:59.912" style="s2">badly that you want to leave?</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.212" end="00:32:04.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, please let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.212" end="00:32:06.112" style="s2">I just can&#39;t live in this house anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.612" end="00:32:08.412" style="s2">At the hospital today, your sister</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.112" end="00:32:10.112" style="s2">didn&#39;t care if I lived or died.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.412" end="00:32:11.212" style="s2">She held me down and made them draw my</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.112" end="00:32:13.012" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.212" end="00:32:14.412" style="s2">Look, my arm&#39;s all red from where she</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.012" end="00:32:15.612" style="s2">grabbed me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.412" end="00:32:17.312" style="s2">Ding Xiao showed up with people out of</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.612" end="00:32:18.712" style="s2">nowhere and cornered me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.312" end="00:32:19.712" style="s2">She insisted on taking a whole tube of</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.712" end="00:32:21.412" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.712" end="00:32:22.812" style="s2">Did she figure out that the baby isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.412" end="00:32:23.912" style="s2">Joe Wei&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.812" end="00:32:27.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.912" end="00:32:27.612" style="s2">I have to pin this on someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.312" end="00:32:31.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, just because you can&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.712" end="00:32:32.812" style="s2">children, you can&#39;t stand seeing anyone</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.212" end="00:32:34.712" style="s2">else have one. What right did you have</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.812" end="00:32:38.312" style="s2">to force Min to give blood? If anything</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.712" end="00:32:42.013" style="s2">happens to her, I&#39;ll make you pay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.312" end="00:32:42.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Wei, that&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.213" end="00:32:45.913" style="s2">You keep going on about her being unable</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.613" end="00:32:47.213" style="s2">to have children.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.913" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">Is that how the eldest son of the Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.213" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">family was raised?</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.313" end="00:32:53.213" style="s2">Xiao is your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.113" end="00:32:54.913" style="s2">You&#39;re saying this to her in front of</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.213" end="00:32:57.813" style="s2">me, all for a woman who hasn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.913" end="00:32:57.813" style="s2">married into the family.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.713" end="00:33:03.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, she was the one who bullied Min</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.513" end="00:33:05.713" style="s2">first. Min&#39;s pregnant, and Ding Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.413" end="00:33:08.013" style="s2">still forced her to get her blood drawn.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.713" end="00:33:10.513" style="s2">She was clearly trying to kill my son.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.013" end="00:33:12.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, please don&#39;t blame young master.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.513" end="00:33:13.413" style="s2">It&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.113" end="00:33:15.613" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.413" end="00:33:18.113" style="s2">I&#39;ll go back to my dump of a rental.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.613" end="00:33:19.813" style="s2">I won&#39;t stay here and bother any of you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.113" end="00:33:21.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody, stop right there. What is all</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.813" end="00:33:23.613" style="s2">this ruckus? Have some decorum.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.613" end="00:33:25.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, please do something. Ding Xiao had</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.613" end="00:33:27.613" style="s2">people hold Min down and force her to</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.513" end="00:33:28.713" style="s2">give blood. Now Min is ready to leave</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.613" end="00:33:31.113" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.713" end="00:33:32.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, it&#39;s just a blood test.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.113" end="00:33:35.313" style="s2">Why are you making such a fuss that you</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.713" end="00:33:35.313" style="s2">want to leave?</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.913" end="00:33:40.013" style="s2">You&#39;re carrying the Xiao family&#39;s child,</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.813" end="00:33:41.313" style="s2">packing your bags at the drop of a hat.</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.013" end="00:33:43.213" style="s2">Is that how you threaten the Xiao family</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.313" end="00:33:46.013" style="s2">with a baby?</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.213" end="00:33:48.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I wasn&#39;t. I was just terrified.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.013" end="00:33:50.513" style="s2">Big sister was so scary at the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.213" end="00:33:52.813" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.513" end="00:33:54.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, I know you&#39;re sensible, but next</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.813" end="00:33:59.113" style="s2">time you take her to the hospital for</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.413" end="00:34:00.513" style="s2">tests, let me know first. After all,</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.113" end="00:34:02.313" style="s2">the child Jiang Min is carrying is the</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.513" end="00:34:04.613" style="s2">Xiao family&#39;s first grandson. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.313" end="00:34:06.313" style="s2">risk anything happening to him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.613" end="00:34:08.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this child is precious and there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.313" end="00:34:09.713" style="s2">nothing to hide, then a test won&#39;t be a</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.313" end="00:34:11.513" style="s2">problem.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.713" end="00:34:13.413" style="s2">The real worry is someone has a guilty</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.513" end="00:34:16.113" style="s2">conscience and is afraid to even give a</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.413" end="00:34:17.213" style="s2">blood sample.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.113" end="00:34:18.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.213" end="00:34:20.013" style="s2">Xiao is the Xiao family&#39;s lawful young</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.913" end="00:34:21.313" style="s2">madam.</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.013" end="00:34:22.913" style="s2">She shouldn&#39;t need your permission as</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.313" end="00:34:24.313" style="s2">her father-in-law to teach an ignorant</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.913" end="00:34:27.313" style="s2">woman a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.313" end="00:34:27.313" style="s2">This matter is closed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.413" end="00:34:33.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the test results are ready.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.713" end="00:34:35.013" style="s2">I &#39;m going out.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.813" end="00:34:36.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.013" end="00:34:37.713" style="s2">Be careful on the way.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.613" end="00:34:39.413" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.713" end="00:34:40.913" style="s2">The sky isn&#39;t going to fall.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.413" end="00:34:42.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, this is the Forensic Appraisal</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.913" end="00:34:45.114" style="s2">Center.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.014" end="00:34:45.114" style="s2">I&#39;m here to pick up a report.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.414" end="00:34:54.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Date of birth.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.414" end="00:34:56.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The results support Joe Wei as the</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.814" end="00:34:58.514" style="s2">biological father of Jiang Min&#39;s unborn</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.714" end="00:34:59.914" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.514" end="00:35:01.414" style="s2">That&#39;s not right.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.914" end="00:35:03.214" style="s2">When I submitted the samples to keep</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.414" end="00:35:04.914" style="s2">anyone from finding out, I specifically</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.214" end="00:35:08.114" style="s2">had Lao Zhao change the sample numbers</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.914" end="00:35:09.414" style="s2">to DS001 and DS002.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.114" end="00:35:12.314" style="s2">The numbers on this report aren&#39;t the</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.414" end="00:35:12.314" style="s2">ones I submitted at all.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.114" end="00:35:21.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can guard against everything, but</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.714" end="00:35:22.714" style="s2">you can&#39;t guard against a traitor in</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.914" end="00:35:24.514" style="s2">your own home.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.714" end="00:35:26.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she swapped in a fake report that</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.514" end="00:35:28.514" style="s2">supports paternity,</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.414" end="00:35:30.914" style="s2">then the real report must say something</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.514" end="00:35:33.314" style="s2">they&#39;re afraid of.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.914" end="00:35:34.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, if they want to play games, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.314" end="00:35:36.514" style="s2">play them all the way.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.814" end="00:35:38.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time, we won&#39;t let anyone else</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.514" end="00:35:41.114" style="s2">handle the samples.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.114" end="00:35:41.114" style="s2">We&#39;ll run the test again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.614" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhao, the hospital should still have</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.114" end="00:35:48.414" style="s2">the backup blood sample Jiang Min left</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.214" end="00:35:49.514" style="s2">when she registered, right?</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.414" end="00:35:50.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.514" end="00:35:52.414" style="s2">The young madam gave the order.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.714" end="00:35:54.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take some people and get the original</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.414" end="00:35:57.214" style="s2">blood sample from the hospital now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.814" end="00:35:58.814" style="s2">Send it to another testing center.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.214" end="00:35:59.314" style="s2">I refuse to believe they can mess it up</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.814" end="00:36:01.614" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.314" end="00:36:01.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.314" end="00:36:13.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Lu, hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.014" end="00:36:15.014" style="s2">Destroy every backup blood sample and</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.614" end="00:36:16.614" style="s2">all the original electronic records I</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.014" end="00:36:17.114" style="s2">left at the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.614" end="00:36:19.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.114" end="00:36:21.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Jiang, that&#39;s against regulations.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.414" end="00:36:23.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The electronic system has backups.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.314" end="00:36:25.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care about your regulations.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.914" end="00:36:26.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Ding Zhao finds out, we&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.614" end="00:36:28.414" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.214" end="00:36:30.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s done, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.414" end="00:36:32.014" style="s2">The hospital sealed the backup blood</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.114" end="00:36:35.414" style="s2">sample Jiang Min left when she first</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.014" end="00:36:38.114" style="s2">registered and handed it to our people.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.414" end="00:36:41.314" style="s2">That sample is definitely the original.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.114" end="00:36:41.314" style="s2">No one has tampered with it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.114" end="00:36:50.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I personally saved the hair Joe way</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.016" end="00:36:52.316" style="s2">dropped in the bathroom this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.416" end="00:36:54.016" style="s2">This time we&#39;ll send it straight to the</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.316" end="00:36:54.716" style="s2">most reputable testing center in the</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.016" end="00:36:56.416" style="s2">province.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.716" end="00:36:58.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good work.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.416" end="00:37:00.216" style="s2">Jiang Min thought a switched report</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.216" end="00:37:02.616" style="s2">would fool us.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.216" end="00:37:03.816" style="s2">She had no idea she just exposed her</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.616" end="00:37:06.516" style="s2">hand.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.816" end="00:37:08.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, there&#39;s something else.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.516" end="00:37:10.516" style="s2">We followed up on the call records Jiang</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.516" end="00:37:12.516" style="s2">Min&#39;s been deleting lately</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.516" end="00:37:14.116" style="s2">and found that for the past 3 months</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.516" end="00:37:16.916" style="s2">she&#39;s been in constant contact with a</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.116" end="00:37:18.316" style="s2">man named Abin.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.916" end="00:37:19.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Abin?</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.316" end="00:37:20.816" style="s2">Isn&#39;t he listed in her phone as her</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.816" end="00:37:23.016" style="s2">cousin?</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.816" end="00:37:24.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her cousin?</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.016" end="00:37:26.116" style="s2">We checked Jiang Min&#39;s household</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.116" end="00:37:27.216" style="s2">registration and family records.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.116" end="00:37:30.116" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t have a cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.216" end="00:37:32.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Abin is her ex from her modeling days.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.116" end="00:37:34.616" style="s2">He just came back from overseas 6 months</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.016" end="00:37:35.516" style="s2">ago and now he works as a male model at</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.616" end="00:37:37.216" style="s2">a nightclub.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.516" end="00:37:39.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An ex?</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.216" end="00:37:41.316" style="s2">A male model in debt and a woman brought</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.716" end="00:37:43.416" style="s2">into a wealthy family because she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.316" end="00:37:44.516" style="s2">pregnant. Why is she secretly supporting</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.416" end="00:37:47.516" style="s2">her ex?</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.516" end="00:37:49.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, are you saying</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.516" end="00:37:52.716" style="s2">the baby might not only be Joe Wei&#39;s but</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.816" end="00:37:54.716" style="s2">could even be this male model&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.716" end="00:37:57.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s a scandal.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.716" end="00:37:59.716" style="s2">For this woman, Joe Wei even went so far</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.016" end="00:38:01.516" style="s2">as to force his wife into a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.716" end="00:38:02.916" style="s2">But this could backfire and he might end</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.516" end="00:38:05.316" style="s2">up raising another man&#39;s kid like a</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:05.316" style="s2">fool.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.916" end="00:38:12.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Joe, put Abin under the highest</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.116" end="00:38:13.716" style="s2">level of surveillance immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.016" end="00:38:16.016" style="s2">I want every detail of his recent</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.716" end="00:38:18.516" style="s2">meetings with Jiang Min, including which</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.016" end="00:38:19.616" style="s2">hotels they went to and what they said.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.516" end="00:38:20.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.616" end="00:38:22.116" style="s2">madam.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.716" end="00:38:24.516" style="s2">I &#39;ll take care of it right away.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.116" end="00:38:26.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, don&#39;t rush.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.516" end="00:38:28.916" style="s2">We have Joe Wei&#39;s sample and Jiang Min&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.616" end="00:38:30.616" style="s2">original blood sample now.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.916" end="00:38:32.716" style="s2">Once we have the results in black and</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.616" end="00:38:34.216" style="s2">white, no one in the Joe family will get</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.716" end="00:38:36.816" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.216" end="00:38:36.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um, hum.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.016" end="00:38:41.516" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.216" end="00:38:42.716" style="s2">Dad&#39;s been watching me like a hawk</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.516" end="00:38:45.016" style="s2">lately.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.716" end="00:38:47.416" style="s2">Yesterday I even saw him pacing outside</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.016" end="00:38:48.717" style="s2">Jiang Min&#39;s guest room.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.416" end="00:38:50.217" style="s2">What if he finds out we&#39;re doing a</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.717" end="00:38:52.817" style="s2">second test?</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.217" end="00:38:55.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why, Lao Zhao, you have to drive</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.817" end="00:38:57.817" style="s2">to the provincial capital yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.817" end="00:39:00.017" style="s2">Avoid Zhao Li Hua&#39;s people.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:39:01.117" style="s2">Don&#39;t take the highway, no matter what.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.017" end="00:39:01.617" style="s2">And don&#39;t alert any of the guards at</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.117" end="00:39:03.217" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.617" end="00:39:05.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.217" end="00:39:06.417" style="s2">My life belongs to the Chen family.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.417" end="00:39:07.917" style="s2">I&#39;ll take the back roads through the</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.417" end="00:39:08.917" style="s2">mountains if I have to, but I&#39;ll get the</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.917" end="00:39:11.717" style="s2">samples there safely.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.917" end="00:39:13.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hang in there a few more days, Zhao.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.717" end="00:39:15.917" style="s2">When the results come in, I&#39;ll make sure</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.517" end="00:39:19.417" style="s2">Jiang Min and the child she&#39;s carrying</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.917" end="00:39:19.417" style="s2">never get back on their feet.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.317" end="00:39:22.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are things coming along with Ding</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.717" end="00:39:24.417" style="s2">Zhao?</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.517" end="00:39:26.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has to sign that custody agreement</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.417" end="00:39:28.217" style="s2">within three days.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.017" end="00:39:30.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, do we really need to rush this? The</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.217" end="00:39:31.317" style="s2">baby will be registered under her name</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.417" end="00:39:33.217" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.317" end="00:39:34.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be naive. We can&#39;t leave this to</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.217" end="00:39:37.117" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.817" end="00:39:40.117" style="s2">Once Ding Zhao signs the agreement, the</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.117" end="00:39:42.517" style="s2">law will tie her to that child for good.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.117" end="00:39:45.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she won&#39;t sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.517" end="00:39:48.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the only way Chen Yu Er&#39;s 20%</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.117" end="00:39:50.317" style="s2">stake could legally go to the child. Go</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.017" end="00:39:52.817" style="s2">now. Make her sign no matter what it</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.317" end="00:39:52.817" style="s2">takes.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.317" end="00:39:59.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, look. The lawyer drew up this</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.717" end="00:40:03.517" style="s2">agreement. Once you sign, you&#39;ll be the</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.317" end="00:40:03.517" style="s2">only legal mother of Min&#39;s baby.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.117" end="00:40:08.817" style="s2">All the Zhao family assets will belong</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.717" end="00:40:08.817" style="s2">to this child one day.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.217" end="00:40:13.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.417" end="00:40:16.117" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.917" end="00:40:17.617" style="s2">Zhao Wei, your family sure is desperate</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.117" end="00:40:18.817" style="s2">to make me the sucker who raises this</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.617" end="00:40:20.417" style="s2">kid.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.817" end="00:40:22.217" style="s2">But I hope you&#39;re still this happy after</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.417" end="00:40:24.317" style="s2">the baby is born.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.217" end="00:40:26.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your shares will go to this child one</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.317" end="00:40:27.617" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.317" end="00:40:30.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s hope you still feel that way</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.617" end="00:40:30.617" style="s2">after the baby is born.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.717" end="00:40:34.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, the second DNA test results are</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.717" end="00:40:35.917" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.717" end="00:40:37.117" style="s2">We&#39;ve also looked into A Bin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.917" end="00:40:38.717" style="s2">background.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.117" end="00:40:40.417" style="s2">The report rules out Zhao Wei as the</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.717" end="00:40:41.917" style="s2">father of the fetus.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.417" end="00:40:43.917" style="s2">And A Bin.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.917" end="00:40:46.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Zhao, I&#39;ll pick up the report myself</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.917" end="00:40:46.317" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.817" end="00:40:50.918" style="s2">Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.817" end="00:40:50.918" style="s2">I&#39;m here to pick up the report.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.278" end="00:40:58.298" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.518" end="00:41:02.918" style="s2">Based on the information provided in DNA</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.618" end="00:41:05.118" style="s2">analysis, Joe Wei is excluded as the</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.918" end="00:41:06.518" style="s2">biological father of Jiang Min&#39;s unborn</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.118" end="00:41:08.618" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.518" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">So it&#39;s really not his.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.618" end="00:41:13.718" style="s2">If it&#39;s not Joe Wei&#39;s and Joe Li Hua is</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.418" end="00:41:16.718" style="s2">so worried, could the baby be Joe Li Hua</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.718" end="00:41:16.718" style="s2">and Jiang Min&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.118" end="00:41:23.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, did you get the report?</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.718" end="00:41:25.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I got it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:27.018" style="s2">The report is clear.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.218" end="00:41:28.918" style="s2">Joe Wei is excluded.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.018" end="00:41:30.518" style="s2">Mom, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.918" end="00:41:31.218" style="s2">Do we slap the report in their faces and</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.518" end="00:41:32.518" style="s2">expose them?</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.218" end="00:41:33.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.518" end="00:41:34.918" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.218" end="00:41:36.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how long do we wait?</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.918" end="00:41:36.918" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid something could happen if we</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.118" end="00:41:38.218" style="s2">wait too long.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.918" end="00:41:39.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Li Hua has deep roots in the</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.218" end="00:41:41.518" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.318" end="00:41:42.818" style="s2">This report alone won&#39;t prove much.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.518" end="00:41:44.318" style="s2">Once the baby is born, we&#39;ll get a</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.818" end="00:41:44.918" style="s2">sample from Joe Li Hua and run another</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.318" end="00:41:46.118" style="s2">test.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.918" end="00:41:47.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.118" end="00:41:48.318" style="s2">I&#39;ll do as you say.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.018" end="00:41:49.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll put the report away and keep the</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.318" end="00:41:52.918" style="s2">evidence safe.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.918" end="00:41:52.918" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll head straight home.</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.918" end="00:42:01.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.018" end="00:42:02.418" style="s2">didn&#39;t you say you were going to the</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.118" end="00:42:03.518" style="s2">office today?</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.418" end="00:42:04.118" style="s2">What are you doing at the testing</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.518" end="00:42:06.318" style="s2">center?</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.118" end="00:42:07.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Taking care of something personal.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:08.918" style="s2">What&#39;s it to you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.718" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">You&#39;re heavily pregnant and running</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.918" end="00:42:13.418" style="s2">around.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:13.418" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you worried you&#39;ll harm the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.618" end="00:42:19.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that in your hand?</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.618" end="00:42:20.718" style="s2">Is that my test report?</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.418" end="00:42:22.118" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:23.218" style="s2">You&#39;ve been investigating me behind my</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.118" end="00:42:25.918" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.218" end="00:42:25.918" style="s2">Give me the report.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.318" end="00:42:31.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, the truth always comes out.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.818" end="00:42:33.618" style="s2">You know better than anyone whose baby</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.818" end="00:42:36.318" style="s2">you&#39;re carrying.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.618" end="00:42:37.818" style="s2">Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.318" end="00:42:40.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.818" end="00:42:40.618" style="s2">or I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.718" end="00:42:46.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, move.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.018" end="00:42:48.718" style="s2">You know exactly what&#39;s in there.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.918" end="00:42:50.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re talking nonsense.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.718" end="00:42:52.418" style="s2">You investigated me behind my back just</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.318" end="00:42:52.620" style="s2">to ruin me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.418" end="00:42:54.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.620" end="00:42:56.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; cheated on Joe Wei and now you think you</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.620" end="00:42:58.420" style="s2">can use this baby to steal the Joe</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.520" end="00:43:00.020" style="s2">family&#39;s fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.420" end="00:43:00.520" style="s2">How long do you think you can keep this</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.020" end="00:43:01.920" style="s2">hidden?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.520" end="00:43:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me the bag.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.920" end="00:43:05.220" style="s2">You can&#39;t even have children.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.920" end="00:43:07.520" style="s2">What gives you the right to destroy</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.220" end="00:43:09.020" style="s2">everything I have?</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.520" end="00:43:10.520" style="s2">The baby I&#39;m carrying is the Joe</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.020" end="00:43:12.320" style="s2">family&#39;s heir.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.520" end="00:43:15.720" style="s2">Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.320" end="00:43:17.520" style="s2">You have no right to investigate me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.720" end="00:43:19.720" style="s2">Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.520" end="00:43:21.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.720" end="00:43:22.820" style="s2">We&#39;re at the top of the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.020" end="00:43:24.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have lost my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.820" end="00:43:26.120" style="s2">You drove me to this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.520" end="00:43:28.720" style="s2">Give me the report.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.120" end="00:43:28.720" style="s2">Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.620" end="00:43:46.120" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.720" end="00:43:47.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.120" end="00:43:49.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I caught Ding Xiao picking up the test</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.520" end="00:43:50.920" style="s2">results at the city testing center.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.620" end="00:43:51.920" style="s2">I pushed her down the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.920" end="00:43:53.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.920" end="00:43:54.520" style="s2">Did she see the test results?</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.720" end="00:43:56.820" style="s2">How is she now?</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.520" end="00:43:58.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s still breathing.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.820" end="00:43:59.220" style="s2">Should we just</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.020" end="00:44:01.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.220" end="00:44:02.520" style="s2">If Ding Xiao dies now, Qin Yu Wei will</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.420" end="00:44:04.220" style="s2">tear me apart.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.520" end="00:44:05.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.220" end="00:44:07.120" style="s2">If Ding Xiao lives long enough to tell</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.720" end="00:44:08.520" style="s2">the secret, we&#39;re both dead.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.120" end="00:44:10.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.520" end="00:44:12.320" style="s2">When enough time has passed, call an</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.320" end="00:44:14.720" style="s2">ambulance.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.320" end="00:44:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.420" end="00:44:24.120" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.420" end="00:44:25.620" style="s2">Is this 911?</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.120" end="00:44:26.720" style="s2">Someone, help.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.620" end="00:44:28.020" style="s2">Help.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.720" end="00:44:29.520" style="s2">My sister.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.020" end="00:44:31.120" style="s2">My sister fell down the stairs at the</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.520" end="00:44:32.720" style="s2">city testing center.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.120" end="00:44:33.320" style="s2">There&#39;s so much blood.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.720" end="00:44:35.820" style="s2">Please hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.320" end="00:44:37.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, please stay calm. First, tell me</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.820" end="00:44:39.420" style="s2">the address. Is the injured person</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.520" end="00:44:40.920" style="s2">breathing? Is she conscious?</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.420" end="00:44:42.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.920" end="00:44:43.220" style="s2">I don&#39;t think she&#39;s breathing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.620" end="00:44:45.520" style="s2">Please hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.220" end="00:44:48.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please stay calm. Don&#39;t move her. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.520" end="00:44:48.120" style="s2">on our way.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.220" end="00:44:54.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, this time you&#39;ll pay for it</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.320" end="00:44:54.620" style="s2">one way or another.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.721" end="00:45:01.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Think about how you&#39;ll explain</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.321" end="00:45:03.421" style="s2">this to Qin Yuru when she gets here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.821" end="00:45:04.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only did it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.421" end="00:45:08.121" style="s2">If Ding Xiao hadn&#39;t found out</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.721" end="00:45:09.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. Don&#39;t let anything slip.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.121" end="00:45:10.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.421" end="00:45:13.121" style="s2">Where is my Xiao?</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.421" end="00:45:15.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s sister, she she wasn&#39;t careful and</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.121" end="00:45:19.621" style="s2">tumbled down the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.521" end="00:45:19.621" style="s2">I tried to grab her, but I couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.421" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut the act, Jiang Min.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.221" end="00:45:29.121" style="s2">Xiao wouldn&#39;t fall down the stairs for</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.121" end="00:45:31.721" style="s2">no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.121" end="00:45:33.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, it really was an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.721" end="00:45:35.421" style="s2">She just missed a step.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.821" end="00:45:37.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An accident?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.421" end="00:45:38.521" style="s2">A healthy person falls down right in</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.121" end="00:45:40.321" style="s2">front of you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.521" end="00:45:43.421" style="s2">You&#39;re responsible.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.321" end="00:45:43.421" style="s2">You tried to kill her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.721" end="00:45:50.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yuru, calm down. This is a hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.321" end="00:45:50.321" style="s2">Stop throwing wild accusations around.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.421" end="00:45:59.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.121" end="00:46:02.521" style="s2">She&#39;s going to kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.921" end="00:46:04.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That slap was for Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.521" end="00:46:07.421" style="s2">Listen to me, Jiang Min.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.921" end="00:46:09.121" style="s2">If anything happens to Xiao, I&#39;ll bury</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.421" end="00:46:09.621" style="s2">you and that child in your belly with</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.121" end="00:46:11.321" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.621" end="00:46:13.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Min is pregnant. Hitting people in a</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.321" end="00:46:15.221" style="s2">hospital. Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.321" end="00:46:16.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Lihua, you&#39;re the one who&#39;s lost</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.221" end="00:46:18.221" style="s2">your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.521" end="00:46:19.621" style="s2">Xiao is your daughter-in-law, yet here</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.221" end="00:46:21.921" style="s2">you are protecting a mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.621" end="00:46:26.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao fell by accident.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.921" end="00:46:26.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Lihua, you get out too.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.921" end="00:46:30.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.321" end="00:46:37.621" style="s2">Yuru, look at you. Why would you hit me</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.521" end="00:46:40.621" style="s2">in front of everyone? I understand</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.621" end="00:46:42.021" style="s2">you&#39;re angry with me for hitting you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.621" end="00:46:45.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You understand?</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.021" end="00:46:47.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I do. But Min&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.021" end="00:46:49.821" style="s2">She&#39;s fragile and can&#39;t be startled. If</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.721" end="00:46:52.821" style="s2">anything happens to the baby, the Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.821" end="00:46:55.821" style="s2">family&#39;s child, what then?</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.821" end="00:46:57.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Lihua, drop the act.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.821" end="00:46:59.823" style="s2">That baby you&#39;re so concerned about, are</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.723" end="00:47:02.323" style="s2">you really thinking about?</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.823" end="00:47:03.422" style="s2">The Xiao family&#39;s child or just your own</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.323" end="00:47:06.122" style="s2">interests?</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.422" end="00:47:08.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are what are you talking about? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.122" end="00:47:10.622" style="s2">worried about Xiao too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.323" end="00:47:12.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worried?</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.622" end="00:47:14.223" style="s2">Xiao could be dead or alive in there and</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.723" end="00:47:15.922" style="s2">you haven&#39;t asked how she&#39;s doing or</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.223" end="00:47:17.622" style="s2">called a doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.922" end="00:47:19.122" style="s2">All you care about is protecting Zheng</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.622" end="00:47:21.723" style="s2">Min.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.122" end="00:47:24.622" style="s2">Xiao Lihua,</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:24.622" style="s2">have you no conscience?</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.323" end="00:47:28.723" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.523" end="00:47:32.122" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch me with those filthy hands.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.723" end="00:47:32.122" style="s2">Just looking at you makes me feel dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.723" end="00:47:37.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, please have some water and sit</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.223" end="00:47:39.422" style="s2">while you wait.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.422" end="00:47:40.223" style="s2">The young madam is a good person.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.422" end="00:47:41.823" style="s2">She&#39;ll be all right.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.223" end="00:47:43.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not sitting.</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.823" end="00:47:45.223" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait right here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.523" end="00:47:46.723" style="s2">Xiao got hurt helping me uncover the</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.223" end="00:47:48.823" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.723" end="00:47:51.823" style="s2">If anything happens to her, I&#39;ll never</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.823" end="00:47:51.823" style="s2">forgive myself.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.622" end="00:48:00.523" style="s2">Doctor, how is my daughter-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.223" end="00:48:06.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She arrived too late. She&#39;s lost a lot</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.223" end="00:48:08.622" style="s2">of blood and she suffered severe head</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.622" end="00:48:10.723" style="s2">trauma. There&#39;s a large hematoma inside</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.622" end="00:48:13.323" style="s2">her skull. Her condition is critical and</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.723" end="00:48:14.622" style="s2">her life is in danger.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.323" end="00:48:15.723" style="s2">These are the critical condition notice</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.622" end="00:48:18.223" style="s2">and consent form for a second</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.723" end="00:48:20.023" style="s2">craniotomy. It&#39;s an emergency. We need a</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.223" end="00:48:21.223" style="s2">family member to sign right away. Every</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.023" end="00:48:23.523" style="s2">minute we wait puts her in greater</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.223" end="00:48:23.523" style="s2">danger.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.723" end="00:48:28.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could it be this serious?</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.523" end="00:48:31.023" style="s2">Doctor,</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.723" end="00:48:34.323" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t we wait for Xiao Wei to sign?</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.023" end="00:48:34.323" style="s2">He&#39;s her husband after all.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.823" end="00:48:43.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, please, you have to save her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.622" end="00:48:45.823" style="s2">I&#39;ll take full responsibility if</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.023" end="00:48:45.823" style="s2">anything goes wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.823" end="00:48:53.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.922" end="00:48:54.723" style="s2">Didn&#39;t we agree not to contact each</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.122" end="00:48:56.523" style="s2">other for a few days?</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.723" end="00:48:57.622" style="s2">If Xiao Lihua or Xiao Wei finds out,</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.523" end="00:48:59.823" style="s2">we&#39;re both finished.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.622" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Bin,</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.823" end="00:49:03.524" style="s2">something&#39;s happened.</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.424" end="00:49:05.724" style="s2">Something terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.524" end="00:49:07.124" style="s2">Ding Jiao somehow found out about us.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.724" end="00:49:08.524" style="s2">She went to the city forensic center</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.124" end="00:49:09.324" style="s2">this afternoon to pick up the paternity</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.524" end="00:49:10.324" style="s2">test results.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.324" end="00:49:11.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.324" end="00:49:13.324" style="s2">She got the results?</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.824" end="00:49:15.524" style="s2">Does Joe Wei know?</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.324" end="00:49:17.324" style="s2">What about that old fox, Joe Li Hua?</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.524" end="00:49:19.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Wei doesn&#39;t know yet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.324" end="00:49:21.324" style="s2">I already destroyed the report.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.624" end="00:49:22.924" style="s2">I pushed Ding Jiao down the stairs at</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.324" end="00:49:24.624" style="s2">the forensic center.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.924" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">She&#39;s in the hospital fighting for her</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.624" end="00:49:26.524" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:28.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is she now?</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.524" end="00:49:28.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.324" end="00:49:33.024" style="s2">But that old fox, Joe Li Hua, cornered</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.224" end="00:49:34.624" style="s2">me in the stairwell just now.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.024" end="00:49:37.024" style="s2">He suspects something.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.624" end="00:49:38.924" style="s2">He asked if the baby was really a Joe.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.024" end="00:49:41.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pushed her down the stairs?</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.924" end="00:49:42.624" style="s2">Cheng Min, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.124" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">If you want to die, don&#39;t take me down</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.624" end="00:49:45.024" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.724" end="00:49:45.924" style="s2">I&#39;m leaving now.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.024" end="00:49:48.524" style="s2">I don&#39;t know anything.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.924" end="00:49:50.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the point of saying that now?</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.524" end="00:49:52.624" style="s2">Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.424" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">We&#39;re in this together.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.624" end="00:49:56.424" style="s2">If I go to prison, you won&#39;t get to walk</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.724" end="00:49:58.324" style="s2">free either.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.424" end="00:49:59.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You promised you&#39;d make me rich.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.324" end="00:50:02.124" style="s2">That &#39;s why I agreed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.824" end="00:50:03.624" style="s2">Now you&#39;re going to drag me into prison?</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.124" end="00:50:05.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.624" end="00:50:07.824" style="s2">Pack your things and leave town now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.724" end="00:50:09.824" style="s2">Buy a ticket for the next departure.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.824" end="00:50:11.924" style="s2">Go as far away as you can. Don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.824" end="00:50:13.624" style="s2">back or contact me until the baby&#39;s 100</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.924" end="00:50:14.824" style="s2">day celebration.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.624" end="00:50:16.124" style="s2">Do you understand?</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.824" end="00:50:17.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.124" end="00:50:20.924" style="s2">I&#39;m leaving tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.924" end="00:50:20.924" style="s2">Don&#39;t call me again.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.624" end="00:50:33.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom. Dad, what&#39;s going on? I was having</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.524" end="00:50:35.224" style="s2">tea with some clients and my secretary</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.124" end="00:50:36.224" style="s2">insisted I come over.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.224" end="00:50:37.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife is in there undergoing</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.224" end="00:50:39.724" style="s2">emergency brain surgery and you had the</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.924" end="00:50:42.024" style="s2">nerve not to come.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.724" end="00:50:43.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She causes trouble every day. If she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.024" end="00:50:46.324" style="s2">been more careful, she wouldn&#39;t need an</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.924" end="00:50:48.724" style="s2">expensive operation. What if they can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.324" end="00:50:49.424" style="s2">save her? Then we&#39;d have wasted money</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.724" end="00:50:51.824" style="s2">and time.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.424" end="00:50:53.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.824" end="00:50:55.624" style="s2">Say one more word and you&#39;ll get on your</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.224" end="00:50:55.624" style="s2">knees.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.524" end="00:51:00.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I&#39;m just saying Ding Jiao&#39;s always</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.124" end="00:51:02.825" style="s2">been sickly. She can&#39;t even have a child</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.824" end="00:51:04.425" style="s2">and now she&#39;s pulling this stunt. If the</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.825" end="00:51:06.825" style="s2">media finds out, who knows what they&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.425" end="00:51:09.125" style="s2">say about the Xiao family.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.825" end="00:51:11.525" style="s2">By the way, where&#39;s Min? Wasn&#39;t she at</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.125" end="00:51:14.025" style="s2">the city testing center with Ding Xiao?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.525" end="00:51:15.525" style="s2">Min&#39;s carrying my son. I hope Ding Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.025" end="00:51:18.125" style="s2">didn&#39;t scare her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.525" end="00:51:18.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei,</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.025" end="00:51:23.025" style="s2">come on.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.425" end="00:51:24.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Don&#39;t make a scene in</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.025" end="00:51:26.525" style="s2">front of your mother and upset her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.425" end="00:51:28.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say anything wrong. All mom</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.525" end="00:51:31.125" style="s2">does is take Ding Xiao&#39;s side. Dad, the</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.825" end="00:51:32.525" style="s2">baby&#39;s okay, right? He&#39;s the Xiao</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.125" end="00:51:34.325" style="s2">family&#39;s heir.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.525" end="00:51:35.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The heir?</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.325" end="00:51:39.125" style="s2">Good thing Xiao Wei still thinks Jiang</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.925" end="00:51:41.125" style="s2">Min&#39;s baby is his. Once the baby&#39;s born</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.125" end="00:51:42.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, the black bag the young madam had</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.125" end="00:51:44.825" style="s2">with her is missing.</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.725" end="00:51:46.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min must have taken it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.825" end="00:51:48.825" style="s2">Xiao was going to pick up the report</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.325" end="00:51:51.325" style="s2">from the testing center this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.825" end="00:51:53.025" style="s2">Jiang Min must have seen something.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.325" end="00:51:55.125" style="s2">She pushed Xiao down.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.025" end="00:51:56.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, what should we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.125" end="00:51:58.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are security cameras all over the</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.925" end="00:51:59.925" style="s2">stairwells and hallways at the testing</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.625" end="00:52:01.425" style="s2">center.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.925" end="00:52:03.725" style="s2">Jiang Min thinks burning the report</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.425" end="00:52:05.125" style="s2">means she&#39;s in the clear.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.725" end="00:52:06.825" style="s2">How naive.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.125" end="00:52:08.625" style="s2">Lao Xiao,</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.825" end="00:52:10.525" style="s2">take some people with you right now and</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.625" end="00:52:11.625" style="s2">demand all the footage from the second</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:13.725" style="s2">floor stairwell.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.625" end="00:52:16.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.725" end="00:52:17.825" style="s2">I&#39;ll take a team over right away.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.225" end="00:52:20.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you get the footage, take it</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.825" end="00:52:22.725" style="s2">straight to the police and file a case.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.925" end="00:52:24.425" style="s2">I &#39;ll make sure Jiang Min goes to prison</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.725" end="00:52:26.325" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.425" end="00:52:28.925" style="s2">She&#39;ll never get out.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.325" end="00:52:28.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ham ham.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.225" end="00:52:38.425" style="s2">Pick up.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.725" end="00:52:39.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Lao Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.425" end="00:52:41.525" style="s2">What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.225" end="00:52:42.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Lu, I need a favor. It&#39;s urgent.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.525" end="00:52:44.825" style="s2">Someone fell down the stairs at the</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.825" end="00:52:46.425" style="s2">testing center this afternoon. My wife</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.825" end="00:52:48.025" style="s2">is taking people to your security office</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.425" end="00:52:49.025" style="s2">to get the footage. She wants to make a</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.025" end="00:52:50.525" style="s2">big deal out of this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.025" end="00:52:51.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, getting the footage is standard</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.525" end="00:52:53.825" style="s2">procedure.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.725" end="00:52:57.725" style="s2">I can&#39;t exactly stop them.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.825" end="00:52:57.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Lu, I don&#39;t care how you do it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.325" end="00:53:06.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who who are you people? This is a</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.727" end="00:53:07.227" style="s2">surveillance room. No unauthorized</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.727" end="00:53:09.127" style="s2">entry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.227" end="00:53:10.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re with Xiao Group.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.127" end="00:53:13.327" style="s2">Our general manager&#39;s wife suffered a</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.827" end="00:53:15.527" style="s2">serious fall by your stairwell.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.327" end="00:53:17.727" style="s2">We suspect foul play.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.527" end="00:53:20.127" style="s2">We need to review the security footage.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.727" end="00:53:22.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I don&#39;t think that&#39;s allowed. You need</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.127" end="00:53:22.627" style="s2">police authorization to access the</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.027" end="00:53:25.327" style="s2">footage.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.627" end="00:53:27.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our lawyer is getting the paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.327" end="00:53:29.627" style="s2">The police will be here soon.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.727" end="00:53:32.227" style="s2">We need to review the live footage now</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.627" end="00:53:33.527" style="s2">and preserve it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.227" end="00:53:35.127" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.527" end="00:53:37.427" style="s2">Can&#39;t the victim&#39;s family even take a</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.127" end="00:53:37.427" style="s2">look?</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.827" end="00:53:47.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I can pull it up for you, but I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.227" end="00:53:47.027" style="s2">guarantee you&#39;ll be allowed to watch it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.527" end="00:53:56.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one from 2:10 p.m. to 2:30 p.m.,</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.927" end="00:53:56.527" style="s2">release it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.827" end="00:54:02.827" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.227" end="00:54:03.327" style="s2">Why is the footage from this exact time</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.827" end="00:54:06.327" style="s2">corrupted?</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.327" end="00:54:08.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know. I swear it&#39;s not my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.327" end="00:54:11.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not your fault?</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.127" end="00:54:11.427" style="s2">There must be a reason.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.027" end="00:54:17.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At noon today, a team of provincial</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.427" end="00:54:19.227" style="s2">technicians came to maintain and upgrade</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.127" end="00:54:20.827" style="s2">the server system.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.227" end="00:54:23.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The data may have been lost then.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.827" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, during system maintenance. They</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.027" end="00:54:27.927" style="s2">even formatted the backup server.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.827" end="00:54:27.927" style="s2">There&#39;s really nothing left.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.427" end="00:54:34.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Xiao, how did it go?</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.327" end="00:54:36.227" style="s2">Did you get the footage?</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.227" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.227" end="00:54:40.627" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry we were too late.</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.827" end="00:54:44.027" style="s2">Someone completely erased all the</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.627" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">footage from the second floor fire exit.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.027" end="00:54:46.727" style="s2">They even took care of the backup</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.527" end="00:54:49.127" style="s2">server.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.727" end="00:54:51.327" style="s2">There&#39;s not a second of footage left.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.127" end="00:54:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like Xiao Li Hua beat me to it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.327" end="00:54:54.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.427" end="00:54:56.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll wait for Zheng Min to have</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.727" end="00:54:57.927" style="s2">the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.027" end="00:55:00.727" style="s2">Until then, they probably won&#39;t dare lay</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.927" end="00:55:00.727" style="s2">a hand on Xiao.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.227" end="00:55:08.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Zheng, please think carefully. What</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.627" end="00:55:10.828" style="s2">exactly happened in the stairwell at the</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.928" end="00:55:13.028" style="s2">testing center?</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.828" end="00:55:14.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer,</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.028" end="00:55:15.428" style="s2">Ding Jiao suddenly asked me to meet her</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.428" end="00:55:17.028" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.428" end="00:55:18.528" style="s2">As soon as she saw me, she grabbed me</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.028" end="00:55:20.028" style="s2">and wouldn&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.528" end="00:55:21.628" style="s2">She said the baby I was carrying was a</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.028" end="00:55:23.528" style="s2">little bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.628" end="00:55:27.128" style="s2">I was pregnant and afraid she&#39;d hurt the</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.528" end="00:55:29.628" style="s2">baby, so I could only back away.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.128" end="00:55:32.628" style="s2">Then she lost control, slipped, and fell</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.628" end="00:55:35.228" style="s2">backward on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.628" end="00:55:38.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiao has always been steady on her feet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.228" end="00:55:38.628" style="s2">How could she have fallen by herself?</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.828" end="00:55:44.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I tried to grab her, but I was so far</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.228" end="00:55:44.528" style="s2">along I couldn&#39;t reach her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.928" end="00:55:48.728" style="s2">If I&#39;d managed to catch her, she</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.828" end="00:55:50.528" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t have fallen like that.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.728" end="00:55:52.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, you dare lie right in front</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.528" end="00:55:54.428" style="s2">of the police?</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.128" end="00:55:55.828" style="s2">Jiao didn&#39;t fall on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.428" end="00:55:57.528" style="s2">You pushed her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.828" end="00:55:59.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.528" end="00:56:02.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, that&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.328" end="00:56:04.128" style="s2">Min is carrying the Jiao family&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.328" end="00:56:05.628" style="s2">Do you have to push her until something</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.128" end="00:56:08.228" style="s2">happens to her?</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.628" end="00:56:09.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiao Wei, Jiao just had surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.228" end="00:56:11.428" style="s2">She&#39;s lying in the hospital, and instead</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.928" end="00:56:12.428" style="s2">of asking if she&#39;s all right, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.428" end="00:56:15.128" style="s2">protecting this murderer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.428" end="00:56:17.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What murderer? Mom, stop making baseless</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.128" end="00:56:19.528" style="s2">accusations. That&#39;s enough. We&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.228" end="00:56:22.028" style="s2">to ask questions, not watch you argue.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.528" end="00:56:24.228" style="s2">Officers, I&#39;m Ding Jiao&#39;s husband. I can</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.028" end="00:56:25.928" style="s2">testify. Ding Jiao has always been weak</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.228" end="00:56:27.928" style="s2">on her feet and careless.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.928" end="00:56:29.328" style="s2">She must have missed a step again today.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.928" end="00:56:31.328" style="s2">Mr. Jiao, were you there when it</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.328" end="00:56:33.228" style="s2">happened? I wasn&#39;t there, but I know</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.328" end="00:56:35.028" style="s2">Ding Jiao better than anyone. She went</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.228" end="00:56:36.828" style="s2">there to give Min a hard time, then</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.028" end="00:56:41.028" style="s2">accidentally fell herself. Who can she</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.828" end="00:56:41.028" style="s2">blame but herself? It was an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.628" end="00:56:49.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Chen has no video, and there were</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.528" end="00:56:51.028" style="s2">no other witnesses at the scene. Based</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.628" end="00:56:53.128" style="s2">on the statements and the evidence at</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.028" end="00:56:55.428" style="s2">the scene, we believe she accidentally</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.128" end="00:56:55.428" style="s2">fell.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.328" end="00:57:01.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.628" end="00:57:06.228" style="s2">Jiang Min, you think you got away with</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.028" end="00:57:08.128" style="s2">it once.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.228" end="00:57:10.229" style="s2">You think you&#39;ll get away with it again?</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.128" end="00:57:13.029" style="s2">Just wait until the baby&#39;s born.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.229" end="00:57:13.029" style="s2">You&#39;ll pay for this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.629" end="00:57:22.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, go get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.229" end="00:57:25.229" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.929" end="00:57:26.429" style="s2">The young madam is blessed.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.229" end="00:57:28.729" style="s2">She&#39;ll pull through.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.429" end="00:57:32.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.729" end="00:57:34.229" style="s2">Lao Zhao, every time I close my eyes, I</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.129" end="00:57:35.229" style="s2">see Zhao covered in blood at the bottom</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.229" end="00:57:36.929" style="s2">of the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.229" end="00:57:38.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But if you keep watch like this, the</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.929" end="00:57:40.029" style="s2">young madam will feel awful when she</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.529" end="00:57:41.929" style="s2">wakes up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.029" end="00:57:44.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those monsters in the Zhao family wiped</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.929" end="00:57:46.829" style="s2">the security footage clean.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.329" end="00:57:49.229" style="s2">They wanted to drive her to her death.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.829" end="00:57:51.729" style="s2">If I leave, how scared will Zhao be when</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.229" end="00:57:52.929" style="s2">she wakes up?</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.729" end="00:57:54.729" style="s2">Doctor,</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.929" end="00:57:57.529" style="s2">doctor, come quick.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.729" end="00:57:57.529" style="s2">Zhao&#39;s waking up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.529" end="00:58:12.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Chen, your daughter was lucky. She</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.929" end="00:58:15.029" style="s2">suffered a severe concussion and</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.529" end="00:58:16.029" style="s2">multiple fractures, but the surgery went</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.029" end="00:58:18.029" style="s2">well.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.029" end="00:58:20.929" style="s2">The worst is over.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.029" end="00:58:22.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, what about her memory?</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.929" end="00:58:23.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The blood clot in her skull pressed on a</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.329" end="00:58:24.729" style="s2">nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.429" end="00:58:26.229" style="s2">Her memories from around the time of the</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.729" end="00:58:28.529" style="s2">fall may be fuzzy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.229" end="00:58:31.129" style="s2">That&#39;s normal after trauma.</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.529" end="00:58:34.529" style="s2">Her memory should come back gradually.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.129" end="00:58:34.529" style="s2">Don&#39;t rush her or upset her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.729" end="00:58:43.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, you scared me half to death.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.829" end="00:58:44.429" style="s2">Does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.029" end="00:58:45.229" style="s2">What do you want to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.429" end="00:58:47.629" style="s2">I&#39;ll make it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.229" end="00:58:47.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.829" end="00:58:51.229" style="s2">I thought I&#39;d never see you again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.729" end="00:58:56.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, honey, of course you&#39;d see me again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.329" end="00:58:59.129" style="s2">I&#39;ve been right here with you the whole</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.729" end="00:59:01.729" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.129" end="00:59:04.429" style="s2">By the way, Zhao,</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.729" end="00:59:06.829" style="s2">do you remember who pushed you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.429" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I remember.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.829" end="00:59:10.929" style="s2">It was Jiang Min. Jiang Min pushed me</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.929" end="00:59:12.429" style="s2">down the stairs herself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.929" end="00:59:14.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min?</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.429" end="00:59:16.931" style="s2">How dare she?</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.931" end="00:59:19.531" style="s2">How dare she try to kill you in broad</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.931" end="00:59:19.531" style="s2">daylight?</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.731" end="00:59:22.331" style="s2">I&#39;m going to the police station right</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.031" end="00:59:23.731" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.331" end="00:59:24.731" style="s2">I&#39;ll make that monster pay with her</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.731" end="00:59:27.131" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.731" end="00:59:29.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.131" end="00:59:32.431" style="s2">It won&#39;t help.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.131" end="00:59:32.431" style="s2">The security footage.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.931" end="00:59:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, all right.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.631" end="00:59:41.431" style="s2">Xiao, just focus on getting better.</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.431" end="00:59:43.331" style="s2">I can&#39;t let this go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.431" end="00:59:46.431" style="s2">I&#39;ll make them pay for what they&#39;ve done</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.331" end="00:59:46.431" style="s2">a hundred times over.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.531" end="00:59:58.031" style="s2">Lao Xiao, cancel all my meetings and</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.431" end="00:59:59.631" style="s2">appointments for now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.031" end="01:00:00.031" style="s2">From today on, I&#39;m staying here with</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.631" end="01:00:01.131" style="s2">Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.031" end="01:00:03.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.131" end="01:00:03.731" style="s2">I&#39;ll take care of it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.331" end="01:00:09.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:11.231" style="s2">Drink it slowly.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.731" end="01:00:13.931" style="s2">Mom made this just for you with your</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.231" end="01:00:13.931" style="s2">favorite yam.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.731" end="01:00:18.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you have so much to do at the</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.331" end="01:00:19.831" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.431" end="01:00:21.231" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to stay here with me</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.831" end="01:00:22.731" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.231" end="01:00:24.531" style="s2">A nurse can take care of me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.731" end="01:00:26.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nonsense.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.531" end="01:00:27.731" style="s2">No nurse could care for you like your</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.131" end="01:00:29.531" style="s2">mother can.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.731" end="01:00:30.731" style="s2">As long as you get better, the company</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.531" end="01:00:34.531" style="s2">can wait.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.731" end="01:00:34.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you&#39;d always be the best, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.131" end="01:00:39.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Lihua and Xiao Wei haven&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.931" end="01:00:40.431" style="s2">come to see you once since your</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.031" end="01:00:44.431" style="s2">accident.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.431" end="01:00:44.431" style="s2">They may not care about you, but I do.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.131" end="01:00:55.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Ding Xiao&#39;s awake, right? Now that</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.131" end="01:00:57.031" style="s2">she&#39;s awake, make her sign the custody</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.131" end="01:00:59.031" style="s2">agreement. Min&#39;s getting bigger by the</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.031" end="01:01:00.131" style="s2">day. The Xiao heir can&#39;t be born without</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.031" end="01:01:01.731" style="s2">a name or a father.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.131" end="01:01:03.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei,</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.731" end="01:01:05.531" style="s2">have you no conscience?</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.731" end="01:01:06.831" style="s2">Xiao just woke up, and you can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.531" end="01:01:08.731" style="s2">ask how she is?</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.831" end="01:01:10.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care, and Ding Xiao can figure</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.731" end="01:01:12.731" style="s2">out how to pay her hospital bills</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.231" end="01:01:14.531" style="s2">herself. Let her poor family handle it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.731" end="01:01:15.732" style="s2">The Xiao family isn&#39;t paying a cent.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.531" end="01:01:17.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, do you think</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.732" end="01:01:18.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t deal with you just because we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.132" end="01:01:20.532" style="s2">in a hospital?</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.632" end="01:01:22.532" style="s2">Keep this up and you and your father can</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.532" end="01:01:25.532" style="s2">get out of the Xiao family.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.532" end="01:01:25.532" style="s2">You&#39;ll leave with nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.432" end="01:01:33.432" style="s2">Don&#39;t listen to that awful man, Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.832" end="01:01:36.532" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.432" end="01:01:36.532" style="s2">No one will hurt you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.732" end="01:01:42.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.032" end="01:01:44.932" style="s2">I got a second chance at life.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.932" end="01:01:47.732" style="s2">When I&#39;m better, we&#39;ll settle this with</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.932" end="01:01:50.032" style="s2">them one debt at a time.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.732" end="01:01:52.232" style="s2">I&#39;ll make them pay in blood.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.032" end="01:01:55.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, when we get home next time, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.232" end="01:01:55.532" style="s2">divorcing Xiao Lihua.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.932" end="01:02:00.832" style="s2">Easy, Xiao</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.532" end="01:02:02.932" style="s2">No rush.</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.832" end="01:02:06.332" style="s2">The doctor says you&#39;re recovering well.</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.932" end="01:02:06.332" style="s2">Walking more will help your bones heal.</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.932" end="01:02:19.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I want to see my mom.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.732" end="01:02:21.832" style="s2">The caregiver didn&#39;t tell her what</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.332" end="01:02:23.432" style="s2">happened to me, did she?</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.832" end="01:02:25.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.432" end="01:02:28.032" style="s2">I made sure Lao Xiao told the caregiver</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.432" end="01:02:30.432" style="s2">to say you were busy on a business trip.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.032" end="01:02:32.432" style="s2">But a mother knows her daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.432" end="01:02:35.332" style="s2">If you don&#39;t visit soon, she&#39;ll start to</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.432" end="01:02:35.332" style="s2">get suspicious.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.332" end="01:02:51.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, you&#39;re finally here. Honestly, you</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.432" end="01:02:53.532" style="s2">you were away on business for so long</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.432" end="01:02:56.732" style="s2">and didn&#39;t even call your mom. And how</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.532" end="01:02:56.732" style="s2">did you hurt your leg?</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.232" end="01:03:00.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.932" end="01:03:01.532" style="s2">I just took a bad fall on my business</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.432" end="01:03:03.932" style="s2">trip.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.532" end="01:03:05.932" style="s2">How have you been feeling lately?</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.932" end="01:03:08.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re what brings you here?</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.932" end="01:03:11.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry. You&#39;ve been covering all</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.732" end="01:03:13.132" style="s2">my treatment costs. I can&#39;t thank you</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.432" end="01:03:15.432" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.132" end="01:03:17.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on.</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.432" end="01:03:19.833" style="s2">We&#39;ve been best friends for years.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.932" end="01:03:21.633" style="s2">Xiao married into our family, so she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.833" end="01:03:23.133" style="s2">like my own daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.633" end="01:03:24.733" style="s2">Of course, I&#39;d take care of her when</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.133" end="01:03:27.833" style="s2">she&#39;s sick.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.733" end="01:03:27.833" style="s2">And the same goes for you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.933" end="01:03:33.433" style="s2">Have you been comfortable here?</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.233" end="01:03:35.833" style="s2">Has anyone been bothering you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.433" end="01:03:37.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would anyone bother me? You made</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.833" end="01:03:39.033" style="s2">sure I got the best care.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.533" end="01:03:40.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.033" end="01:03:42.633" style="s2">Shuying, I&#39;ve already asked Lao Xiao to</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.833" end="01:03:44.533" style="s2">handle the paperwork.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.633" end="01:03:46.633" style="s2">This afternoon, you&#39;ll move to a private</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.533" end="01:03:48.333" style="s2">VIP suite on the top floor with a</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.633" end="01:03:49.533" style="s2">dedicated team of specialists and</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.333" end="01:03:51.933" style="s2">nurses.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.533" end="01:03:51.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.233" end="01:03:59.233" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.433" end="01:04:00.733" style="s2">Thank you for being so good to Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.233" end="01:04:02.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be silly.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.733" end="01:04:04.133" style="s2">Who else would I look after?</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.633" end="01:04:05.733" style="s2">When it&#39;s time for your surgery, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.133" end="01:04:06.933" style="s2">have Lao Xiao make all the arrangements</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.733" end="01:04:09.833" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.933" end="01:04:09.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.333" end="01:04:22.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, we won&#39;t go back for now.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.933" end="01:04:24.733" style="s2">We&#39;ll stay here for a few days so they</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.633" end="01:04:27.233" style="s2">don&#39;t pull anything else.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.733" end="01:04:27.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.733" end="01:04:34.833" style="s2">Mom, the police have provisionally ruled</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.833" end="01:04:37.633" style="s2">it an accidental fall.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.833" end="01:04:39.533" style="s2">There were no cameras or eyewitnesses.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.633" end="01:04:41.533" style="s2">My testimony alone isn&#39;t enough to</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.533" end="01:04:43.033" style="s2">legally convict Jiang Min.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.533" end="01:04:44.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.033" end="01:04:47.933" style="s2">That old fox Xiao Lihua covered his</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.933" end="01:04:47.933" style="s2">tracks perfectly.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.933" end="01:04:55.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the footage was erased.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.733" end="01:04:57.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um, hum.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.333" end="01:04:58.733" style="s2">Since Xiao Lihua erased it, he</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.133" end="01:05:00.033" style="s2">definitely made sure no physical</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.733" end="01:05:02.333" style="s2">evidence was left on the testing</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.033" end="01:05:05.233" style="s2">center&#39;s cameras. If we press charges</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.333" end="01:05:06.533" style="s2">now, we won&#39;t bring Jiang Min down.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.233" end="01:05:07.833" style="s2">We&#39;ll only tip them off.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.533" end="01:05:08.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we&#39;re just going to let her get away</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.833" end="01:05:10.233" style="s2">with it?</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.833" end="01:05:11.733" style="s2">That baby she&#39;s carrying is getting</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.233" end="01:05:14.933" style="s2">bigger by the day.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.733" end="01:05:14.933" style="s2">Xiao Wei&#39;s bound to marry her.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.533" end="01:05:22.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, what are thieves most afraid of?</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.833" end="01:05:22.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A A at the from a ghost.</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.735" end="01:05:29.035" style="s2">What Jiang Min fears most right now is</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.935" end="01:05:31.535" style="s2">the test report proving that the baby</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.035" end="01:05:33.135" style="s2">isn&#39;t Joe Wei&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.535" end="01:05:34.635" style="s2">And being exposed for pushing me down</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.135" end="01:05:36.435" style="s2">the stairs.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.635" end="01:05:38.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.435" end="01:05:40.235" style="s2">She thinks she can relax because the</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.135" end="01:05:41.835" style="s2">footage is gone.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.235" end="01:05:44.335" style="s2">But what if we make her think it&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.835" end="01:05:44.335" style="s2">out there?</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.735" end="01:05:53.335" style="s2">Xiao Li Hua bribed security and IT at</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.435" end="01:05:55.735" style="s2">the testing center to erase the server</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.335" end="01:05:57.935" style="s2">data, but he forgot one thing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.735" end="01:06:00.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There could be other cameras.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.935" end="01:06:02.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At a place like the testing center,</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.035" end="01:06:04.235" style="s2">besides the official security system, in</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.535" end="01:06:05.735" style="s2">a lot of departments and corners of the</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.235" end="01:06:07.535" style="s2">hallways,</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.735" end="01:06:11.135" style="s2">researchers have their own portable</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.535" end="01:06:11.135" style="s2">cameras and dash cams.</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.235" end="01:06:16.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you mean we use this fake backup</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.835" end="01:06:18.735" style="s2">footage to lure Jiang Min into a trap?</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.835" end="01:06:20.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.735" end="01:06:23.335" style="s2">Since the footage was destroyed, we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.835" end="01:06:25.935" style="s2">make them think it&#39;s still there.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.335" end="01:06:27.935" style="s2">We&#39;ll make Jiang Min panic</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.935" end="01:06:31.335" style="s2">and confess who the real culprit is</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.935" end="01:06:31.335" style="s2">right in front of the police.</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.235" end="01:06:40.135" style="s2">Lao Xiao spread the word.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.435" end="01:06:41.735" style="s2">Say Ding Xiao is awake and we recovered</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.135" end="01:06:45.635" style="s2">footage from the day it happened from a</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.735" end="01:06:45.635" style="s2">cleaner&#39;s phone at the testing center.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.935" end="01:06:55.535" style="s2">Xiao Wei, get over here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.735" end="01:06:57.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, you little brat, why are you</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.535" end="01:06:59.335" style="s2">out of the hospital? Who told you to</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.135" end="01:07:01.235" style="s2">come back? And mom, why did you bring</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.335" end="01:07:02.435" style="s2">her back? Is this house not miserable</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.235" end="01:07:03.735" style="s2">enough already?</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.435" end="01:07:05.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.735" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what are you what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.635" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.235" end="01:07:13.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, that burns. Mom, have you lost your</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.835" end="01:07:13.135" style="s2">mind?</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.535" end="01:07:25.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That slap was for Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.735" end="01:07:27.036" style="s2">She was in there fighting for her life,</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.536" end="01:07:28.736" style="s2">and you were out here looking at cars</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.036" end="01:07:30.736" style="s2">and brochures.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.736" end="01:07:31.936" style="s2">Do you even have a conscience?</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.736" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What good would it have done if I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.936" end="01:07:35.936" style="s2">gone?</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.336" end="01:07:39.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know if it would have helped,</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.936" end="01:07:39.236" style="s2">but it shows you&#39;re heartless.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.336" end="01:07:47.536" style="s2">Joe Wei, that slap was from me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.736" end="01:07:48.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.536" end="01:07:51.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.536" end="01:07:51.736" style="s2">You want to hit Xiao now too?</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.336" end="01:07:57.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong to talk back to mom and</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.136" end="01:07:59.736" style="s2">wrong not to visit Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.836" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least you&#39;re starting to get it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.736" end="01:08:04.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, look at mom. Has she lost her mind?</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.236" end="01:08:06.236" style="s2">She hit me in front of all those</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.536" end="01:08:08.136" style="s2">bodyguards and brought that walking</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.236" end="01:08:11.136" style="s2">corpse back. You&#39;re just going to sit</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.136" end="01:08:11.136" style="s2">there and do nothing?</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.336" end="01:08:16.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You useless little brat. You can&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.536" end="01:08:19.736" style="s2">anything right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.736" end="01:08:22.136" style="s2">How dare you even complain?</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.736" end="01:08:24.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what did I do wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.136" end="01:08:26.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully. Ding Xiao just got out</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.736" end="01:08:29.636" style="s2">of the hospital, and the police are</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.636" end="01:08:31.736" style="s2">still keeping an eye on the Xiao family.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.636" end="01:08:34.236" style="s2">Qin Yu&#39;er controls the company&#39;s cash</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.736" end="01:08:36.436" style="s2">flow right now. She&#39;s just waiting for</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.236" end="01:08:37.136" style="s2">us to slip up so she can kick us out for</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.436" end="01:08:40.236" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.136" end="01:08:43.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we do? Just put up with it?</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.236" end="01:08:44.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Put up with it and keep your head</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.036" end="01:08:47.736" style="s2">down for a while.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.536" end="01:08:47.736" style="s2">Stay away from Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.736" end="01:08:59.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, is this the data recovery center?</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.836" end="01:08:59.036" style="s2">Yes, I&#39;m Director Qin&#39;s assistant.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.636" end="01:09:05.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Sheng paid me a lot to keep a close</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.636" end="01:09:07.936" style="s2">eye on him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.636" end="01:09:10.536" style="s2">I can&#39;t afford to mess this up. Lao</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.936" end="01:09:11.836" style="s2">Xiao&#39;s acting so sneaky. Something&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.536" end="01:09:13.736" style="s2">definitely up.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.836" end="01:09:16.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the testing center?</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.736" end="01:09:17.336" style="s2">The one by the second floor fire exit?</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.136" end="01:09:18.536" style="s2">The footage from the hidden infrared</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.336" end="01:09:21.236" style="s2">camera?</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.536" end="01:09:23.336" style="s2">It&#39;s been recovered.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.236" end="01:09:25.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s great.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.336" end="01:09:27.737" style="s2">The infrared interference left some</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.236" end="01:09:29.737" style="s2">static, but you clearly see who pushed</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.737" end="01:09:31.938" style="s2">her from behind.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.737" end="01:09:33.438" style="s2">And the whole bag snatching incident,</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.938" end="01:09:34.637" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.438" end="01:09:37.737" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.637" end="01:09:40.137" style="s2">Director Chen said to spare no expense.</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.737" end="01:09:43.137" style="s2">The footage has to be intact.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.137" end="01:09:44.538" style="s2">This is the only solid evidence we have.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.137" end="01:09:45.637" style="s2">Make sure the Xiao family doesn&#39;t find</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.538" end="01:09:48.137" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.637" end="01:09:50.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What In that case, I&#39;d better hold off</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.137" end="01:09:53.137" style="s2">on telling Ms. Sheng. If she&#39;s arrested,</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.637" end="01:09:55.038" style="s2">she might drag me into it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.137" end="01:09:56.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow at noon, send it by express</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.038" end="01:09:57.738" style="s2">courier to Madam&#39;s apartment in</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.338" end="01:09:59.238" style="s2">Lingjiang.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.738" end="01:10:00.938" style="s2">Madam and the young Mrs. Xiao will pick</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.238" end="01:10:02.538" style="s2">it up themselves.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.938" end="01:10:03.738" style="s2">Once we have the footage, we&#39;ll take it</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.538" end="01:10:07.438" style="s2">straight to the municipal Public</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.738" end="01:10:07.438" style="s2">Security Bureau and file a case.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.038" end="01:10:21.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear clearly last night? Lao</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.038" end="01:10:23.338" style="s2">Xiao was on the phone in the corner. He</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.938" end="01:10:26.038" style="s2">said they really can fix that hidden</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.338" end="01:10:26.038" style="s2">camera feed.</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.238" end="01:10:30.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, didn&#39;t they say the Justice</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.637" end="01:10:31.938" style="s2">Department&#39;s surveillance system was</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.938" end="01:10:33.938" style="s2">down?</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.938" end="01:10:35.538" style="s2">How is there another camera?</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.938" end="01:10:37.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Madam said it&#39;s a hidden infrared</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.538" end="01:10:39.038" style="s2">camera for research and security. It</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.637" end="01:10:40.038" style="s2">isn&#39;t handled by the security</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.038" end="01:10:41.438" style="s2">department.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.038" end="01:10:43.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So when can they fix it?</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.438" end="01:10:44.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard it&#39;ll be done by the day after</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.038" end="01:10:47.137" style="s2">tomorrow at the latest. Then the</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.838" end="01:10:49.938" style="s2">restored high-definition footage will be</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.137" end="01:10:52.738" style="s2">sent to the Madam. It&#39;ll be obvious who</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.938" end="01:10:52.738" style="s2">pushed her.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.438" end="01:11:02.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WH what were you just talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.038" end="01:11:03.838" style="s2">What camera?</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.438" end="01:11:06.438" style="s2">What do you mean restored?</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.838" end="01:11:09.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. We were just chatting. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.438" end="01:11:11.738" style="s2">worry about it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.338" end="01:11:14.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me exactly what you said.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.738" end="01:11:14.338" style="s2">Every word.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.438" end="01:11:22.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? Watch where you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.938" end="01:11:25.137" style="s2">going. You scared me half to death.</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.137" end="01:11:25.137" style="s2">Can&#39;t you see I&#39;m in pain?</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.838" end="01:11:30.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.137" end="01:11:33.339" style="s2">We&#39;re done for.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.239" end="01:11:34.639" style="s2">We&#39;re going to prison.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.339" end="01:11:38.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you freaking out in broad</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.639" end="01:11:38.239" style="s2">daylight? What do you mean prison?</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.939" end="01:11:45.639" style="s2">Dad said they&#39;d wiped all the footage.</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.439" end="01:11:48.139" style="s2">There weren&#39;t even any backups. The</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.639" end="01:11:49.439" style="s2">police ruled it an accident. What are</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.139" end="01:11:51.039" style="s2">you afraid of?</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.439" end="01:11:52.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s another hidden infrared camera</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.039" end="01:11:54.439" style="s2">by the stairs.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.639" end="01:11:55.639" style="s2">Lao Zhao already sent the footage to be</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.439" end="01:11:57.139" style="s2">restored.</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.639" end="01:11:59.139" style="s2">The day after tomorrow, the restored</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.139" end="01:12:02.139" style="s2">footage will be in her hands.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.139" end="01:12:03.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao, I just got a call from Beijing.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.139" end="01:12:05.139" style="s2">They did an excellent job restoring the</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.839" end="01:12:06.639" style="s2">video.</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.139" end="01:12:08.339" style="s2">The high definition original will be</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.639" end="01:12:09.339" style="s2">delivered to me by express courier</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.339" end="01:12:11.439" style="s2">tomorrow at noon.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.339" end="01:12:13.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s great, Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.439" end="01:12:15.639" style="s2">As soon as we get the video, we&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.339" end="01:12:16.939" style="s2">the police.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.639" end="01:12:18.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.939" end="01:12:20.039" style="s2">I&#39;ve already had the lawyers draft an</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.139" end="01:12:22.039" style="s2">agreement to strip him of his assets.</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.039" end="01:12:24.239" style="s2">Once Cheng Min is in prison, all the</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.039" end="01:12:26.439" style="s2">shares and property in Zhao Wei&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.239" end="01:12:29.139" style="s2">will be reclaimed by law.</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.439" end="01:12:30.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But, Mom, Zhao Wei is still your son.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.139" end="01:12:30.739" style="s2">Can you really bring yourself to do</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.339" end="01:12:32.839" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.739" end="01:12:34.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao,</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.839" end="01:12:38.839" style="s2">the day Zhao Wei brought that woman</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.639" end="01:12:38.839" style="s2">home, he stopped being my son.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.939" end="01:12:42.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all Zhao Wei&#39;s fault.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.939" end="01:12:43.539" style="s2">He threw away everything you did for</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.539" end="01:12:45.539" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.539" end="01:12:48.139" style="s2">I&#39;ll be here for you from now on, Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.539" end="01:12:50.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been the young master for 30 years.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.139" end="01:12:52.739" style="s2">How can I let the woman I love go to</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.139" end="01:12:55.239" style="s2">prison? How can I end up a penniless</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.739" end="01:12:55.239" style="s2">beggar?</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.039" end="01:13:03.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s quiet outside.</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.739" end="01:13:03.739" style="s2">Zhao Wei&#39;s gone back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.339" end="01:13:15.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Min, the package will arrive tomorrow at</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.739" end="01:13:17.339" style="s2">noon. My mom and Ding Zhao are saying</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.439" end="01:13:19.239" style="s2">they&#39;ll call the police.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.339" end="01:13:20.739" style="s2">They&#39;ll not only send you to prison,</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.239" end="01:13:22.439" style="s2">they&#39;ll take back all the shares and</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.739" end="01:13:25.439" style="s2">property in my name and leave us with</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.439" end="01:13:29.239" style="s2">nothing. Min, let&#39;s run. Let&#39;s pack up</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.439" end="01:13:31.540" style="s2">and go right now, as far away as we can.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.239" end="01:13:34.140" style="s2">Or Or could beg my mom. I could get down</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.540" end="01:13:36.440" style="s2">on my knees and kowtow to her. She can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.140" end="01:13:37.040" style="s2">really drive her own son to the edge.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.440" end="01:13:38.740" style="s2">Can she?</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.040" end="01:13:41.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beg her.</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.740" end="01:13:43.440" style="s2">Show way. Have you still not figured it</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.140" end="01:13:43.440" style="s2">out?</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.640" end="01:13:52.140" style="s2">In her eyes, you&#39;re not her son anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.040" end="01:13:55.140" style="s2">You&#39;re just an eyesore she wants gone.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.140" end="01:13:56.640" style="s2">And if we run, we&#39;ll be penniless.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.140" end="01:13:57.840" style="s2">Are you willing to spend your whole life</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.640" end="01:13:59.640" style="s2">hiding?</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.840" end="01:14:01.440" style="s2">Do you want our son born in some rental</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.640" end="01:14:04.240" style="s2">with no household registration and no</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.440" end="01:14:04.240" style="s2">legal identity?</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.440" end="01:14:15.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; W what is this?</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.040" end="01:14:18.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had someone get it for me a while ago.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.940" end="01:14:20.740" style="s2">It&#39;s colorless and odorless.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.540" end="01:14:22.640" style="s2">Just a few drops and someone can die in</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.740" end="01:14:23.840" style="s2">their sleep from a lack of oxygen to the</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.640" end="01:14:25.740" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.840" end="01:14:29.040" style="s2">Even the coroner would only find heart</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.740" end="01:14:32.140" style="s2">failure or a brain hemorrhage.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.040" end="01:14:35.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. We can&#39;t. That&#39;s murder.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.140" end="01:14:35.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who can prove we did it?</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.740" end="01:14:39.740" style="s2">Ding Jiao just got out of the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.140" end="01:14:41.540" style="s2">She&#39;s already weak.</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.740" end="01:14:43.040" style="s2">Your mom&#39;s getting old.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.540" end="01:14:44.240" style="s2">Caring for a patient could easily wear</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.040" end="01:14:45.440" style="s2">her out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.240" end="01:14:48.840" style="s2">Having something soothing to drink</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.440" end="01:14:48.840" style="s2">before bed is perfectly normal.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.140" end="01:15:12.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Min, it&#39;s already 3:00. Not a sound from</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.140" end="01:15:14.140" style="s2">upstairs. Do you think they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.840" end="01:15:16.540" style="s2">already</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.140" end="01:15:18.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go up and check.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.540" end="01:15:19.640" style="s2">I won&#39;t feel safe until I see for</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.440" end="01:15:23.640" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.640" end="01:15:26.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m not going. I&#39;m scared. Min, what</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.640" end="01:15:26.540" style="s2">if they haven&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.840" end="01:15:32.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You useless coward.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.440" end="01:15:35.142" style="s2">Stay here and keep watch.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.540" end="01:15:35.142" style="s2">I&#39;ll go out myself.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.342" end="01:15:51.342" style="s2">Ding Xiao, Qin Yue Ru, you thought you</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.742" end="01:15:53.742" style="s2">were so clever, didn&#39;t you? And now</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.342" end="01:15:55.642" style="s2">you&#39;re dead by my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.742" end="01:15:57.042" style="s2">Everything the Xiao family owns will be</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.642" end="01:15:59.742" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.042" end="01:16:02.942" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame me for being ruthless.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.742" end="01:16:02.942" style="s2">This feels wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.242" end="01:16:13.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.742" end="01:16:20.342" style="s2">Let go of me. Get your hands off me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.942" end="01:16:27.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zheng Min, you thought you were being</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.542" end="01:16:27.042" style="s2">careful.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.542" end="01:16:36.042" style="s2">From when you coached Zheng Wei in the</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.842" end="01:16:36.042" style="s2">guest room this afternoon</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.642" end="01:16:41.642" style="s2">to when you just drugged the water in</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.442" end="01:16:45.642" style="s2">the kettle, this pinhole camera caught</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.642" end="01:16:45.642" style="s2">every moment crystal clear.</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.742" end="01:16:54.742" style="s2">We didn&#39;t drink a drop, but what&#39;s in</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.842" end="01:16:58.242" style="s2">that water is enough to put you and</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.742" end="01:16:58.242" style="s2">Zheng Wei away for life.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.342" end="01:17:06.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, Qin Yue Ru, you set me up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.142" end="01:17:10.042" style="s2">I&#39;ll never let you get away with this.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.242" end="01:17:12.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, please spare me. I didn&#39;t mean to.</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.042" end="01:17:14.042" style="s2">I&#39;ll take good care of you from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.242" end="01:17:15.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late, Zheng Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.042" end="01:17:16.842" style="s2">You&#39;re just like your father. Both of</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.442" end="01:17:18.942" style="s2">you are heartless.</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.842" end="01:17:20.042" style="s2">You crossed the line again and again.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.942" end="01:17:20.242" style="s2">Did you think I&#39;d keep putting up with</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.042" end="01:17:22.142" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.242" end="01:17:24.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officers, we&#39;ll leave this to you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.142" end="01:17:27.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. We won&#39;t let something like</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.342" end="01:17:27.042" style="s2">this slide.</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.142" end="01:17:34.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zheng Min, since you&#39;re pregnant, you</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.842" end="01:17:36.543" style="s2">qualify for release on bail. But until</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.942" end="01:17:38.443" style="s2">the investigation is over, you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.543" end="01:17:40.043" style="s2">leave this city. You must be available</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.443" end="01:17:42.943" style="s2">whenever we call. Understand?</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.043" end="01:17:42.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.243" end="01:17:54.843" style="s2">Zhu Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.743" end="01:17:58.143" style="s2">Zhu Wei&#39;s still in there.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.843" end="01:17:58.143" style="s2">What am I supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.243" end="01:18:08.843" style="s2">Dad, please save me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.843" end="01:18:10.743" style="s2">Save Zhu Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.843" end="01:18:12.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you yelling for? Haven&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.743" end="01:18:16.143" style="s2">embarrassed us enough?</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.543" end="01:18:18.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I&#39;m carrying a Zhu family baby.</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.143" end="01:18:20.843" style="s2">You can&#39;t just let me go to prison.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.843" end="01:18:22.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have the nerve to bring up the baby?</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.843" end="01:18:24.043" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for that baby, do you</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.843" end="01:18:26.043" style="s2">think you&#39;d have walked out of the</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.043" end="01:18:28.543" style="s2">police station today?</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.043" end="01:18:30.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know it&#39;s because of the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.543" end="01:18:32.943" style="s2">Dad, you have to do something.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.643" end="01:18:35.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oof. You didn&#39;t even think before you</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.943" end="01:18:36.943" style="s2">acted. Qin Yu Er led you around by the</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.643" end="01:18:39.343" style="s2">nose.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.943" end="01:18:41.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.343" end="01:18:44.443" style="s2">Please, you have connections.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.943" end="01:18:46.343" style="s2">You can do something, can&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.443" end="01:18:49.643" style="s2">Save Zhu Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.343" end="01:18:52.743" style="s2">If he&#39;s okay, I&#39;ll do anything you say.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.643" end="01:18:55.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Shut your mouth. Go back to your</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.743" end="01:18:57.243" style="s2">room. Don&#39;t set foot outside until I say</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.543" end="01:18:59.243" style="s2">so.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.243" end="01:19:01.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what about Zhu Wei?</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.243" end="01:19:04.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll handle it. Remember, if the police</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.743" end="01:19:06.343" style="s2">come asking again, don&#39;t say a word.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.443" end="01:19:08.543" style="s2">Otherwise, I won&#39;t be able to get you</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.343" end="01:19:08.543" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.043" end="01:19:16.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, young madam.</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.143" end="01:19:18.643" style="s2">Jiang Man has been released on bail</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.743" end="01:19:21.043" style="s2">because she&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.643" end="01:19:22.543" style="s2">As for Zhu Wei, Zhu Li Hua has hired the</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.043" end="01:19:24.343" style="s2">best criminal defense lawyer in the</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.543" end="01:19:24.943" style="s2">province and is pulling every string to</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.343" end="01:19:27.943" style="s2">help him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.943" end="01:19:30.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course Zhu Li Hua will protect him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.943" end="01:19:33.943" style="s2">If Zhu Wei goes down, Zhu Li Hua loses</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.443" end="01:19:33.943" style="s2">half his cronies at the company.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.143" end="01:19:38.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, there&#39;s surveillance footage of the</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.143" end="01:19:39.844" style="s2">poisoning, but Zhu Wei took all the</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.344" end="01:19:42.045" style="s2">blame.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.844" end="01:19:43.744" style="s2">He said he acted on impulse and Jiang</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.045" end="01:19:45.045" style="s2">Min knew nothing about it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.744" end="01:19:46.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmph.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.045" end="01:19:48.045" style="s2">How noble of him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.744" end="01:19:49.945" style="s2">He thinks that since Jiang Min is</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.045" end="01:19:51.744" style="s2">carrying his child and we never drank</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.945" end="01:19:53.144" style="s2">the water, it only counts as attempted</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.744" end="01:19:55.844" style="s2">poisoning.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.144" end="01:19:57.144" style="s2">He won&#39;t get more than a few years.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.844" end="01:19:58.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The worst part is what happened when I</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.144" end="01:19:59.945" style="s2">fell from the building.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.545" end="01:20:01.144" style="s2">There&#39;s no footage and no physical</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.945" end="01:20:02.744" style="s2">evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.144" end="01:20:04.945" style="s2">My testimony alone isn&#39;t enough to do</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.744" end="01:20:06.744" style="s2">anything to Jiang Min.</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.945" end="01:20:08.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, young madam.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.744" end="01:20:09.244" style="s2">The security department has its story</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.144" end="01:20:11.545" style="s2">straight.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.244" end="01:20:13.045" style="s2">They all claim it was a system failure.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.545" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">And with insufficient evidence, the</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.045" end="01:20:16.644" style="s2">prosecutors declined to charge Jiang Min</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.744" end="01:20:18.344" style="s2">for pushing you off the building.</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.644" end="01:20:19.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.344" end="01:20:21.844" style="s2">If you want to bring down a snake,</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.644" end="01:20:24.045" style="s2">strike where it hurts. Sending Jiang Min</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.844" end="01:20:27.844" style="s2">straight to prison would be too easy for</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.045" end="01:20:30.045" style="s2">someone as vain and greedy as her.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.844" end="01:20:32.045" style="s2">All she wants is the wealth and status</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.045" end="01:20:33.644" style="s2">that come with the group.</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.045" end="01:20:36.344" style="s2">I&#39;ll make her watch as everything she</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.644" end="01:20:38.945" style="s2">schemed for, even tried to kill for,</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.344" end="01:20:42.244" style="s2">crumbles to dust right before her eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.945" end="01:20:42.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean, mom?</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.644" end="01:20:49.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t forgotten that she pushed you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.744" end="01:20:51.144" style="s2">Xiao Li Hua wants to protect Xiao Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.744" end="01:20:52.744" style="s2">Let him.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.144" end="01:20:54.344" style="s2">Once they think they&#39;ve got things under</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.744" end="01:20:56.045" style="s2">control again,</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.344" end="01:20:57.445" style="s2">we&#39;ll make them pay back every last bit</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.045" end="01:20:59.545" style="s2">and then some.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.445" end="01:21:00.945" style="s2">Lao Xiao, tell the lawyers they can</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.545" end="01:21:04.744" style="s2">bring out the document they&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.945" end="01:21:04.744" style="s2">drafting for the past 6 months.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.344" end="01:21:13.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m finally out. I&#39;m finally free.</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.545" end="01:21:22.344" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.545" end="01:21:24.844" style="s2">you finally got me out.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.344" end="01:21:28.045" style="s2">It was terrifying in there. I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.844" end="01:21:28.045" style="s2">take another second.</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.545" end="01:21:33.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, young master. We said it</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.844" end="01:21:35.945" style="s2">was an overreaction caused by a family</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.045" end="01:21:38.344" style="s2">dispute with no real harm done. Director</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.945" end="01:21:41.146" style="s2">Xiao also pulled some strings, so you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.344" end="01:21:43.845" style="s2">in the clear for now.</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.146" end="01:21:43.845" style="s2">Good. Good.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.446" end="01:21:49.946" style="s2">Dad, those two little brats, Qin Yueru</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.845" end="01:21:52.345" style="s2">and Ding Xiao, actually planted cameras</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.946" end="01:21:53.146" style="s2">in the room to frame me. I&#39;ll get even</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.345" end="01:21:55.546" style="s2">with them.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.146" end="01:21:55.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get even?</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.345" end="01:22:01.946" style="s2">How? You&#39;re still facing charges. If Qin</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.546" end="01:22:04.946" style="s2">Yueru changes her story, you&#39;ll be right</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.946" end="01:22:04.946" style="s2">back in detention.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.546" end="01:22:09.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we&#39;re just going to take this.</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.946" end="01:22:11.046" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.946" end="01:22:12.646" style="s2">I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.046" end="01:22:15.245" style="s2">But mom didn&#39;t show her face all</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.646" end="01:22:18.046" style="s2">afternoon. She must be dead set on</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.245" end="01:22:18.046" style="s2">ruining me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.546" end="01:22:25.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wei, you must remember that in this</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.446" end="01:22:28.745" style="s2">world there is no eternal family</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.646" end="01:22:31.546" style="s2">affection, only eternal interests. Your</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.745" end="01:22:35.745" style="s2">mother can be so brazen</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.546" end="01:22:38.546" style="s2">because she controls 51% of Qin Group.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.745" end="01:22:41.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you saying, Dad?</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.546" end="01:22:43.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we can get our hands on those 51% of</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.146" end="01:22:45.345" style="s2">shares, Qin Yueru will be nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.845" end="01:22:46.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.345" end="01:22:47.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll be the ones calling the</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.646" end="01:22:49.745" style="s2">shots.</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.845" end="01:22:51.345" style="s2">You won&#39;t just stay out of prison.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.745" end="01:22:52.345" style="s2">You&#39;ll become the rightful heir to the</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.345" end="01:22:54.845" style="s2">group.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.345" end="01:22:58.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll do whatever you say, Dad, as long</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.845" end="01:22:58.046" style="s2">as I get the company.</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.946" end="01:23:20.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yueru Wei made a terrible mistake this</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.345" end="01:23:21.646" style="s2">time,</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.345" end="01:23:24.646" style="s2">but he&#39;s learned his lesson in the</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.646" end="01:23:27.146" style="s2">detention center. He knows he was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.646" end="01:23:27.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes. I know I was wrong. I won&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.146" end="01:23:29.745" style="s2">it again.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.845" end="01:23:32.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all these years of marriage, why</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.745" end="01:23:34.845" style="s2">make things so ugly? Come on, Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.546" end="01:23:36.646" style="s2">Apologize to your mother and Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.845" end="01:23:39.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.646" end="01:23:41.946" style="s2">Xiao, I was foolish. I let others turn</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.345" end="01:23:44.547" style="s2">me against you. I promise I&#39;ll turn over</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.946" end="01:23:47.647" style="s2">a new leaf, treat you right,</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.547" end="01:23:51.247" style="s2">and be a good son to mom.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.647" end="01:23:51.247" style="s2">This drink is to you both.</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.847" end="01:23:55.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, young madam, I know I was wrong,</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.347" end="01:23:58.347" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.747" end="01:24:02.047" style="s2">I&#39;ll behave from now on, have the baby,</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.347" end="01:24:02.047" style="s2">and stay out of the family&#39;s way.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.547" end="01:24:07.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An apology?</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.247" end="01:24:09.147" style="s2">Do you think I&#39;m a little kid?</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.347" end="01:24:10.147" style="s2">Or that everyone in the Qin family is</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.147" end="01:24:12.847" style="s2">dead?</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.147" end="01:24:14.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yueru, what are you saying?</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.847" end="01:24:15.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What am I saying?</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.347" end="01:24:18.647" style="s2">Poisoning someone.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.947" end="01:24:19.947" style="s2">Pushing someone off a building.</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.647" end="01:24:22.847" style="s2">You think paying to get them released</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.947" end="01:24:22.847" style="s2">makes this all go away?</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.047" end="01:24:33.947" style="s2">It&#39;s time to put an end to this family.</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.147" end="01:24:36.347" style="s2">Let&#39;s get a divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.947" end="01:24:38.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I won&#39;t agree to this.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.347" end="01:24:40.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who are you to disagree?</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.947" end="01:24:43.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I&#39;m your husband. You need my</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.947" end="01:24:46.747" style="s2">consent to get a divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.847" end="01:24:46.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send the lawyer in.</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.747" end="01:24:55.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Zhao, this is a divorce agreement</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.547" end="01:24:57.447" style="s2">drafted by Director Qin. During your</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.547" end="01:24:59.247" style="s2">marriage, you committed serious marital</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.447" end="01:25:00.947" style="s2">misconduct, including having a child</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.247" end="01:25:02.547" style="s2">outside the marriage, making threats,</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.947" end="01:25:04.447" style="s2">and covering up for your son, and</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.547" end="01:25:06.247" style="s2">attempting to harm your spouse. Director</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.447" end="01:25:08.747" style="s2">Qin is seeking a division of marital</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.247" end="01:25:10.647" style="s2">assets in accordance with the law.</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.747" end="01:25:11.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qin Yueru, are you trying to leave me</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.647" end="01:25:13.947" style="s2">with nothing?</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.947" end="01:25:16.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, have you lost your mind? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.947" end="01:25:17.547" style="s2">taking everything Dad owns. How are Dad</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.147" end="01:25:20.147" style="s2">and I supposed to live after that?</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.547" end="01:25:20.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your mouth.</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.247" end="01:25:23.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you supposed to live?</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.947" end="01:25:24.947" style="s2">Young Master Zhao, you&#39;re out on bail</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.547" end="01:25:26.247" style="s2">pending trial.</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.947" end="01:25:27.747" style="s2">If mom doesn&#39;t sign a statement</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.247" end="01:25:29.147" style="s2">forgiving you, you&#39;ll spend the rest of</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.747" end="01:25:30.347" style="s2">your life in prison.</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.147" end="01:25:31.547" style="s2">You think trading these shares for your</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.347" end="01:25:33.147" style="s2">freedom is a bad deal?</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.547" end="01:25:34.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qin Yueru, if I, Zhao Lihua, hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.147" end="01:25:36.147" style="s2">worked myself to the bone closing deals</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.647" end="01:25:37.747" style="s2">back then, would the group be where it</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.147" end="01:25:39.147" style="s2">is today? You think you can just kick me</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.747" end="01:25:41.447" style="s2">out now? No chance.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.147" end="01:25:43.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua, if my family hadn&#39;t invested</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.447" end="01:25:45.847" style="s2">in you back then, you&#39;d still be pimping</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.247" end="01:25:45.847" style="s2">on the street.</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.647" end="01:25:52.649" style="s2">The group was left me by my father.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.448" end="01:25:54.948" style="s2">You were just an employee.</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.649" end="01:25:55.749" style="s2">You&#39;re signing this agreement one way or</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.948" end="01:25:57.249" style="s2">another.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.749" end="01:25:58.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I refuse?</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.249" end="01:26:00.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have evidence that you diverted</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.649" end="01:26:03.049" style="s2">company assets and evidence implicating</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.948" end="01:26:04.849" style="s2">Zhao Wei in assault.</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.049" end="01:26:06.849" style="s2">If this goes to court, you won&#39;t get a</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.849" end="01:26:09.249" style="s2">cent and you&#39;ll be joining your son in</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.849" end="01:26:11.948" style="s2">prison.</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.249" end="01:26:14.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chen Yu Ru, don&#39;t push me too far.</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.948" end="01:26:17.349" style="s2">You&#39;ll get my shares over my dead body.</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.448" end="01:26:17.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll see about that.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.948" end="01:26:25.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, looks like he won&#39;t sign the</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.049" end="01:26:25.049" style="s2">divorce agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.149" end="01:26:30.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he won&#39;t sign today,</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.649" end="01:26:30.749" style="s2">I&#39;ll make him sign tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.149" end="01:26:36.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;ll leave with nothing. Chen Yu Ru is</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.749" end="01:26:38.549" style="s2">trying to drive me to my grave. If she</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.249" end="01:26:41.149" style="s2">won&#39;t play fair, then neither will I.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.549" end="01:26:43.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what do we do now? She has evidence</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.149" end="01:26:44.849" style="s2">that Min and I poisoned her. What if she</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.448" end="01:26:47.149" style="s2">really goes to the police?</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.849" end="01:26:49.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you afraid of? We strike first</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.149" end="01:26:50.749" style="s2">and take back the power in her hands.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.249" end="01:26:53.349" style="s2">Then the authorities won&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.749" end="01:26:53.349" style="s2">touch us.</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.649" end="01:27:07.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.849" end="01:27:08.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A forged contract. All we have to do is</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.149" end="01:27:10.849" style="s2">stamp it with Chen Yu Ru&#39;s personal</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.849" end="01:27:12.649" style="s2">seal. Then we can prove she embezzled</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.849" end="01:27:15.448" style="s2">hundreds of millions from the company</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.649" end="01:27:17.549" style="s2">and secretly moved the assets overseas.</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.448" end="01:27:19.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then once this contract gets out, the</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.549" end="01:27:21.349" style="s2">board and the supervisory board will</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.349" end="01:27:23.849" style="s2">remove her as chair right away. The</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.349" end="01:27:26.549" style="s2">police will open an investigation too.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.849" end="01:27:28.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Her shares will all be frozen</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.549" end="01:27:31.249" style="s2">by law. And as the second largest</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.749" end="01:27:32.349" style="s2">shareholder, I can take over the entire</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.249" end="01:27:34.849" style="s2">Zhao group.</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.349" end="01:27:36.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, that&#39;s brilliant. But mom&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.849" end="01:27:39.549" style="s2">personal seal is always in her</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.948" end="01:27:44.049" style="s2">briefcase. She never lets it out of her</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.549" end="01:27:44.049" style="s2">sight. How are we supposed to get it?</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.249" end="01:27:47.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s where you come in.</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.948" end="01:27:49.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.849" end="01:27:51.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Chen Yu Ru is still</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.750" end="01:27:53.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your mother. She may be hard on you, but</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.950" end="01:27:56.250" style="s2">deep down, she wants you to get your</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.750" end="01:27:58.150" style="s2">life back on track. Starting tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.250" end="01:27:58.550" style="s2">swallow your pride and go apologize to</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.150" end="01:28:00.350" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.550" end="01:28:02.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After everything I&#39;ve done to her, if I</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.350" end="01:28:03.250" style="s2">go there acting pitiful, she&#39;ll kick me</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.350" end="01:28:05.250" style="s2">right back out.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.250" end="01:28:06.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No matter how she hits or curses you,</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.250" end="01:28:09.250" style="s2">take it.</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.950" end="01:28:12.650" style="s2">Keep showing up, asking how she is. Cry</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.250" end="01:28:14.950" style="s2">your eyes out and act remorseful.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.650" end="01:28:16.750" style="s2">Just earn her trust and get the seal</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.950" end="01:28:18.750" style="s2">from her briefcase.</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.750" end="01:28:20.750" style="s2">Once she&#39;s saddled with the blame, the</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.750" end="01:28:21.950" style="s2">family fortune will be divided on my</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.750" end="01:28:23.350" style="s2">terms.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.950" end="01:28:25.950" style="s2">Then you&#39;ll still be the Zhu group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.350" end="01:28:27.750" style="s2">sole heir, and your child with Jiang Min</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.950" end="01:28:30.350" style="s2">will be the next heir.</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.750" end="01:28:32.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Dad. I can grovel with the</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.350" end="01:28:35.350" style="s2">best of them. I&#39;ll play the part</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.650" end="01:28:35.350" style="s2">perfectly.</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.150" end="01:28:42.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Zhu Wei and the others have been</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.350" end="01:28:42.250" style="s2">pretty quiet these past few days.</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.550" end="01:28:47.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Believe it or not, someone&#39;s about to</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.550" end="01:28:49.350" style="s2">show up.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.150" end="01:28:49.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.850" end="01:28:52.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Wei, what the hell is wrong with</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.350" end="01:28:53.650" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.350" end="01:28:55.250" style="s2">You dragged me out of bed at the crack</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.650" end="01:28:58.750" style="s2">of dawn and brought me here for what?</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.250" end="01:28:58.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up and come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.250" end="01:29:03.950" style="s2">Get down on your knees. Apologize to Mom</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.450" end="01:29:07.150" style="s2">and Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.950" end="01:29:09.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Wei, you want me to kneel to him?</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.150" end="01:29:11.050" style="s2">I&#39;m pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.350" end="01:29:14.150" style="s2">And you expect me to kneel to this old</p>
<p begin="01:29:11.050" end="01:29:14.150" style="s2">woman and Ding Xiao?</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.250" end="01:29:18.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.050" end="01:29:21.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I was blinded by my own stupidity.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.850" end="01:29:22.150" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know what I had. I&#39;m sorry. I</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.250" end="01:29:25.250" style="s2">was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.150" end="01:29:27.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that&#39;s how you apologize?</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.250" end="01:29:30.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t be mad. I&#39;ll teach Jiang Min</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.050" end="01:29:30.350" style="s2">a lesson. She&#39;ll listen.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.750" end="01:29:33.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did being locked up make you lose your</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.050" end="01:29:34.550" style="s2">mind?</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.250" end="01:29:36.850" style="s2">Didn&#39;t we agree that we would?</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.550" end="01:29:36.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.950" end="01:29:40.650" style="s2">If you want to die, don&#39;t take me down</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.350" end="01:29:40.650" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.750" end="01:29:44.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you afraid of?</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.250" end="01:29:45.750" style="s2">Your mom isn&#39;t even doing anything right</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.850" end="01:29:47.150" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.750" end="01:29:49.650" style="s2">Why are you rushing to suck up to her?</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.150" end="01:29:53.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you know? If my mom wants to,</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.650" end="01:29:53.751" style="s2">the police can lock us up again anytime.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.851" end="01:29:58.251" style="s2">You think you&#39;re safe just because you</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.351" end="01:30:00.552" style="s2">got bail?</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.251" end="01:30:02.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t just grovel like dogs either.</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.552" end="01:30:04.251" style="s2">You want me to kneel to Ding Xiao?</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.451" end="01:30:08.151" style="s2">Who does she think she is?</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.251" end="01:30:08.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She holds our lives in her hands.</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.151" end="01:30:14.052" style="s2">Jiang Min, I&#39;m warning you. The only way</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.851" end="01:30:15.951" style="s2">we&#39;ll be safe is if we appease my mom</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.052" end="01:30:17.552" style="s2">and Ding Xiao and get them to sign a</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.951" end="01:30:19.651" style="s2">letter of forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.552" end="01:30:21.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A letter of forgiveness?</p>
<p begin="01:30:19.651" end="01:30:23.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that&#39;s not all. I&#39;m getting my</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.451" end="01:30:25.651" style="s2">shares back. Don&#39;t you want to be the</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.451" end="01:30:27.552" style="s2">Xiao family&#39;s daughter-in-law? Don&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.651" end="01:30:30.052" style="s2">want your son to inherit the family</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.552" end="01:30:30.052" style="s2">fortune?</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.251" end="01:30:32.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:30:31.951" end="01:30:34.851" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.552" end="01:30:37.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No buts.</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.851" end="01:30:40.052" style="s2">From now on, you do whatever I tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.751" end="01:30:42.351" style="s2">If you dare ruin my plans,</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.052" end="01:30:45.351" style="s2">I&#39;ll be the first to make you pay. Do</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.351" end="01:30:45.351" style="s2">you understand?</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.387" end="01:30:48.407" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.951" end="01:30:59.851" style="s2">Mom, I really know I was wrong. I was</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.552" end="01:31:02.052" style="s2">out of my mind listening to what people</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.851" end="01:31:04.351" style="s2">outside the family said. That&#39;s why I</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.052" end="01:31:06.351" style="s2">did something so unforgivable. I&#39;m a</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.351" end="01:31:08.451" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.351" end="01:31:12.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, what are you waiting for?</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.451" end="01:31:12.052" style="s2">Apologize to Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.451" end="01:31:19.951" style="s2">Xiao Wei, you&#39;d better explain yourself</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.851" end="01:31:21.151" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.951" end="01:31:22.052" style="s2">Was that really how you talked in the</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.151" end="01:31:23.351" style="s2">hall?</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.052" end="01:31:24.751" style="s2">You were so busy sucking up to those</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.351" end="01:31:25.851" style="s2">two, you didn&#39;t even care about your own</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.751" end="01:31:27.151" style="s2">son.</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.851" end="01:31:29.552" style="s2">Is that it?</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.151" end="01:31:33.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your voice down. The walls have</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.552" end="01:31:34.951" style="s2">ears. You want them to hear us?</p>
<p begin="01:31:33.651" end="01:31:37.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them hear.</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.951" end="01:31:39.251" style="s2">We might as well all go down together.</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.251" end="01:31:41.251" style="s2">I&#39;ll never forget you hitting me today.</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.251" end="01:31:42.751" style="s2">Not for the rest of my life.</p>
<p begin="01:31:41.251" end="01:31:44.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You silly little thing. What do you</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.751" end="01:31:46.251" style="s2">know? If I don&#39;t make it convincing,</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.552" end="01:31:48.052" style="s2">would that old fox Chen Yu&#39;er believe</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.251" end="01:31:50.151" style="s2">I&#39;ve truly changed? You think I wanted</p>
<p begin="01:31:48.052" end="01:31:53.351" style="s2">to kneel? You think I wanted to hit you?</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.151" end="01:31:54.952" style="s2">My dad has already drawn up a contract.</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.351" end="01:31:56.952" style="s2">All we need is Chen Yu&#39;er&#39;s personal</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.952" end="01:31:58.752" style="s2">seal from her briefcase. Stamp it on the</p>
<p begin="01:31:56.952" end="01:32:00.352" style="s2">contract and we can accuse her of</p>
<p begin="01:31:58.752" end="01:32:02.352" style="s2">secretly siphoning hundreds of millions</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.352" end="01:32:04.153" style="s2">from the company.</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.352" end="01:32:05.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.153" end="01:32:07.752" style="s2">Are you serious?</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.952" end="01:32:09.952" style="s2">If we get her seal, we can turn this</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.752" end="01:32:12.653" style="s2">around.</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.952" end="01:32:15.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obviously. So at dinner, no matter how</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.653" end="01:32:16.153" style="s2">Ding Xiao treats you, just put up with</p>
<p begin="01:32:15.052" end="01:32:18.552" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.153" end="01:32:22.653" style="s2">Not only that you have to act even more</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.552" end="01:32:24.052" style="s2">obedient than I do. Do you understand?</p>
<p begin="01:32:22.653" end="01:32:26.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.052" end="01:32:28.552" style="s2">Xiao Wei, I&#39;ll do what you say.</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.752" end="01:32:29.752" style="s2">As long as we can kill those two, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.552" end="01:32:31.752" style="s2">do anything.</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.752" end="01:32:35.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I spent 3 hours making this black</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.752" end="01:32:35.752" style="s2">chicken soup myself. Give it a try.</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.252" end="01:32:39.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.552" end="01:32:41.852" style="s2">You overcooked it a bit.</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.852" end="01:32:43.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes. I&#39;ll be more careful next</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.852" end="01:32:45.852" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.653" end="01:32:47.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, I&#39;m a little thirsty.</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.852" end="01:32:50.252" style="s2">Go get me some hot water.</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.653" end="01:32:52.252" style="s2">Make sure it&#39;s exactly 45 degrees.</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.252" end="01:32:55.752" style="s2">1 degree hotter is too hot.</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.252" end="01:32:55.752" style="s2">1 degree cooler is too cold.</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.452" end="01:33:02.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here you go, sis.</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.452" end="01:33:09.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too cold.</p>
<p begin="01:33:07.852" end="01:33:11.552" style="s2">Get me another cup.</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.252" end="01:33:15.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless. You can&#39;t even pour a glass of</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.552" end="01:33:15.852" style="s2">water. Go get Xiao another cup now.</p>
<p begin="01:33:16.752" end="01:33:20.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough, Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:33:18.552" end="01:33:23.952" style="s2">Don&#39;t be so hard on her.</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.452" end="01:33:23.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I appreciate the thought, son.</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.252" end="01:33:29.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, this bag is pretty heavy and it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.653" end="01:33:32.653" style="s2">in the way on the table. I&#39;ll hang it by</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.752" end="01:33:32.653" style="s2">the door for you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.752" end="01:33:38.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.352" end="01:33:39.852" style="s2">This bag has contracts for several major</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.052" end="01:33:41.052" style="s2">projects the company just finalized,</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.852" end="01:33:42.252" style="s2">along with some important personal</p>
<p begin="01:33:41.052" end="01:33:44.153" style="s2">items.</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.252" end="01:33:46.952" style="s2">I&#39;m used to keeping them with me.</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.153" end="01:33:49.352" style="s2">I&#39;d worry if I left them somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="01:33:46.952" end="01:33:50.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes. You&#39;re right, mom. It&#39;s safer</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.352" end="01:33:52.653" style="s2">to keep it with you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.752" end="01:33:54.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so considerate of mom.</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.653" end="01:33:55.653" style="s2">But if you&#39;re so devoted, just making</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.153" end="01:33:57.154" style="s2">her chicken soup and carrying her bag</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.653" end="01:33:58.254" style="s2">might not be enough to show it, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.154" end="01:33:59.954" style="s2">you think?</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.254" end="01:34:01.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.954" end="01:34:03.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since Wei wants to show his devotion, I</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.654" end="01:34:06.754" style="s2">noticed the vase is pretty dusty.</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.854" end="01:34:06.754" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you wipe it down?</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.854" end="01:34:09.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.354" end="01:34:14.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; blue and white vase from the early Qing</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.854" end="01:34:16.154" style="s2">is pretty dusty in the back.</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.654" end="01:34:18.654" style="s2">You&#39;re so thorough.</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.154" end="01:34:20.954" style="s2">Go clean back there too.</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.654" end="01:34:22.454" style="s2">Remember that vase is delicate.</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.954" end="01:34:23.854" style="s2">Use a feather duster and dust it one</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.454" end="01:34:25.254" style="s2">spot at a time.</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.854" end="01:34:27.654" style="s2">Don&#39;t let your hand shake.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.254" end="01:34:30.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Don&#39;t worry, Xiao. I&#39;ll do it</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.654" end="01:34:30.254" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="01:34:31.710" end="01:34:33.730" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.454" end="01:34:41.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, which of these maternity outfits in</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.254" end="01:34:42.754" style="s2">the magazine do you like best?</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.254" end="01:34:44.454" style="s2">I&#39;d love to hear what you think.</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.754" end="01:34:45.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, do you really think I feel</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.454" end="01:34:46.954" style="s2">like discussing maternity clothes with</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.954" end="01:34:49.754" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:34:46.954" end="01:34:49.754" style="s2">Know your place.</p>
<p begin="01:34:50.954" end="01:34:54.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, I&#39;m feeling a little tired.</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.154" end="01:34:54.954" style="s2">Come upstairs with me and rest for a</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.554" end="01:34:57.854" style="s2">while.</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.954" end="01:34:57.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:35:01.354" end="01:35:05.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quick, go keep watch by the stairs.</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.454" end="01:35:10.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.154" end="01:35:10.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.854" end="01:35:16.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, how did you get back down here?</p>
<p begin="01:35:12.854" end="01:35:16.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom left her shawl on the sofa.</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.154" end="01:35:22.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Xiaoer, I just saw the zipper on</p>
<p begin="01:35:20.754" end="01:35:25.054" style="s2">this bag was open. I was worried some</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.954" end="01:35:26.954" style="s2">important documents might fall out.</p>
<p begin="01:35:25.054" end="01:35:28.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, I was zipping it up for mom. I</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.954" end="01:35:29.054" style="s2">was just about to take it upstairs to</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.654" end="01:35:30.354" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.054" end="01:35:32.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.354" end="01:35:33.854" style="s2">How kind of you, your highness.</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.454" end="01:35:35.354" style="s2">Give me the bag.</p>
<p begin="01:35:33.854" end="01:35:37.754" style="s2">I &#39;ll take it upstairs to mom.</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.354" end="01:35:40.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Of course. Here, Xiao, take</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.754" end="01:35:40.754" style="s2">it. Don&#39;t drop it.</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.554" end="01:35:51.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, you absolute idiot.</p>
<p begin="01:35:49.554" end="01:35:54.254" style="s2">You were this close to getting it.</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.954" end="01:35:55.954" style="s2">Why were your hands shaking?</p>
<p begin="01:35:54.254" end="01:35:57.154" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you just unzip it and take</p>
<p begin="01:35:55.954" end="01:35:58.954" style="s2">out the company seal?</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.154" end="01:36:01.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you know? Ding Xiao was watching</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.954" end="01:36:02.656" style="s2">from upstairs. If I tried to snatch it,</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.356" end="01:36:04.156" style="s2">the bodyguards at the gate would have</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.656" end="01:36:05.756" style="s2">pinned me down in seconds and handed me</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.156" end="01:36:07.955" style="s2">over to the police. Would you have come</p>
<p begin="01:36:05.756" end="01:36:09.356" style="s2">to save me?</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.955" end="01:36:11.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuses.</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.356" end="01:36:14.256" style="s2">Nothing but excuses.</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.256" end="01:36:16.756" style="s2">You&#39;re just scared of them.</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.256" end="01:36:19.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know my mom. She may say she</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.756" end="01:36:21.955" style="s2">appreciates my gesture,</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.156" end="01:36:24.055" style="s2">but she&#39;s extremely suspicious. We need</p>
<p begin="01:36:21.955" end="01:36:26.555" style="s2">to come up with a way to make her hand</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.055" end="01:36:28.356" style="s2">the bag over to me herself.</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.555" end="01:36:30.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hand it over to you herself?</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.356" end="01:36:32.756" style="s2">How would that even happen?</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.156" end="01:36:36.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why couldn&#39;t it? Tomorrow morning is the</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.756" end="01:36:37.856" style="s2">company&#39;s quarterly executive meeting.</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.055" end="01:36:40.256" style="s2">She&#39;ll definitely take her briefcase to</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.856" end="01:36:42.656" style="s2">the office. Then we can sneak it out on</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.256" end="01:36:42.656" style="s2">the way.</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.156" end="01:36:53.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, look.</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.356" end="01:36:54.555" style="s2">Those two are running around like</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.055" end="01:36:56.055" style="s2">headless chickens now.</p>
<p begin="01:36:54.555" end="01:36:57.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Li was getting desperate because of</p>
<p begin="01:36:56.055" end="01:36:58.955" style="s2">the divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:36:57.656" end="01:37:01.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t get anything from a normal</p>
<p begin="01:36:58.955" end="01:37:02.955" style="s2">divorce, so he&#39;s having Joe Wei steal</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.156" end="01:37:04.756" style="s2">the company seal and forge evidence that</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.955" end="01:37:06.356" style="s2">I moved assets.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.756" end="01:37:07.156" style="s2">Then he&#39;d use it to turn the tables on</p>
<p begin="01:37:06.356" end="01:37:09.055" style="s2">me in court.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.156" end="01:37:11.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.055" end="01:37:12.656" style="s2">Keep playing with them?</p>
<p begin="01:37:11.156" end="01:37:14.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.656" end="01:37:16.955" style="s2">Let&#39;s keep playing.</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.856" end="01:37:18.856" style="s2">If we don&#39;t give them a little hope, how</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.955" end="01:37:22.055" style="s2">will Joe Li Hua dare to produce that</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.856" end="01:37:22.055" style="s2">forged contract?</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.955" end="01:37:28.055" style="s2">Don&#39;t they want the company seal?</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.455" end="01:37:35.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yu Ru, now that everyone&#39;s here, can we</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.156" end="01:37:37.055" style="s2">sign off on the additional budget for</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.156" end="01:37:37.756" style="s2">the overseas projects in the second</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.055" end="01:37:39.356" style="s2">quarter?</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.756" end="01:37:41.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.356" end="01:37:45.156" style="s2">Before I sign, I need to check last</p>
<p begin="01:37:41.555" end="01:37:45.156" style="s2">quarter&#39;s financial statements.</p>
<p begin="01:37:45.555" end="01:37:50.356" style="s2">Wei Er, my eyes are a little strained</p>
<p begin="01:37:47.455" end="01:37:51.955" style="s2">today, and I can&#39;t see very well.</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.356" end="01:37:53.756" style="s2">Could you get my briefcase and take out</p>
<p begin="01:37:51.955" end="01:37:54.455" style="s2">the financial statements and my personal</p>
<p begin="01:37:53.756" end="01:37:56.555" style="s2">seal?</p>
<p begin="01:37:54.455" end="01:37:58.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, mom. You rest. I&#39;ll get it</p>
<p begin="01:37:56.555" end="01:37:58.856" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.856" end="01:38:06.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wei Er, did find them?</p>
<p begin="01:38:04.757" end="01:38:08.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, in the bag, I don&#39;t think the</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.357" end="01:38:10.556" style="s2">statements you mentioned are in here.</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.556" end="01:38:12.656" style="s2">And I I can&#39;t find the seal either.</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.556" end="01:38:14.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can they not be there? Did you miss</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.656" end="01:38:14.857" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="01:38:15.656" end="01:38:19.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course they&#39;re not there.</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.257" end="01:38:21.457" style="s2">Mom would never leave something</p>
<p begin="01:38:19.757" end="01:38:22.457" style="s2">important where just anyone could get</p>
<p begin="01:38:21.457" end="01:38:23.957" style="s2">their hands on it.</p>
<p begin="01:38:22.457" end="01:38:25.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I forgot.</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.957" end="01:38:26.857" style="s2">That bag only has a little cartoon stamp</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.757" end="01:38:28.357" style="s2">in it.</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.857" end="01:38:29.556" style="s2">The real seal is right here.</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.357" end="01:38:30.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cheng Yu Er</p>
<p begin="01:38:29.556" end="01:38:32.156" style="s2">Are you playing me?</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.556" end="01:38:33.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.156" end="01:38:34.556" style="s2">Mom just keeps the company seal with</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.656" end="01:38:35.556" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:38:34.556" end="01:38:37.757" style="s2">How is that playing you?</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.556" end="01:38:37.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:38:39.056" end="01:38:42.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Xiaomin calling.</p>
<p begin="01:38:40.556" end="01:38:44.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, help me.</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.257" end="01:38:46.357" style="s2">I&#39;m bleeding. There&#39;s so much blood.</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.457" end="01:38:49.156" style="s2">My stomach hurts so bad.</p>
<p begin="01:38:46.357" end="01:38:49.156" style="s2">The baby&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="01:38:59.156" end="01:39:02.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.757" end="01:39:04.757" style="s2">why are you even more nervous than I am?</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.757" end="01:39:06.757" style="s2">It&#39;s Jiang Min&#39;s first baby. The doctor</p>
<p begin="01:39:04.757" end="01:39:08.957" style="s2">said going into labor early is normal.</p>
<p begin="01:39:06.757" end="01:39:10.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you know? This baby is the only</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.957" end="01:39:12.757" style="s2">card we have left to play.</p>
<p begin="01:39:10.957" end="01:39:15.257" style="s2">Once he&#39;s born, he&#39;ll be the Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.757" end="01:39:17.357" style="s2">family&#39;s eldest grandson. Then I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="01:39:15.257" end="01:39:20.357" style="s2">grounds to demand a new division of the</p>
<p begin="01:39:17.357" end="01:39:20.357" style="s2">family trust.</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.656" end="01:39:28.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, right. He&#39;s my own son. Once he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:39:23.757" end="01:39:28.357" style="s2">here, mom can&#39;t really abandon me.</p>
<p begin="01:39:29.357" end="01:39:33.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is Jiang Min&#39;s family? The mother</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.156" end="01:39:35.556" style="s2">has fainted and her water has broken.</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.656" end="01:39:37.056" style="s2">She&#39;s at risk of severe bleeding.</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.556" end="01:39:38.156" style="s2">We need a family member to consent to a</p>
<p begin="01:39:37.056" end="01:39:41.156" style="s2">C-section.</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.156" end="01:39:41.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Severe bleeding?</p>
<p begin="01:39:42.656" end="01:39:47.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll sign. I&#39;m family.</p>
<p begin="01:39:44.957" end="01:39:50.457" style="s2">Doctor, I don&#39;t care what it takes. You</p>
<p begin="01:39:47.556" end="01:39:51.056" style="s2">must save the baby. Do you hear me? Save</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.457" end="01:39:53.257" style="s2">the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:39:51.056" end="01:39:55.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I&#39;m Jiang Min&#39;s husband. I should</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.257" end="01:39:55.857" style="s2">be the one signing. Why are you rushing</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.156" end="01:39:57.757" style="s2">to sign?</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.857" end="01:40:00.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless. Why were you backing down just</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.757" end="01:40:04.556" style="s2">now? This is a serious decision. Can you</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.457" end="01:40:04.556" style="s2">take responsibility? Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.656" end="01:40:09.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua, Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.058" end="01:40:11.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wei, go ahead and keep fighting.</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.158" end="01:40:12.058" style="s2">The higher you climb, the harder you</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.158" end="01:40:13.958" style="s2">fall.</p>
<p begin="01:40:12.058" end="01:40:14.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother and baby are both safe. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.958" end="01:40:17.758" style="s2">boy.</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.858" end="01:40:19.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my son. Nurse, how&#39;s my wife?</p>
<p begin="01:40:17.758" end="01:40:22.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s doing fine. We&#39;ll move her to a</p>
<p begin="01:40:19.558" end="01:40:22.458" style="s2">regular room shortly.</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.158" end="01:40:31.458" style="s2">Congratulations. It&#39;s a boy, 6 lbs 2 oz</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.558" end="01:40:34.958" style="s2">and perfectly healthy.</p>
<p begin="01:40:31.458" end="01:40:34.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give him to me. I&#39;ll hold him.</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.758" end="01:40:43.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at him. He really does look like</p>
<p begin="01:40:40.858" end="01:40:44.858" style="s2">me. That nose, those eyes exactly like</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.558" end="01:40:47.758" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.858" end="01:40:50.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, take it easy. He&#39;s my son, the Joe</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.758" end="01:40:52.258" style="s2">family&#39;s eldest grandson. Now that he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:40:50.158" end="01:40:54.358" style="s2">here, mom will have to hand over her</p>
<p begin="01:40:52.258" end="01:40:56.358" style="s2">shares this time.</p>
<p begin="01:40:54.358" end="01:40:58.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful, you too.</p>
<p begin="01:40:56.358" end="01:41:03.058" style="s2">Don&#39;t drop the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:40:58.658" end="01:41:03.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t drop him. He&#39;s my son.</p>
<p begin="01:41:04.558" end="01:41:09.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are you came at the perfect time.</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.758" end="01:41:10.858" style="s2">Look, this is the Joe family&#39;s future.</p>
<p begin="01:41:09.458" end="01:41:13.058" style="s2">And with the baby here, it&#39;s a happy</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.858" end="01:41:14.258" style="s2">occasion. Forgive Wei and let&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:41:13.058" end="01:41:15.358" style="s2">forget about the divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:41:14.258" end="01:41:16.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it?</p>
<p begin="01:41:15.358" end="01:41:18.258" style="s2">Why should I?</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.658" end="01:41:19.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even you couldn&#39;t be so heartless as to</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.258" end="01:41:20.258" style="s2">ruin your own grandson&#39;s future, could</p>
<p begin="01:41:19.958" end="01:41:23.058" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:41:20.258" end="01:41:25.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom Jiang Min has given me a son. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:41:23.058" end="01:41:27.558" style="s2">the Joe family&#39;s only heir.</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.558" end="01:41:28.858" style="s2">The shares you hold will be passed on to</p>
<p begin="01:41:27.558" end="01:41:30.258" style="s2">me sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="01:41:28.858" end="01:41:32.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re sure he&#39;s the Joe family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.258" end="01:41:32.658" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="01:41:33.958" end="01:41:38.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Joe Wei, don&#39;t get worked up.</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.558" end="01:41:41.358" style="s2">Mom doesn&#39;t mean any harm.</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.458" end="01:41:41.358" style="s2">Let me hold the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.058" end="01:41:46.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful. Don&#39;t drop my grandson.</p>
<p begin="01:41:44.158" end="01:41:46.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Who knows if Ding Xiao might hurt my</p>
<p begin="01:41:46.458" end="01:41:48.958" style="s2">son?</p>
<p begin="01:41:46.958" end="01:41:50.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not like you, Joe Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:41:48.958" end="01:41:52.358" style="s2">I would never hurt a child.</p>
<p begin="01:41:50.058" end="01:41:52.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="01:41:56.358" end="01:41:59.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Lihua, don&#39;t use the baby to</p>
<p begin="01:41:58.358" end="01:42:02.458" style="s2">threaten me.</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.858" end="01:42:04.458" style="s2">You&#39;re signing the divorce papers</p>
<p begin="01:42:02.458" end="01:42:07.258" style="s2">one way or another.</p>
<p begin="01:42:04.458" end="01:42:07.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qin You are don&#39;t push me too far.</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.258" end="01:42:09.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m pushing</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.659" end="01:42:09.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; too far.</p>
<p begin="01:42:09.058" end="01:42:12.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Lihua,</p>
<p begin="01:42:09.759" end="01:42:12.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve put up with you long enough.</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.759" end="01:42:21.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, have you held him long</p>
<p begin="01:42:18.159" end="01:42:21.659" style="s2">enough? What are you doing to my son?</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.459" end="01:42:27.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve held him long enough.</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.459" end="01:42:29.859" style="s2">This baby sure is something.</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.759" end="01:42:32.159" style="s2">Joe Wei, you better be a good father to</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.859" end="01:42:32.159" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:42:35.159" end="01:42:38.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you get the items, ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.259" end="01:42:44.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These belong to Joe Wei and the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.559" end="01:42:45.759" style="s2">Get a paternity test done on Joe Wei and</p>
<p begin="01:42:44.359" end="01:42:48.059" style="s2">this child as soon as possible.</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.759" end="01:42:49.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, do you suspect the child isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:42:48.059" end="01:42:51.959" style="s2">the young master&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.759" end="01:42:55.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fool Joe Wei was tricked by Jiang</p>
<p begin="01:42:51.959" end="01:42:57.559" style="s2">Min and still thinks he&#39;s won.</p>
<p begin="01:42:55.559" end="01:42:59.959" style="s2">The earlier test already proved the</p>
<p begin="01:42:57.559" end="01:43:02.259" style="s2">child isn&#39;t Joe Wei&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:42:59.959" end="01:43:03.659" style="s2">Now I just need proof.</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.259" end="01:43:04.259" style="s2">There&#39;s something else I&#39;m wondering</p>
<p begin="01:43:03.659" end="01:43:06.659" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:43:04.259" end="01:43:06.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean?</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.959" end="01:43:11.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never mind.</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.659" end="01:43:12.859" style="s2">Get this result first, then test the</p>
<p begin="01:43:11.459" end="01:43:13.859" style="s2">other thing.</p>
<p begin="01:43:12.859" end="01:43:15.559" style="s2">I might be wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:43:13.859" end="01:43:16.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="01:43:15.559" end="01:43:19.359" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it straight to the private</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.959" end="01:43:22.359" style="s2">testing center we control.</p>
<p begin="01:43:19.359" end="01:43:24.359" style="s2">It&#39;s completely secure and confidential.</p>
<p begin="01:43:22.359" end="01:43:26.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, no one can know about this</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.359" end="01:43:29.159" style="s2">except mom and me.</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.859" end="01:43:32.059" style="s2">Especially Joe Li Hua.</p>
<p begin="01:43:29.159" end="01:43:34.359" style="s2">He treats this child like his lifeline.</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.059" end="01:43:35.659" style="s2">If he gets even a hint,</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.359" end="01:43:38.159" style="s2">he&#39;ll do whatever it takes to switch the</p>
<p begin="01:43:35.659" end="01:43:38.159" style="s2">samples.</p>
<p begin="01:43:38.659" end="01:43:43.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:43:40.659" end="01:43:45.459" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep a close eye on it myself.</p>
<p begin="01:43:43.459" end="01:43:47.259" style="s2">Not even a fly will get in.</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.459" end="01:43:48.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll announce the establishment of this</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.259" end="01:43:50.259" style="s2">fund at the baby&#39;s one-month</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.859" end="01:43:52.659" style="s2">celebration.</p>
<p begin="01:43:50.259" end="01:43:56.059" style="s2">I&#39;ll transfer all my overseas assets</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.659" end="01:43:56.059" style="s2">into my grandson&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.359" end="01:44:00.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brilliant, Chairman Joe. That will make</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.259" end="01:44:02.459" style="s2">these assets legally independent beyond</p>
<p begin="01:44:00.659" end="01:44:04.659" style="s2">Director Chen&#39;s reach.</p>
<p begin="01:44:02.459" end="01:44:06.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;ve been talking for ages.</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.659" end="01:44:08.559" style="s2">You must be thirsty.</p>
<p begin="01:44:06.259" end="01:44:10.661" style="s2">Try some Dahongpao I just brewed.</p>
<p begin="01:44:08.559" end="01:44:13.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao is such a good daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.661" end="01:44:13.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei is lucky to have you.</p>
<p begin="01:44:17.961" end="01:44:22.261" style="s2">You all keep talking. I need to take an</p>
<p begin="01:44:19.561" end="01:44:22.261" style="s2">important call.</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.761" end="01:44:29.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We only get one shot.</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.561" end="01:44:30.861" style="s2">We can&#39;t mess this up.</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.361" end="01:44:32.561" style="s2">Joe Lihua, if you&#39;re related to this</p>
<p begin="01:44:30.861" end="01:44:34.361" style="s2">baby, we&#39;re in trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:44:32.561" end="01:44:36.661" style="s2">If you&#39;re not.</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.361" end="01:44:39.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam.</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.661" end="01:44:39.161" style="s2">Young Madam.</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.261" end="01:44:44.761" style="s2">The first set of test results isn&#39;t back</p>
<p begin="01:44:42.261" end="01:44:46.561" style="s2">yet, but at young Madam&#39;s request, I</p>
<p begin="01:44:44.761" end="01:44:48.661" style="s2">looked into all of Jiang Min&#39;s social</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.561" end="01:44:50.561" style="s2">activities and bank transactions during</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.661" end="01:44:52.461" style="s2">her pregnancy.</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.561" end="01:44:54.161" style="s2">I found something significant.</p>
<p begin="01:44:52.461" end="01:44:56.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this?</p>
<p begin="01:44:54.161" end="01:44:58.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name is A Bin.</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.361" end="01:45:00.861" style="s2">Jiang Min has always told people he&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.461" end="01:45:02.861" style="s2">distant cousin.</p>
<p begin="01:45:00.861" end="01:45:04.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A distant cousin?</p>
<p begin="01:45:02.861" end="01:45:06.361" style="s2">I doubt that&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.261" end="01:45:10.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We found out he&#39;s unemployed and often</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.361" end="01:45:12.261" style="s2">works as a male model at bars and clubs.</p>
<p begin="01:45:10.061" end="01:45:14.361" style="s2">Jiang Min regularly transfers large sums</p>
<p begin="01:45:12.261" end="01:45:16.561" style="s2">to his account every month, tens of</p>
<p begin="01:45:14.361" end="01:45:19.361" style="s2">thousands at least, sometimes hundreds</p>
<p begin="01:45:16.561" end="01:45:19.361" style="s2">of thousands.</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.761" end="01:45:23.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A cousin?</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.461" end="01:45:26.161" style="s2">What cousin spends half the day with his</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.461" end="01:45:27.861" style="s2">pregnant cousin at a budget hotel?</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.161" end="01:45:29.661" style="s2">And what cousin gives him hundreds of</p>
<p begin="01:45:27.861" end="01:45:32.461" style="s2">thousands to spend every month?</p>
<p begin="01:45:29.661" end="01:45:34.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like we underestimated Jiang Min.</p>
<p begin="01:45:32.461" end="01:45:35.761" style="s2">She&#39;s more ambitious and audacious than</p>
<p begin="01:45:34.361" end="01:45:37.161" style="s2">we thought.</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.761" end="01:45:39.861" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t just want something for</p>
<p begin="01:45:37.161" end="01:45:41.961" style="s2">nothing. She wants to use a baby to play</p>
<p begin="01:45:39.861" end="01:45:44.561" style="s2">both the Chen and Xiao families like</p>
<p begin="01:45:41.961" end="01:45:46.561" style="s2">puppets.</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.561" end="01:45:48.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Madam, I personally found this</p>
<p begin="01:45:46.561" end="01:45:51.061" style="s2">last night in the alley behind the bar A</p>
<p begin="01:45:48.761" end="01:45:53.861" style="s2">Bin often visits.</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.061" end="01:45:58.261" style="s2">I&#39;ve checked it. The saliva DNA is still</p>
<p begin="01:45:53.861" end="01:45:58.261" style="s2">viable and can be used as a test sample.</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.161" end="01:46:08.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the test shows A Bin is the father,</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.561" end="01:46:11.661" style="s2">Xiao Wei and Xiao Lihua are going to</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.761" end="01:46:13.962" style="s2">lose their minds.</p>
<p begin="01:46:11.661" end="01:46:15.462" style="s2">And the assets they moved overseas will</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.962" end="01:46:17.062" style="s2">all be for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:46:15.462" end="01:46:19.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.062" end="01:46:22.363" style="s2">Lao Jiao, send both samples to the lab</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.262" end="01:46:22.363" style="s2">for testing.</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.562" end="01:46:33.262" style="s2">I want hard evidence in black and white</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.262" end="01:46:34.962" style="s2">to nail them for good.</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.262" end="01:46:36.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the best way.</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.962" end="01:46:39.863" style="s2">Joe Lihua can&#39;t use her eldest grandson</p>
<p begin="01:46:36.863" end="01:46:39.863" style="s2">to pressure me anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:46:41.863" end="01:46:45.662" style="s2">What are you so happy about, Jiao?</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.962" end="01:46:55.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, look.</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.962" end="01:46:55.062" style="s2">The results are in.</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.262" end="01:47:03.363" style="s2">They rule out any blood relation to Joe</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.363" end="01:47:06.062" style="s2">Lihua and Joe Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:47:03.363" end="01:47:08.962" style="s2">This child isn&#39;t a Zhao at all.</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.062" end="01:47:11.762" style="s2">The parents are Jiang Min and Aiden.</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.962" end="01:47:13.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Jiang Min, she&#39;s quite something.</p>
<p begin="01:47:11.762" end="01:47:15.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quite something?</p>
<p begin="01:47:13.262" end="01:47:17.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She really is.</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.262" end="01:47:19.762" style="s2">That little brat had Joe Lihua and Joe</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.262" end="01:47:21.462" style="s2">Wei, two selfish fools, dancing in the</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.762" end="01:47:23.562" style="s2">palm of her hand.</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.462" end="01:47:25.962" style="s2">Joe Lihua even planned to leave all his</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.562" end="01:47:27.962" style="s2">overseas assets to the child.</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.962" end="01:47:30.162" style="s2">What a joke.</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.962" end="01:47:31.863" style="s2">Jiao, isn&#39;t Joe Lihua throwing a</p>
<p begin="01:47:30.162" end="01:47:33.863" style="s2">month-old celebration for the baby</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.863" end="01:47:36.062" style="s2">tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.863" end="01:47:37.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.062" end="01:47:40.062" style="s2">He invited all the city&#39;s elite and</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.962" end="01:47:43.562" style="s2">plans to make a big show of it while</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.062" end="01:47:43.562" style="s2">pressuring you to step down.</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.762" end="01:47:49.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.962" end="01:47:52.262" style="s2">Then tomorrow we&#39;ll give father and son</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.162" end="01:47:53.562" style="s2">a first month gift they&#39;ll never forget.</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.262" end="01:47:55.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to announce in front of</p>
<p begin="01:47:53.562" end="01:47:56.662" style="s2">everyone that the child isn&#39;t a Zhao?</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.062" end="01:47:58.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m also going to divorce Joe Lihua in</p>
<p begin="01:47:56.662" end="01:48:00.162" style="s2">front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:47:58.762" end="01:48:02.762" style="s2">We can&#39;t let a parasite like him stay</p>
<p begin="01:48:00.162" end="01:48:02.762" style="s2">with the company.</p>
<p begin="01:48:05.462" end="01:48:10.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baby&#39;s 100-day celebration is the</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.262" end="01:48:14.062" style="s2">day after tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.162" end="01:48:15.662" style="s2">I booked Bai Jing Han Ju at downtown.</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.062" end="01:48:17.864" style="s2">We&#39;ve invited everyone who&#39;s anyone in</p>
<p begin="01:48:15.662" end="01:48:19.763" style="s2">the city. That day, in front of all our</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.864" end="01:48:21.464" style="s2">relatives and the directors, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:48:19.763" end="01:48:25.163" style="s2">announce the establishment of a trust</p>
<p begin="01:48:21.464" end="01:48:26.964" style="s2">fund for the eldest grandchild.</p>
<p begin="01:48:25.163" end="01:48:29.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My parents have been keeping a close eye</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.964" end="01:48:31.464" style="s2">on things lately.</p>
<p begin="01:48:29.864" end="01:48:33.263" style="s2">She keeps the company seal locked in her</p>
<p begin="01:48:31.464" end="01:48:35.063" style="s2">handbag. I tried to borrow a lighter</p>
<p begin="01:48:33.263" end="01:48:37.464" style="s2">yesterday, and she wouldn&#39;t even let me</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.063" end="01:48:39.663" style="s2">into the study.</p>
<p begin="01:48:37.464" end="01:48:41.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="01:48:39.663" end="01:48:43.364" style="s2">there&#39;ll be all sorts of people at the</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.063" end="01:48:45.563" style="s2">hotel on the day of the celebration. Our</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.364" end="01:48:47.263" style="s2">people set up the security system. When</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.563" end="01:48:50.663" style="s2">she&#39;s handing out business cards, you</p>
<p begin="01:48:47.263" end="01:48:50.663" style="s2">slip the seal out of her bag.</p>
<p begin="01:48:50.864" end="01:48:55.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if Ding Zhao finds out? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.964" end="01:48:56.864" style="s2">been watching me like a hawk lately. I</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.063" end="01:48:57.563" style="s2">feel like she&#39;s keeping tabs on me from</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.864" end="01:48:59.563" style="s2">the shadows.</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.563" end="01:49:01.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Zhao? She&#39;s a nobody with no</p>
<p begin="01:48:59.563" end="01:49:03.563" style="s2">connections. What can she do?</p>
<p begin="01:49:01.263" end="01:49:05.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But mom&#39;s backing her.</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.563" end="01:49:07.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget, once the seal&#39;s on those</p>
<p begin="01:49:05.263" end="01:49:09.364" style="s2">documents, we can legally move hundreds</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.163" end="01:49:11.763" style="s2">of millions in company funds overseas.</p>
<p begin="01:49:09.364" end="01:49:14.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what can she do to stop you? Talk</p>
<p begin="01:49:11.763" end="01:49:14.364" style="s2">you to death?</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.364" end="01:49:24.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it. I&#39;ll bring the company seal</p>
<p begin="01:49:21.663" end="01:49:28.464" style="s2">back the day after tomorrow. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:49:24.163" end="01:49:28.464" style="s2">worry, Dad. I won&#39;t mess this up.</p>
<p begin="01:49:28.964" end="01:49:33.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nursery at the Joe family villa.</p>
<p begin="01:49:42.263" end="01:49:47.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweet girl, do you know you&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="01:49:44.163" end="01:49:49.063" style="s2">run the company someday?</p>
<p begin="01:49:47.063" end="01:49:50.663" style="s2">Your dad may be a little clueless, but</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.063" end="01:49:52.364" style="s2">you&#39;re still the Joe family&#39;s legitimate</p>
<p begin="01:49:50.663" end="01:49:53.864" style="s2">eldest grandchild.</p>
<p begin="01:49:52.364" end="01:49:56.464" style="s2">And I&#39;ll be the first lady of the</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.864" end="01:49:56.464" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="01:49:58.763" end="01:50:02.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you get them all?</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.364" end="01:50:04.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:50:02.464" end="01:50:05.964" style="s2">Lao Joe checked the seals himself.</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.763" end="01:50:07.964" style="s2">All three reports are locked in a</p>
<p begin="01:50:05.964" end="01:50:09.163" style="s2">separate, encrypted safe.</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.964" end="01:50:11.364" style="s2">I&#39;ll put them there in a bit.</p>
<p begin="01:50:09.163" end="01:50:12.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Liwa wants to save face.</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.364" end="01:50:15.263" style="s2">Zhao Wei wants money.</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.964" end="01:50:16.964" style="s2">Zheng Min wants to save her own skin.</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.263" end="01:50:18.265" style="s2">The The after tomorrow, I&#39;ll make sure</p>
<p begin="01:50:16.964" end="01:50:19.265" style="s2">all three of them take a very public</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.265" end="01:50:21.265" style="s2">fall.</p>
<p begin="01:50:19.265" end="01:50:22.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, are you ready?</p>
<p begin="01:50:21.265" end="01:50:24.465" style="s2">We&#39;ll get back everything they took from</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.965" end="01:50:26.065" style="s2">us bit by bit.</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.465" end="01:50:27.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, once we&#39;ve driven them out of the</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.065" end="01:50:29.065" style="s2">company, I&#39;ll give you their shares and</p>
<p begin="01:50:27.865" end="01:50:30.965" style="s2">make you vice president.</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.065" end="01:50:33.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:30.965" end="01:50:34.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t argue with me, dear.</p>
<p begin="01:50:33.165" end="01:50:36.965" style="s2">You deserve it.</p>
<p begin="01:50:34.965" end="01:50:39.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By Jing Han Zhu a hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:50:36.965" end="01:50:41.065" style="s2">Hahaha. Jiang Li, have a few extra</p>
<p begin="01:50:39.365" end="01:50:42.765" style="s2">drinks tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:50:41.065" end="01:50:45.365" style="s2">This is the Zhu family&#39;s eldest</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.765" end="01:50:47.765" style="s2">grandson. The burden of the Qin group</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.365" end="01:50:49.865" style="s2">will be his to bear sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="01:50:47.765" end="01:50:51.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Director Zhu. Many</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.865" end="01:50:54.165" style="s2">congratulations. A grandson in your</p>
<p begin="01:50:51.965" end="01:50:56.565" style="s2">later years. What a wonderful blessing.</p>
<p begin="01:50:54.165" end="01:51:00.365" style="s2">Just look at the young master&#39;s energy.</p>
<p begin="01:50:56.565" end="01:51:02.565" style="s2">The Zhu family has a bright future.</p>
<p begin="01:51:00.365" end="01:51:03.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming, uncles.</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.565" end="01:51:06.165" style="s2">Our Zhu Wei gets up in the middle of the</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.965" end="01:51:08.565" style="s2">night every day to feed the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:51:06.165" end="01:51:10.865" style="s2">He loves him so much.</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.565" end="01:51:13.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, he&#39;s my son. Who else would I</p>
<p begin="01:51:10.865" end="01:51:13.265" style="s2">love?</p>
<p begin="01:51:14.565" end="01:51:18.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director Qin and Ms. Ding have arrived.</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.265" end="01:51:27.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yue Ru, you&#39;re finally here.</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.365" end="01:51:29.965" style="s2">I thought you&#39;d skip your own grandson&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:51:27.165" end="01:51:32.365" style="s2">100 day celebration. Come, come, have a</p>
<p begin="01:51:29.965" end="01:51:33.365" style="s2">seat. We&#39;ve saved the place of honor for</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.365" end="01:51:35.065" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:51:33.365" end="01:51:37.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Li Hua,</p>
<p begin="01:51:35.065" end="01:51:39.165" style="s2">on such an important day, how could I,</p>
<p begin="01:51:37.365" end="01:51:41.465" style="s2">his grandmother, stay away?</p>
<p begin="01:51:39.165" end="01:51:43.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, have a seat. Xiao Min, bring the</p>
<p begin="01:51:41.465" end="01:51:45.365" style="s2">baby over so mom can see him.</p>
<p begin="01:51:43.965" end="01:51:47.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, look.</p>
<p begin="01:51:45.365" end="01:51:49.365" style="s2">The baby&#39;s been so good today.</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.365" end="01:51:50.665" style="s2">He hasn&#39;t cried once all morning.</p>
<p begin="01:51:49.365" end="01:51:51.965" style="s2">Everyone says he looks just like Xiao</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.665" end="01:51:53.465" style="s2">Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:51:51.965" end="01:51:55.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, what are you laughing at?</p>
<p begin="01:51:53.465" end="01:51:59.265" style="s2">Today is my son&#39;s big day. Don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.765" end="01:52:01.465" style="s2">here with your snide remarks.</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.265" end="01:52:05.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get me wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:52:01.465" end="01:52:07.165" style="s2">I just think the baby&#39;s blessed.</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.165" end="01:52:08.965" style="s2">But looking at his eyes and brows, how</p>
<p begin="01:52:07.165" end="01:52:11.765" style="s2">come he doesn&#39;t look like anyone in the</p>
<p begin="01:52:08.965" end="01:52:11.765" style="s2">Zhu family?</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.565" end="01:52:20.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, know your place.</p>
<p begin="01:52:17.965" end="01:52:23.066" style="s2">This room is full of important people.</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.366" end="01:52:24.766" style="s2">What nonsense are you Spouting?</p>
<p begin="01:52:23.066" end="01:52:26.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei,</p>
<p begin="01:52:24.766" end="01:52:28.766" style="s2">why are you so worked up?</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.766" end="01:52:31.166" style="s2">Xiao was only telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:52:28.766" end="01:52:34.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why are you joining in with her? If</p>
<p begin="01:52:31.166" end="01:52:35.766" style="s2">this isn&#39;t my child, whose is it?</p>
<p begin="01:52:34.466" end="01:52:37.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wei Er,</p>
<p begin="01:52:35.766" end="01:52:38.566" style="s2">don&#39;t rush.</p>
<p begin="01:52:37.366" end="01:52:41.566" style="s2">I didn&#39;t just bring a gift for the</p>
<p begin="01:52:38.566" end="01:52:43.466" style="s2">baby&#39;s 100 days celebration today.</p>
<p begin="01:52:41.566" end="01:52:47.066" style="s2">I also brought a gift that will finally</p>
<p begin="01:52:43.466" end="01:52:47.066" style="s2">set you and your son straight.</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.866" end="01:52:51.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qian Yue Ru, what trick are you pulling</p>
<p begin="01:52:49.666" end="01:52:51.966" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="01:52:53.066" end="01:52:57.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, read it aloud.</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.766" end="01:53:00.366" style="s2">Let all the elders here share in the</p>
<p begin="01:52:57.566" end="01:53:00.366" style="s2">good news.</p>
<p begin="01:53:05.766" end="01:53:09.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ahem.</p>
<p begin="01:53:07.266" end="01:53:11.766" style="s2">Principal Ding Xiao, the subject is a</p>
<p begin="01:53:09.366" end="01:53:15.166" style="s2">male infant. The appraisal agency is the</p>
<p begin="01:53:11.766" end="01:53:15.166" style="s2">National Appraisal Center.</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.566" end="01:53:19.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, what are you doing? What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:53:18.266" end="01:53:22.266" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="01:53:19.866" end="01:53:24.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The center&#39;s DNA comparison found that</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.266" end="01:53:28.266" style="s2">the infant&#39;s genetic markers do not</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.266" end="01:53:30.066" style="s2">match those of the client, Xiao Wei.</p>
<p begin="01:53:28.266" end="01:53:32.666" style="s2">The conclusion is that Xiao Wei and the</p>
<p begin="01:53:30.066" end="01:53:36.566" style="s2">infant are not biologically related.</p>
<p begin="01:53:32.666" end="01:53:39.066" style="s2">In other words, this child isn&#39;t yours.</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.566" end="01:53:39.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nonsense.</p>
<p begin="01:53:41.466" end="01:53:43.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="01:53:44.566" end="01:53:48.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A reputable lab did the test.</p>
<p begin="01:53:47.166" end="01:53:49.366" style="s2">If you don&#39;t believe it, get another</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.866" end="01:53:51.666" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="01:53:49.366" end="01:53:53.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, don&#39;t believe her.</p>
<p begin="01:53:51.666" end="01:53:56.166" style="s2">Ding Xiao is making this up.</p>
<p begin="01:53:53.566" end="01:53:58.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, whose child is this? You act</p>
<p begin="01:53:56.166" end="01:54:00.666" style="s2">so innocent in front of me every day,</p>
<p begin="01:53:58.666" end="01:54:03.366" style="s2">but sneak around with some other man and</p>
<p begin="01:54:00.666" end="01:54:03.366" style="s2">have this kid.</p>
<p begin="01:54:06.566" end="01:54:09.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, let go.</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.266" end="01:54:11.366" style="s2">Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:54:09.866" end="01:54:13.166" style="s2">We&#39;re in public.</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.366" end="01:54:14.266" style="s2">What are you saying? This report is</p>
<p begin="01:54:13.166" end="01:54:16.066" style="s2">fake.</p>
<p begin="01:54:14.266" end="01:54:17.066" style="s2">Qian Yue Ru and Ding Xiao forged it to</p>
<p begin="01:54:16.066" end="01:54:20.066" style="s2">frame us.</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.066" end="01:54:22.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a disgrace to the family.</p>
<p begin="01:54:20.066" end="01:54:26.867" style="s2">In front of all these business people,</p>
<p begin="01:54:22.366" end="01:54:26.867" style="s2">Xiao Wei&#39;s been cuckolded beyond belief.</p>
<p begin="01:54:26.968" end="01:54:30.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei is useless.</p>
<p begin="01:54:28.568" end="01:54:33.268" style="s2">He raised another man&#39;s son for 100 days</p>
<p begin="01:54:30.968" end="01:54:36.867" style="s2">and threw him a grand celebration.</p>
<p begin="01:54:33.268" end="01:54:36.867" style="s2">He&#39;s never been so humiliated.</p>
<p begin="01:54:40.168" end="01:54:44.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful son, stop. Haven&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:54:42.367" end="01:54:46.168" style="s2">embarrassed us enough? Whether that</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.367" end="01:54:47.968" style="s2">report is real or not,</p>
<p begin="01:54:46.168" end="01:54:49.968" style="s2">fighting like some shrew in front of all</p>
<p begin="01:54:47.968" end="01:54:52.668" style="s2">these guests is disgraceful.</p>
<p begin="01:54:49.968" end="01:54:56.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, and you&#39;re still defending her? She</p>
<p begin="01:54:52.668" end="01:54:59.668" style="s2">cheated on me. That child isn&#39;t mine.</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.068" end="01:54:59.668" style="s2">How am I supposed to stay calm?</p>
<p begin="01:55:05.168" end="01:55:08.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, please help me.</p>
<p begin="01:55:07.068" end="01:55:11.268" style="s2">You know better than anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.968" end="01:55:13.367" style="s2">This child is Xiao family blood.</p>
<p begin="01:55:11.268" end="01:55:16.568" style="s2">Xiao Wei doesn&#39;t believe me.</p>
<p begin="01:55:13.367" end="01:55:16.568" style="s2">You can&#39;t turn against me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:55:17.068" end="01:55:21.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. All of you shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:55:19.367" end="01:55:22.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I shut up? I&#39;m getting to the</p>
<p begin="01:55:21.168" end="01:55:24.168" style="s2">bottom of this today.</p>
<p begin="01:55:22.268" end="01:55:26.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Haven&#39;t you embarrassed us</p>
<p begin="01:55:24.168" end="01:55:28.668" style="s2">enough already?</p>
<p begin="01:55:26.468" end="01:55:30.568" style="s2">Qin Yueru, stop driving a wedge between</p>
<p begin="01:55:28.668" end="01:55:32.367" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:55:30.568" end="01:55:34.367" style="s2">Even if the child&#39;s genes don&#39;t match</p>
<p begin="01:55:32.367" end="01:55:35.668" style="s2">Xiao Wei&#39;s,</p>
<p begin="01:55:34.367" end="01:55:37.468" style="s2">the hospital could have mixed up the</p>
<p begin="01:55:35.668" end="01:55:38.367" style="s2">babies, or it could be a genetic</p>
<p begin="01:55:37.468" end="01:55:41.168" style="s2">mutation.</p>
<p begin="01:55:38.367" end="01:55:41.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ha ha ha.</p>
<p begin="01:55:42.468" end="01:55:46.968" style="s2">Oh, Director Xiao, you really are a</p>
<p begin="01:55:44.568" end="01:55:49.168" style="s2">master of fooling yourself. How could a</p>
<p begin="01:55:46.968" end="01:55:51.768" style="s2">genetic mutation make the match rate</p>
<p begin="01:55:49.168" end="01:55:53.268" style="s2">come back negative? What is this, some</p>
<p begin="01:55:51.768" end="01:55:56.168" style="s2">sci-fi novel?</p>
<p begin="01:55:53.268" end="01:55:58.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Director Xiao. The eldest son</p>
<p begin="01:55:56.168" end="01:56:00.268" style="s2">has nothing to do with that child. So</p>
<p begin="01:55:58.068" end="01:56:01.468" style="s2">why do you keep calling him a Xiao?</p>
<p begin="01:56:00.268" end="01:56:05.068" style="s2">Is there some other man in the Xiao</p>
<p begin="01:56:01.468" end="01:56:05.068" style="s2">family who can father a child?</p>
<p begin="01:56:08.168" end="01:56:11.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="01:56:09.867" end="01:56:15.568" style="s2">When Mom and I first saw the eldest</p>
<p begin="01:56:11.867" end="01:56:17.668" style="s2">son&#39;s report, we found it strange, too.</p>
<p begin="01:56:15.568" end="01:56:21.367" style="s2">Why would anyone be so attached to a</p>
<p begin="01:56:17.668" end="01:56:23.568" style="s2">child they&#39;re not even related to?</p>
<p begin="01:56:21.367" end="01:56:25.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, what are you implying?</p>
<p begin="01:56:23.568" end="01:56:27.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You care far more about this child than</p>
<p begin="01:56:25.669" end="01:56:28.569" style="s2">Joe Wei does.</p>
<p begin="01:56:27.369" end="01:56:30.169" style="s2">You went to the hospital in the middle</p>
<p begin="01:56:28.569" end="01:56:31.869" style="s2">of the night to see him.</p>
<p begin="01:56:30.169" end="01:56:33.069" style="s2">You rushed to move assets overseas into</p>
<p begin="01:56:31.869" end="01:56:34.369" style="s2">a trust.</p>
<p begin="01:56:33.069" end="01:56:37.369" style="s2">You even fought to hold the child.</p>
<p begin="01:56:34.369" end="01:56:38.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. What is Madam saying?</p>
<p begin="01:56:37.369" end="01:56:39.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.269" end="01:56:41.369" style="s2">No way.</p>
<p begin="01:56:39.469" end="01:56:42.469" style="s2">A father and son fighting over the same</p>
<p begin="01:56:41.369" end="01:56:45.169" style="s2">woman?</p>
<p begin="01:56:42.469" end="01:56:47.469" style="s2">Does the Joe family get that twisted?</p>
<p begin="01:56:45.169" end="01:56:51.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what does Ding Xiao mean? Why do</p>
<p begin="01:56:47.469" end="01:56:51.569" style="s2">you care so much about this child?</p>
<p begin="01:56:51.669" end="01:56:55.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, you lying woman.</p>
<p begin="01:56:55.669" end="01:56:58.669" style="s2">Security.</p>
<p begin="01:56:56.869" end="01:57:02.069" style="s2">Where the hell are you? Get these two</p>
<p begin="01:56:58.669" end="01:57:02.069" style="s2">crazy women out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:57:02.169" end="01:57:06.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joe Li Hua, stop shouting.</p>
<p begin="01:57:04.969" end="01:57:09.869" style="s2">No one is leaving this room until we get</p>
<p begin="01:57:06.869" end="01:57:09.869" style="s2">to the bottom of this.</p>
<p begin="01:57:11.869" end="01:57:17.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To help Joe Wei uncover the truth and to</p>
<p begin="01:57:14.469" end="01:57:17.369" style="s2">clear your name.</p>
<p begin="01:57:17.669" end="01:57:22.469" style="s2">We ran a grandparentage test using your</p>
<p begin="01:57:20.069" end="01:57:25.369" style="s2">saliva and the child sample.</p>
<p begin="01:57:22.469" end="01:57:27.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, oh my god. They actually tested Joe</p>
<p begin="01:57:25.369" end="01:57:29.769" style="s2">Li Hua. If they&#39;re a match, then they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:57:27.569" end="01:57:31.369" style="s2">not grandfather and grandchild. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:57:29.769" end="01:57:33.669" style="s2">father and son.</p>
<p begin="01:57:31.369" end="01:57:35.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is outrageous.</p>
<p begin="01:57:33.669" end="01:57:38.969" style="s2">A father-in-law and his daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="01:57:35.469" end="01:57:38.969" style="s2">has Joe Li Hua no shame?</p>
<p begin="01:57:44.269" end="01:57:49.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Ding Xiao, you&#39;ve got some nerve.</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.269" end="01:57:50.669" style="s2">You actually had the test done behind my</p>
<p begin="01:57:49.169" end="01:57:52.369" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="01:57:50.669" end="01:57:54.469" style="s2">So what if you exposed it?</p>
<p begin="01:57:52.369" end="01:57:57.369" style="s2">As long as this child has Joe blood,</p>
<p begin="01:57:54.469" end="01:57:57.369" style="s2">he&#39;s still an heir.</p>
<p begin="01:58:00.869" end="01:58:05.269" style="s2">Everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:58:03.269" end="01:58:07.069" style="s2">Since everyone is here today, let&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="01:58:05.269" end="01:58:09.369" style="s2">bear witness together.</p>
<p begin="01:58:07.069" end="01:58:10.969" style="s2">This child is flesh and blood of our Joe</p>
<p begin="01:58:09.369" end="01:58:13.269" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:58:10.969" end="01:58:15.769" style="s2">You could run that test 10,000 times. He</p>
<p begin="01:58:13.269" end="01:58:17.769" style="s2">still has my blood, Joe Li Hua&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:58:15.769" end="01:58:20.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you admit it? You really had</p>
<p begin="01:58:17.769" end="01:58:23.369" style="s2">something going on with Jiang Min?</p>
<p begin="01:58:20.769" end="01:58:25.169" style="s2">Are you even my father?</p>
<p begin="01:58:23.369" end="01:58:26.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, he hey, you think you can</p>
<p begin="01:58:25.169" end="01:58:28.770" style="s2">bring me down with this?</p>
<p begin="01:58:26.869" end="01:58:30.570" style="s2">You&#39;re way out of your depth. Today,</p>
<p begin="01:58:28.770" end="01:58:32.470" style="s2">I&#39;ll show you.</p>
<p begin="01:58:30.570" end="01:58:34.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, don&#39;t look.</p>
<p begin="01:58:32.470" end="01:58:36.070" style="s2">Tear up the report.</p>
<p begin="01:58:34.270" end="01:58:37.070" style="s2">You can&#39;t look at it.</p>
<p begin="01:58:36.070" end="01:58:38.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:58:37.070" end="01:58:40.770" style="s2">you&#39;re so sure because you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:58:38.470" end="01:58:43.070" style="s2">sleeping with her all along.</p>
<p begin="01:58:40.770" end="01:58:45.570" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you? You even stole your own</p>
<p begin="01:58:43.070" end="01:58:46.670" style="s2">son&#39;s woman. What kind of father does</p>
<p begin="01:58:45.570" end="01:58:48.770" style="s2">that make you?</p>
<p begin="01:58:46.670" end="01:58:50.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. You good for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:58:48.770" end="01:58:51.170" style="s2">When the results come out, I&#39;ll deal</p>
<p begin="01:58:50.470" end="01:58:54.770" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:58:51.170" end="01:58:54.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You better read it yourself first.</p>
<p begin="01:58:56.370" end="01:59:01.170" style="s2">Unless you want everyone to hear it and</p>
<p begin="01:58:58.170" end="01:59:05.370" style="s2">leave you with no shred of dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:59:01.170" end="01:59:05.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oof. H how is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:59:06.770" end="01:59:11.270" style="s2">What does it say? Why are these the</p>
<p begin="01:59:08.670" end="01:59:11.270" style="s2">results?</p>
<p begin="01:59:16.970" end="01:59:22.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Client Ding Xiao. The subject is a baby</p>
<p begin="01:59:19.670" end="01:59:25.070" style="s2">boy. Appraisal institution National</p>
<p begin="01:59:22.070" end="01:59:25.070" style="s2">Appraisal Center.</p>
<p begin="01:59:26.270" end="01:59:30.270" style="s2">Following a DNA comparison, the center</p>
<p begin="01:59:28.270" end="01:59:32.270" style="s2">found no biological relationship between</p>
<p begin="01:59:30.270" end="01:59:33.570" style="s2">the infant and Zhou Lihua.</p>
<p begin="01:59:32.270" end="01:59:34.970" style="s2">The paternity probability is</p>
<p begin="01:59:33.570" end="01:59:36.870" style="s2">incompatible.</p>
<p begin="01:59:34.970" end="01:59:37.970" style="s2">Zhou Lihua is excluded as the infant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:59:36.870" end="01:59:40.270" style="s2">biological father.</p>
<p begin="01:59:37.970" end="01:59:41.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhou Lihua, this child isn&#39;t yours</p>
<p begin="01:59:40.270" end="01:59:44.870" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="01:59:41.070" end="01:59:44.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Ha ha ha.</p>
<p begin="01:59:45.370" end="01:59:49.670" style="s2">So the father and son were fighting over</p>
<p begin="01:59:47.370" end="01:59:51.370" style="s2">who&#39;d be the dad and neither of them is</p>
<p begin="01:59:49.670" end="01:59:53.870" style="s2">even related to the kid.</p>
<p begin="01:59:51.370" end="01:59:55.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhou Lihua, you&#39;re something else.</p>
<p begin="01:59:53.870" end="01:59:57.570" style="s2">You betrayed your own son and slept with</p>
<p begin="01:59:55.770" end="01:59:59.270" style="s2">your daughter-in-law only to raise</p>
<p begin="01:59:57.570" end="02:00:01.270" style="s2">someone else&#39;s kid.</p>
<p begin="01:59:59.270" end="02:00:02.470" style="s2">What a pair of matching sets of horns,</p>
<p begin="02:00:01.270" end="02:00:04.570" style="s2">you and your son.</p>
<p begin="02:00:02.470" end="02:00:06.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a disgrace. Zhou Lihua spent half</p>
<p begin="02:00:04.570" end="02:00:08.570" style="s2">his life being so clever only to end up</p>
<p begin="02:00:06.870" end="02:00:10.970" style="s2">like this. That&#39;s karma.</p>
<p begin="02:00:08.570" end="02:00:10.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ha ha ha.</p>
<p begin="02:00:11.070" end="02:00:15.770" style="s2">Dad, my dear old dad, did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="02:00:18.270" end="02:00:22.470" style="s2">You were sleeping with my woman behind</p>
<p begin="02:00:20.270" end="02:00:24.770" style="s2">my back. You thought you&#39;d stolen a</p>
<p begin="02:00:22.470" end="02:00:26.870" style="s2">treasure and gotten yourself an heir,</p>
<p begin="02:00:24.770" end="02:00:28.470" style="s2">but look at you now.</p>
<p begin="02:00:26.870" end="02:00:31.938" style="s2">You&#39;re just like me,</p>
<p begin="02:00:28.470" end="02:00:32.472" style="s2">a cuckold raising someone else&#39;s kid.</p>
<p begin="02:00:31.938" end="02:00:33.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="02:00:32.472" end="02:00:34.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="02:00:33.572" end="02:00:36.872" style="s2">It&#39;s fake.</p>
<p begin="02:00:34.972" end="02:00:38.572" style="s2">This report must be fake.</p>
<p begin="02:00:36.872" end="02:00:41.772" style="s2">You have to believe me.</p>
<p begin="02:00:38.572" end="02:00:41.772" style="s2">The baby really is a show.</p>
<p begin="02:00:43.372" end="02:00:46.472" style="s2">Back when you had nothing,</p>
<p begin="02:00:46.772" end="02:00:50.372" style="s2">my family helped you get back on your</p>
<p begin="02:00:48.072" end="02:00:50.372" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="02:00:51.472" end="02:00:57.872" style="s2">But you never showed any gratitude.</p>
<p begin="02:00:54.372" end="02:00:57.872" style="s2">You brought this on yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:00:58.772" end="02:01:03.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You woman.</p>
<p begin="02:01:00.672" end="02:01:03.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fake.</p>
<p begin="02:01:03.672" end="02:01:06.972" style="s2">You can&#39;t just wave a few papers around</p>
<p begin="02:01:05.372" end="02:01:09.472" style="s2">to ruin the show family and fool</p>
<p begin="02:01:06.972" end="02:01:09.472" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="02:01:11.172" end="02:01:17.072" style="s2">Show way, believe me.</p>
<p begin="02:01:13.672" end="02:01:18.972" style="s2">You&#39;re the only man I&#39;ve ever been with.</p>
<p begin="02:01:17.072" end="02:01:21.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Believe you? What reason do I have to</p>
<p begin="02:01:18.972" end="02:01:23.072" style="s2">believe you? The report says he&#39;s not a</p>
<p begin="02:01:21.272" end="02:01:25.372" style="s2">match. Do you think I&#39;m stupid?</p>
<p begin="02:01:23.072" end="02:01:27.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It must be the hospital.</p>
<p begin="02:01:25.372" end="02:01:30.672" style="s2">Yes, the day I gave birth, the nurses</p>
<p begin="02:01:27.672" end="02:01:30.672" style="s2">switched the babies.</p>
<p begin="02:01:34.372" end="02:01:38.372" style="s2">Hospitals mix up babies all the time.</p>
<p begin="02:01:36.972" end="02:01:39.572" style="s2">We should sue them.</p>
<p begin="02:01:38.372" end="02:01:41.372" style="s2">Yes, let&#39;s sue.</p>
<p begin="02:01:39.572" end="02:01:42.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mix up, Jang Min?</p>
<p begin="02:01:41.372" end="02:01:44.972" style="s2">You send that so-called distant cousin</p>
<p begin="02:01:42.872" end="02:01:46.872" style="s2">hundreds of thousands every month.</p>
<p begin="02:01:44.972" end="02:01:48.772" style="s2">Did the bank mix that up, too?</p>
<p begin="02:01:46.872" end="02:01:50.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, there&#39;s a cousin, too? This is</p>
<p begin="02:01:48.772" end="02:01:51.972" style="s2">getting juicy.</p>
<p begin="02:01:50.572" end="02:01:53.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What cousin?</p>
<p begin="02:01:51.972" end="02:01:55.072" style="s2">Probably her lover.</p>
<p begin="02:01:53.672" end="02:01:56.972" style="s2">What a schemer.</p>
<p begin="02:01:55.072" end="02:01:58.972" style="s2">She used her lover&#39;s kid to swindle the</p>
<p begin="02:01:56.972" end="02:02:01.772" style="s2">show family fortune.</p>
<p begin="02:01:58.972" end="02:02:03.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jang Min, is what Ding Xiao said true?</p>
<p begin="02:02:01.772" end="02:02:04.072" style="s2">What&#39;s going on with this cousin of</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.172" end="02:02:06.072" style="s2">yours?</p>
<p begin="02:02:04.072" end="02:02:08.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t listen to her lies.</p>
<p begin="02:02:06.072" end="02:02:09.872" style="s2">Abin really is my cousin.</p>
<p begin="02:02:08.172" end="02:02:11.472" style="s2">He was unemployed in the city, so I was</p>
<p begin="02:02:09.872" end="02:02:14.172" style="s2">just helping him out.</p>
<p begin="02:02:11.472" end="02:02:16.672" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing between us.</p>
<p begin="02:02:14.172" end="02:02:17.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing between you, Jang Min.</p>
<p begin="02:02:16.672" end="02:02:20.372" style="s2">Did you really think we wouldn&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="02:02:17.972" end="02:02:23.072" style="s2">copies?</p>
<p begin="02:02:20.372" end="02:02:25.372" style="s2">Open your eyes and take a good look.</p>
<p begin="02:02:23.072" end="02:02:27.872" style="s2">This is the third report</p>
<p begin="02:02:25.372" end="02:02:30.372" style="s2">submitted by Chin Yueru.</p>
<p begin="02:02:27.872" end="02:02:32.672" style="s2">The identified male infant, Abin,</p>
<p begin="02:02:30.372" end="02:02:33.873" style="s2">appraisal result.</p>
<p begin="02:02:32.672" end="02:02:35.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The results support Abin as</p>
<p begin="02:02:33.873" end="02:02:37.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the boy&#39;s biological father with a</p>
<p begin="02:02:35.673" end="02:02:38.573" style="s2">99.99%</p>
<p begin="02:02:37.273" end="02:02:41.273" style="s2">probability of paternity.</p>
<p begin="02:02:38.573" end="02:02:42.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh, so it&#39;s confirmed. The kid really</p>
<p begin="02:02:41.273" end="02:02:43.973" style="s2">is that cousin&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="02:02:42.273" end="02:02:46.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The show father and son are the biggest</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.973" end="02:02:48.073" style="s2">suckers of all. A father and son both</p>
<p begin="02:02:46.173" end="02:02:50.973" style="s2">fought to claim the baby and some other</p>
<p begin="02:02:48.073" end="02:02:50.973" style="s2">guy got the prize.</p>
<p begin="02:02:51.373" end="02:02:55.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aiden,</p>
<p begin="02:02:53.773" end="02:02:57.973" style="s2">that unemployed guy who worked as a male</p>
<p begin="02:02:55.673" end="02:02:58.973" style="s2">escort at the club.</p>
<p begin="02:02:57.973" end="02:03:01.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="02:02:58.973" end="02:03:01.173" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="02:03:05.573" end="02:03:08.273" style="s2">Jiang Min Yu.</p>
<p begin="02:03:11.473" end="02:03:16.973" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you. You you used the male</p>
<p begin="02:03:14.073" end="02:03:21.173" style="s2">model&#39;s baby to deceive me, to steal my</p>
<p begin="02:03:16.973" end="02:03:23.773" style="s2">overseas assets and my trust fund.</p>
<p begin="02:03:21.173" end="02:03:25.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, now you know what it feels like,</p>
<p begin="02:03:23.773" end="02:03:27.573" style="s2">huh? When you were sneaking around with</p>
<p begin="02:03:25.773" end="02:03:29.773" style="s2">her behind my back.</p>
<p begin="02:03:27.573" end="02:03:31.373" style="s2">Did you ever think this day would come?</p>
<p begin="02:03:29.773" end="02:03:34.073" style="s2">This is what you get.</p>
<p begin="02:03:31.373" end="02:03:35.473" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, you useless idiot.</p>
<p begin="02:03:34.073" end="02:03:37.573" style="s2">If you could have kept your woman in</p>
<p begin="02:03:35.473" end="02:03:40.073" style="s2">line, she wouldn&#39;t have played me for a</p>
<p begin="02:03:37.573" end="02:03:40.073" style="s2">fool.</p>
<p begin="02:03:40.973" end="02:03:44.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.973" end="02:03:48.173" style="s2">Please let me go.</p>
<p begin="02:03:44.973" end="02:03:48.173" style="s2">The baby&#39;s innocent.</p>
<p begin="02:03:49.573" end="02:03:52.473" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Li Wa, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="02:03:51.573" end="02:03:54.173" style="s2">Put the knife down.</p>
<p begin="02:03:52.473" end="02:03:55.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, watch out.</p>
<p begin="02:03:54.173" end="02:03:58.673" style="s2">He&#39;s gone mad.</p>
<p begin="02:03:55.673" end="02:03:58.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="02:04:00.473" end="02:04:04.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s killing her. Jiang Li Wa&#39;s gone</p>
<p begin="02:04:02.473" end="02:04:07.973" style="s2">crazy. Run.</p>
<p begin="02:04:04.173" end="02:04:07.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call the police. Get security.</p>
<p begin="02:04:08.773" end="02:04:12.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="02:04:10.373" end="02:04:15.473" style="s2">Jiang Wei, help me.</p>
<p begin="02:04:12.873" end="02:04:17.473" style="s2">Jiang Wei, help me.</p>
<p begin="02:04:15.473" end="02:04:18.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="02:04:17.473" end="02:04:21.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min,</p>
<p begin="02:04:18.673" end="02:04:23.473" style="s2">for you I divorced you, Er Ru, turned my</p>
<p begin="02:04:21.273" end="02:04:26.073" style="s2">son into an enemy and bet the Jiang</p>
<p begin="02:04:23.473" end="02:04:29.273" style="s2">family&#39;s entire fortune on this baby and</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.073" end="02:04:29.273" style="s2">you want me to let you go?</p>
<p begin="02:04:31.073" end="02:04:33.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="02:04:32.173" end="02:04:35.773" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="02:04:33.173" end="02:04:35.773" style="s2">Stay back.</p>
<p begin="02:04:36.574" end="02:04:40.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="02:04:38.775" end="02:04:41.374" style="s2">You have some nerve bringing those words</p>
<p begin="02:04:40.574" end="02:04:42.874" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="02:04:41.374" end="02:04:44.974" style="s2">You shameless woman.</p>
<p begin="02:04:42.874" end="02:04:44.974" style="s2">Ah.</p>
<p begin="02:04:45.874" end="02:04:51.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jolie was gone completely crazy. Get</p>
<p begin="02:04:48.574" end="02:04:51.275" style="s2">away from her.</p>
<p begin="02:04:51.974" end="02:04:54.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of What kind of 100 day</p>
<p begin="02:04:53.374" end="02:04:57.675" style="s2">celebration is this?</p>
<p begin="02:04:54.474" end="02:04:57.675" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a living nightmare.</p>
<p begin="02:05:07.175" end="02:05:10.775" style="s2">If I&#39;m going down, we&#39;re all going down.</p>
<p begin="02:05:11.074" end="02:05:16.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="02:05:13.574" end="02:05:16.175" style="s2">Let go.</p>
<p begin="02:05:16.574" end="02:05:20.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="02:05:17.775" end="02:05:22.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="02:05:20.275" end="02:05:23.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young master, this mess is your fault.</p>
<p begin="02:05:22.574" end="02:05:27.474" style="s2">You deal with it.</p>
<p begin="02:05:23.374" end="02:05:27.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, Ding Xiao, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="02:05:33.275" end="02:05:37.175" style="s2">Dad, are you really going to kill me?</p>
<p begin="02:05:35.675" end="02:05:39.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you waiting for?</p>
<p begin="02:05:37.175" end="02:05:39.775" style="s2">Hold him down.</p>
<p begin="02:05:42.574" end="02:05:46.675" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weier, Weier, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="02:05:44.874" end="02:05:50.374" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t trying to hit you.</p>
<p begin="02:05:46.675" end="02:05:50.374" style="s2">I was aiming for that woman, Jiang Min.</p>
<p begin="02:05:51.175" end="02:05:56.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, have you come to your senses? You</p>
<p begin="02:05:53.974" end="02:05:59.775" style="s2">nearly killed me too just now.</p>
<p begin="02:05:56.775" end="02:06:02.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was furious. That woman fooled me.</p>
<p begin="02:05:59.775" end="02:06:02.974" style="s2">Weier, please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="02:06:03.275" end="02:06:05.675" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgive you?</p>
<p begin="02:06:07.175" end="02:06:12.175" style="s2">You treated me like an enemy over that</p>
<p begin="02:06:09.175" end="02:06:13.974" style="s2">child. Now you find out it isn&#39;t yours,</p>
<p begin="02:06:12.175" end="02:06:15.374" style="s2">and suddenly you want me to forgive you?</p>
<p begin="02:06:13.974" end="02:06:17.974" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think it&#39;s too late?</p>
<p begin="02:06:15.374" end="02:06:20.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="02:06:17.974" end="02:06:22.275" style="s2">Did any splinters cut you?</p>
<p begin="02:06:20.374" end="02:06:24.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You scared me to death.</p>
<p begin="02:06:22.275" end="02:06:26.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="02:06:24.175" end="02:06:28.675" style="s2">Good thing I reacted fast.</p>
<p begin="02:06:26.175" end="02:06:29.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You reacted fast, all right. You shoved</p>
<p begin="02:06:28.675" end="02:06:31.474" style="s2">me in front of you.</p>
<p begin="02:06:29.775" end="02:06:33.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You weren&#39;t hurt, were you?</p>
<p begin="02:06:31.474" end="02:06:34.675" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Wei, shut up.</p>
<p begin="02:06:33.275" end="02:06:36.775" style="s2">If you&#39;d kept Jiang Min in line, she</p>
<p begin="02:06:34.675" end="02:06:39.575" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t have shoved Ding Xiao.</p>
<p begin="02:06:36.775" end="02:06:40.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, you&#39;ll pay for this someday.</p>
<p begin="02:06:39.575" end="02:06:42.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pay for what?</p>
<p begin="02:06:40.975" end="02:06:43.676" style="s2">The police will be here any minute, Zhu</p>
<p begin="02:06:42.575" end="02:06:45.176" style="s2">Wei.</p>
<p begin="02:06:43.676" end="02:06:45.575" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll settle things.</p>
<p begin="02:06:45.176" end="02:06:48.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="02:06:45.575" end="02:06:48.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you had plenty</p>
<p begin="02:06:56.176" end="02:06:59.876" style="s2">of strength when you shoved me just now.</p>
<p begin="02:06:59.975" end="02:07:04.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="02:07:01.876" end="02:07:06.575" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t thinking straight.</p>
<p begin="02:07:04.276" end="02:07:09.776" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to die.</p>
<p begin="02:07:06.575" end="02:07:10.975" style="s2">Please, for old times&#39; sake, let me go.</p>
<p begin="02:07:09.776" end="02:07:12.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; times?</p>
<p begin="02:07:10.975" end="02:07:13.676" style="s2">Jiang Min, you don&#39;t get to talk about</p>
<p begin="02:07:12.276" end="02:07:15.276" style="s2">old times.</p>
<p begin="02:07:13.676" end="02:07:16.975" style="s2">You faked a pregnancy and a baby to win</p>
<p begin="02:07:15.276" end="02:07:19.276" style="s2">Zhu Lihua&#39;s trust.</p>
<p begin="02:07:16.975" end="02:07:20.975" style="s2">You moved who knows how many assets.</p>
<p begin="02:07:19.276" end="02:07:23.475" style="s2">And now you want mercy?</p>
<p begin="02:07:20.975" end="02:07:23.475" style="s2">Too late.</p>
<p begin="02:07:24.276" end="02:07:29.475" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, give me back my offshore trust</p>
<p begin="02:07:26.575" end="02:07:30.876" style="s2">fund. That&#39;s everything I own. Give me</p>
<p begin="02:07:29.475" end="02:07:32.975" style="s2">my money back.</p>
<p begin="02:07:30.876" end="02:07:35.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back to you?</p>
<p begin="02:07:32.975" end="02:07:39.276" style="s2">Dream on, Zhu Lihua.</p>
<p begin="02:07:35.975" end="02:07:41.575" style="s2">That money&#39;s already in A Bin&#39;s account.</p>
<p begin="02:07:39.276" end="02:07:44.376" style="s2">You won&#39;t get a cent back.</p>
<p begin="02:07:41.575" end="02:07:45.975" style="s2">You disgusting old lecher.</p>
<p begin="02:07:44.376" end="02:07:47.776" style="s2">You think I&#39;d put up with a man who</p>
<p begin="02:07:45.975" end="02:07:50.176" style="s2">reeks of old age if it weren&#39;t for your</p>
<p begin="02:07:47.776" end="02:07:50.176" style="s2">money?</p>
<p begin="02:07:50.475" end="02:07:54.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, you vile woman.</p>
<p begin="02:07:52.376" end="02:07:54.975" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="02:08:00.776" end="02:08:04.676" style="s2">Who is Zhu Lihua? Who is Jiang Min? And</p>
<p begin="02:08:03.575" end="02:08:06.176" style="s2">Zhu Wei?</p>
<p begin="02:08:04.676" end="02:08:08.176" style="s2">We&#39;ve received a report that you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="02:08:06.176" end="02:08:11.276" style="s2">suspected of large-scale commercial</p>
<p begin="02:08:08.176" end="02:08:13.575" style="s2">fraud, illegal asset transfers, and</p>
<p begin="02:08:11.276" end="02:08:14.176" style="s2">intentional assault. You&#39;ll need to come</p>
<p begin="02:08:13.575" end="02:08:15.776" style="s2">with us.</p>
<p begin="02:08:14.176" end="02:08:17.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This has nothing to do with me. They</p>
<p begin="02:08:15.776" end="02:08:21.475" style="s2">tricked me. They used the child to fool</p>
<p begin="02:08:17.676" end="02:08:21.475" style="s2">me. I didn&#39;t commit any crimes.</p>
<p begin="02:08:22.176" end="02:08:26.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether you committed a crime or not,</p>
<p begin="02:08:23.776" end="02:08:28.176" style="s2">you can explain it at the station.</p>
<p begin="02:08:26.075" end="02:08:29.575" style="s2">You, Zhu Lihua, you&#39;ve been waiting for</p>
<p begin="02:08:28.176" end="02:08:32.975" style="s2">this day, haven&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="02:08:29.575" end="02:08:35.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Lihua, I gave you plenty of chances.</p>
<p begin="02:08:32.975" end="02:08:38.575" style="s2">You didn&#39;t take a single one.</p>
<p begin="02:08:35.276" end="02:08:38.575" style="s2">You brought this on yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:08:40.975" end="02:08:43.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Wei?</p>
<p begin="02:08:43.575" end="02:08:45.877" style="s2">You came,</p>
<p begin="02:08:44.677" end="02:08:49.077" style="s2">I knew you wouldn&#39;t leave me in the</p>
<p begin="02:08:45.877" end="02:08:51.053" style="s2">lurch. We&#39;ve been married for 30 years.</p>
<p begin="02:08:49.077" end="02:08:53.073" style="s2">You still care about me, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="02:08:51.053" end="02:08:53.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="02:08:53.777" end="02:08:58.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua, sit down.</p>
<p begin="02:08:56.277" end="02:09:00.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I&#39;ll sit. You are you please</p>
<p begin="02:08:58.277" end="02:09:02.377" style="s2">help me. This place is no place for a</p>
<p begin="02:09:00.777" end="02:09:04.977" style="s2">human being.</p>
<p begin="02:09:02.377" end="02:09:06.177" style="s2">That woman Jiang Min took all the money.</p>
<p begin="02:09:04.977" end="02:09:08.577" style="s2">She tricked me.</p>
<p begin="02:09:06.177" end="02:09:10.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were tricked, Zhao Lihua.</p>
<p begin="02:09:08.577" end="02:09:11.877" style="s2">Can you think before you speak?</p>
<p begin="02:09:10.177" end="02:09:13.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s really what happened. I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="02:09:11.877" end="02:09:16.177" style="s2">victim here. Please get me the best</p>
<p begin="02:09:13.777" end="02:09:18.577" style="s2">lawyer and arrange bail. Once I&#39;m out,</p>
<p begin="02:09:16.177" end="02:09:20.677" style="s2">we can start over. What do you say? You</p>
<p begin="02:09:18.577" end="02:09:23.177" style="s2">are you I was a fool before. I let her</p>
<p begin="02:09:20.677" end="02:09:24.577" style="s2">looks cloud my judgment. I swear I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="02:09:23.177" end="02:09:26.577" style="s2">make it up to you twice over.</p>
<p begin="02:09:24.577" end="02:09:29.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua,</p>
<p begin="02:09:26.577" end="02:09:31.277" style="s2">do you think I came here to save you?</p>
<p begin="02:09:29.377" end="02:09:33.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are you what do you mean? You didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:09:31.277" end="02:09:36.777" style="s2">you come to help me out because your</p>
<p begin="02:09:33.077" end="02:09:36.777" style="s2">conscience got the better of you?</p>
<p begin="02:09:37.577" end="02:09:43.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua, you think a lot of yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:09:41.277" end="02:09:45.777" style="s2">My mom came to see you off for the last</p>
<p begin="02:09:43.377" end="02:09:49.377" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="02:09:45.777" end="02:09:50.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Zhao, you again.</p>
<p begin="02:09:49.377" end="02:09:52.677" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t turned you are you against</p>
<p begin="02:09:50.977" end="02:09:54.877" style="s2">me, she wouldn&#39;t be treating me like</p>
<p begin="02:09:52.677" end="02:09:57.777" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="02:09:54.877" end="02:09:59.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your mouth, Zhao Lihua.</p>
<p begin="02:09:57.777" end="02:10:02.477" style="s2">Zhao is my only daughter-in-law and the</p>
<p begin="02:09:59.977" end="02:10:04.677" style="s2">future of the Chen family.</p>
<p begin="02:10:02.477" end="02:10:06.577" style="s2">If you dare insult her again, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="02:10:04.677" end="02:10:08.377" style="s2">sure you don&#39;t get a single decent meal</p>
<p begin="02:10:06.577" end="02:10:10.877" style="s2">in there.</p>
<p begin="02:10:08.377" end="02:10:12.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are you I spoke without thinking.</p>
<p begin="02:10:10.877" end="02:10:15.477" style="s2">Don&#39;t be mad. So what are you here for</p>
<p begin="02:10:12.977" end="02:10:15.477" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="02:10:22.577" end="02:10:27.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign these two documents.</p>
<p begin="02:10:25.277" end="02:10:31.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A divorce agreement and a transfer of</p>
<p begin="02:10:27.577" end="02:10:31.777" style="s2">the group&#39;s shares for no compensation.</p>
<p begin="02:10:33.277" end="02:10:36.677" style="s2">Chen you are you have you lost your</p>
<p begin="02:10:34.777" end="02:10:39.277" style="s2">mind? You want me to walk away with</p>
<p begin="02:10:36.677" end="02:10:40.877" style="s2">nothing and give you my shares for free?</p>
<p begin="02:10:39.277" end="02:10:42.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those shares belong to the Chen family</p>
<p begin="02:10:40.877" end="02:10:43.977" style="s2">in the first place.</p>
<p begin="02:10:42.377" end="02:10:46.279" style="s2">You rode the Chen family&#39;s coattails to</p>
<p begin="02:10:43.977" end="02:10:47.678" style="s2">the top and held on to them for years.</p>
<p begin="02:10:46.279" end="02:10:49.779" style="s2">It&#39;s time to give them back.</p>
<p begin="02:10:47.678" end="02:10:51.879" style="s2"> I earned every bit of this</p>
<p begin="02:10:49.779" end="02:10:54.479" style="s2">through decades of hard work. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:10:51.879" end="02:10:58.479" style="s2">sign, not even if I die. You want me to</p>
<p begin="02:10:54.479" end="02:10:58.479" style="s2">end up with nothing? Keep dreaming.</p>
<p begin="02:10:59.779" end="02:11:03.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t have to sign, Zhao Lihua.</p>
<p begin="02:11:02.079" end="02:11:06.279" style="s2">You&#39;re suspected of embezzlement,</p>
<p begin="02:11:03.479" end="02:11:08.178" style="s2">massive fraud, and intentional assault.</p>
<p begin="02:11:06.279" end="02:11:09.479" style="s2">If you refuse, I&#39;ll have my lawyers ask</p>
<p begin="02:11:08.178" end="02:11:10.979" style="s2">the court to pursue the harshest</p>
<p begin="02:11:09.479" end="02:11:12.178" style="s2">possible penalties for every crime</p>
<p begin="02:11:10.979" end="02:11:14.479" style="s2">you&#39;ve committed.</p>
<p begin="02:11:12.178" end="02:11:15.479" style="s2">Zhao Lihua, you&#39;re almost 60, aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:11:14.479" end="02:11:17.079" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="02:11:15.479" end="02:11:19.379" style="s2">With all your sentences added up, you</p>
<p begin="02:11:17.079" end="02:11:21.279" style="s2">could get 15 or 20 years.</p>
<p begin="02:11:19.379" end="02:11:23.279" style="s2">Do you think you&#39;ll make it out alive?</p>
<p begin="02:11:21.279" end="02:11:24.979" style="s2">But if you sign, I&#39;ll have my lawyers</p>
<p begin="02:11:23.279" end="02:11:26.979" style="s2">submit a letter of forgiveness to the</p>
<p begin="02:11:24.979" end="02:11:28.779" style="s2">court.</p>
<p begin="02:11:26.979" end="02:11:32.879" style="s2">For the sake of our marriage, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="02:11:28.779" end="02:11:32.879" style="s2">sure you have an easier time inside.</p>
<p begin="02:11:38.178" end="02:11:43.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chen Yu&#39;er, you heartless woman,</p>
<p begin="02:11:41.678" end="02:11:46.979" style="s2">you&#39;ll get what&#39;s coming to you. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="02:11:43.479" end="02:11:46.979" style="s2">haunt you even after I&#39;m dead.</p>
<p begin="02:11:48.678" end="02:11:53.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t get what&#39;s coming to me.</p>
<p begin="02:11:50.979" end="02:11:56.079" style="s2">But Zhao Lihua, what&#39;s coming to you is</p>
<p begin="02:11:53.079" end="02:11:56.079" style="s2">just around the corner.</p>
<p begin="02:11:59.279" end="02:12:02.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady, Mrs. Zhao, everything&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:12:01.479" end="02:12:03.879" style="s2">taken care of.</p>
<p begin="02:12:02.479" end="02:12:06.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="02:12:03.879" end="02:12:09.678" style="s2">As of today, Zhao Lihua has no ties</p>
<p begin="02:12:06.579" end="02:12:12.079" style="s2">whatsoever to the Chen family.</p>
<p begin="02:12:09.678" end="02:12:15.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, congratulations.</p>
<p begin="02:12:12.079" end="02:12:15.779" style="s2">You&#39;re finally free of him for good.</p>
<p begin="02:12:16.678" end="02:12:20.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl,</p>
<p begin="02:12:18.379" end="02:12:22.779" style="s2">I owe it to you too.</p>
<p begin="02:12:20.779" end="02:12:26.379" style="s2">Without you, that father and son might</p>
<p begin="02:12:22.779" end="02:12:28.879" style="s2">have driven me into a corner long ago.</p>
<p begin="02:12:26.379" end="02:12:32.479" style="s2">Come on, let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="02:12:28.879" end="02:12:32.479" style="s2">I&#39;ll cook you something special today.</p>
<p begin="02:12:37.579" end="02:12:41.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, want me to help prep the</p>
<p begin="02:12:38.879" end="02:12:42.979" style="s2">vegetables?</p>
<p begin="02:12:41.379" end="02:12:44.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no.</p>
<p begin="02:12:42.979" end="02:12:46.680" style="s2">You&#39;ve been through enough.</p>
<p begin="02:12:44.579" end="02:12:47.980" style="s2">Go sit on the couch and rest. Mom is</p>
<p begin="02:12:46.680" end="02:12:49.880" style="s2">making your favorite dishes for you</p>
<p begin="02:12:47.980" end="02:12:52.180" style="s2">today, steamed sea bass and yam pork rib</p>
<p begin="02:12:49.880" end="02:12:52.180" style="s2">soup.</p>
<p begin="02:12:53.880" end="02:12:58.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;re so good to me.</p>
<p begin="02:12:56.680" end="02:13:01.880" style="s2">Apart from you and my own mother, no one</p>
<p begin="02:12:58.480" end="02:13:01.880" style="s2">has ever made me feel like I had a home.</p>
<p begin="02:13:03.280" end="02:13:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, the Xiao family treated you</p>
<p begin="02:13:05.180" end="02:13:09.180" style="s2">terribly.</p>
<p begin="02:13:06.880" end="02:13:10.780" style="s2">You&#39;ve suffered so much.</p>
<p begin="02:13:09.180" end="02:13:12.380" style="s2">To me, you&#39;ve never been just my</p>
<p begin="02:13:10.780" end="02:13:13.980" style="s2">daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="02:13:12.380" end="02:13:16.380" style="s2">You&#39;re my own daughter.</p>
<p begin="02:13:13.980" end="02:13:18.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="02:13:16.380" end="02:13:20.080" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t taken me in and supported</p>
<p begin="02:13:18.380" end="02:13:21.880" style="s2">me, I could never have made it in</p>
<p begin="02:13:20.080" end="02:13:25.280" style="s2">Jiangcheng.</p>
<p begin="02:13:21.880" end="02:13:26.680" style="s2">I&#39;m so lucky to have met you.</p>
<p begin="02:13:25.280" end="02:13:28.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my girl.</p>
<p begin="02:13:26.680" end="02:13:31.880" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;m here for you.</p>
<p begin="02:13:28.880" end="02:13:33.980" style="s2">No one will ever bully you again.</p>
<p begin="02:13:31.880" end="02:13:35.880" style="s2">Here, try my cooking.</p>
<p begin="02:13:33.980" end="02:13:38.280" style="s2">Have some more. You&#39;ve gotten so thin</p>
<p begin="02:13:35.880" end="02:13:38.280" style="s2">lately.</p>
<p begin="02:13:42.080" end="02:13:44.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s delicious.</p>
<p begin="02:13:43.480" end="02:13:46.080" style="s2">Even better than what they serve at</p>
<p begin="02:13:44.680" end="02:13:48.880" style="s2">those fancy restaurants.</p>
<p begin="02:13:46.080" end="02:13:48.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then have some more.</p>
<p begin="02:13:48.980" end="02:13:53.680" style="s2">Xiao, now that Xiao Lihua and Jiang Min</p>
<p begin="02:13:51.380" end="02:13:56.680" style="s2">are behind bars and the Xiao group has</p>
<p begin="02:13:53.680" end="02:13:56.680" style="s2">gone bankrupt,</p>
<p begin="02:13:57.580" end="02:14:00.780" style="s2">what do you plan to do next?</p>
<p begin="02:14:01.680" end="02:14:05.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Xiao Lihua may be out of the</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.580" end="02:14:06.580" style="s2">picture, but he left the group in bad</p>
<p begin="02:14:05.380" end="02:14:08.180" style="s2">shape.</p>
<p begin="02:14:06.580" end="02:14:09.780" style="s2">A lot of our partners are waiting to see</p>
<p begin="02:14:08.180" end="02:14:11.480" style="s2">what happens.</p>
<p begin="02:14:09.780" end="02:14:12.780" style="s2">We need to steady things fast and keep</p>
<p begin="02:14:11.480" end="02:14:14.080" style="s2">control of the group firmly in our</p>
<p begin="02:14:12.780" end="02:14:15.280" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="02:14:14.080" end="02:14:16.780" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="02:14:15.280" end="02:14:18.580" style="s2">But that can wait.</p>
<p begin="02:14:16.780" end="02:14:20.680" style="s2">No work talk today.</p>
<p begin="02:14:18.580" end="02:14:22.780" style="s2">Today, it&#39;s just the two of us enjoying</p>
<p begin="02:14:20.680" end="02:14:26.880" style="s2">our time together.</p>
<p begin="02:14:22.780" end="02:14:26.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, here&#39;s to our new beginning.</p>
<p begin="02:14:36.680" end="02:14:40.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Defendant Xiao Lihua is found guilty of</p>
<p begin="02:14:38.980" end="02:14:42.780" style="s2">intentional assault and embezzlement.</p>
<p begin="02:14:40.980" end="02:14:44.680" style="s2">With the sentences combined, she is</p>
<p begin="02:14:42.780" end="02:14:46.680" style="s2">sentenced to 15 years in prison,</p>
<p begin="02:14:44.680" end="02:14:49.081" style="s2">deprived of her political rights for</p>
<p begin="02:14:46.680" end="02:14:50.681" style="s2">three years, and ordered to forfeit all</p>
<p begin="02:14:49.081" end="02:14:52.881" style="s2">personal assets.</p>
<p begin="02:14:50.681" end="02:14:55.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 15 years?</p>
<p begin="02:14:52.881" end="02:14:55.981" style="s2">I&#39;ll be dead before I get out.</p>
<p begin="02:14:56.281" end="02:15:00.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Defendant Joe Wei is found guilty of</p>
<p begin="02:14:58.781" end="02:15:03.081" style="s2">intentional assault and attempted</p>
<p begin="02:15:00.481" end="02:15:05.281" style="s2">murder. He is sentenced to 8 years in</p>
<p begin="02:15:03.081" end="02:15:09.481" style="s2">prison.</p>
<p begin="02:15:05.281" end="02:15:11.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8 years? My whole life is ruined.</p>
<p begin="02:15:09.481" end="02:15:14.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Defendant Jiang Min is found guilty of</p>
<p begin="02:15:11.481" end="02:15:16.281" style="s2">fraud and intentional assault.</p>
<p begin="02:15:14.481" end="02:15:18.381" style="s2">With the sentences combined, she is</p>
<p begin="02:15:16.281" end="02:15:21.781" style="s2">sentenced to 12 years in prison and</p>
<p begin="02:15:18.381" end="02:15:24.681" style="s2">fined 500,000 yuan.</p>
<p begin="02:15:21.781" end="02:15:27.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Honor, I was forced into it.</p>
<p begin="02:15:24.681" end="02:15:30.181" style="s2">That bastard A Bin put me up to it.</p>
<p begin="02:15:27.781" end="02:15:32.481" style="s2">The baby is innocent.</p>
<p begin="02:15:30.181" end="02:15:34.881" style="s2">Please let me go.</p>
<p begin="02:15:32.481" end="02:15:36.781" style="s2">I still have to breastfeed.</p>
<p begin="02:15:34.881" end="02:15:39.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Defendant, keep quiet.</p>
<p begin="02:15:36.781" end="02:15:39.481" style="s2">No shouting.</p>
<p begin="02:15:40.181" end="02:15:45.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ding Xiao, you wicked woman.</p>
<p begin="02:15:43.081" end="02:15:47.481" style="s2">You ruined our whole family.</p>
<p begin="02:15:45.581" end="02:15:49.881" style="s2">You&#39;ll get what&#39;s coming to you.</p>
<p begin="02:15:47.481" end="02:15:51.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jiang Min, I didn&#39;t ruin you or the Zhao</p>
<p begin="02:15:49.881" end="02:15:54.081" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="02:15:51.481" end="02:15:56.381" style="s2">Your own greed and shamelessness did.</p>
<p begin="02:15:54.081" end="02:15:58.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You arrow after 30 years of marriage,</p>
<p begin="02:15:56.381" end="02:16:00.081" style="s2">can you really be this heartless? Are</p>
<p begin="02:15:58.481" end="02:16:02.681" style="s2">you going to watch me grow old and die</p>
<p begin="02:16:00.081" end="02:16:02.681" style="s2">in prison?</p>
<p begin="02:16:03.381" end="02:16:07.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Li Hua, when you scheme to take my</p>
<p begin="02:16:05.281" end="02:16:10.181" style="s2">family&#39;s assets, when you tried to use</p>
<p begin="02:16:07.781" end="02:16:11.981" style="s2">that child to humiliate me, and even</p>
<p begin="02:16:10.181" end="02:16:14.681" style="s2">when you tried to kill my Xiao, you</p>
<p begin="02:16:11.981" end="02:16:17.681" style="s2">should have known this day would come.</p>
<p begin="02:16:14.681" end="02:16:17.681" style="s2">This is your karma.</p>
<p begin="02:16:18.081" end="02:16:23.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m your own son. Are you really</p>
<p begin="02:16:20.481" end="02:16:28.181" style="s2">going to abandon me? 8 years, can you</p>
<p begin="02:16:23.181" end="02:16:30.081" style="s2">appeal for me? Get my sentence reduced?</p>
<p begin="02:16:28.181" end="02:16:31.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Wei, use your time inside to turn</p>
<p begin="02:16:30.081" end="02:16:33.481" style="s2">your life around.</p>
<p begin="02:16:31.781" end="02:16:36.181" style="s2">It&#39;s your only chance to become a decent</p>
<p begin="02:16:33.481" end="02:16:36.181" style="s2">person again.</p>
<p begin="02:16:37.382" end="02:16:43.082" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even you gave up on me. Hahaha.</p>
<p begin="02:16:41.481" end="02:16:44.781" style="s2">I deserve this.</p>
<p begin="02:16:43.082" end="02:16:47.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Court is adjourned. Remove the</p>
<p begin="02:16:44.781" end="02:16:47.981" style="s2">defendants from the courtroom.</p>
<p begin="02:16:57.782" end="02:17:02.282" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, it&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="02:16:59.482" end="02:17:03.383" style="s2">It&#39;s all over now.</p>
<p begin="02:17:02.282" end="02:17:06.083" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="02:17:03.383" end="02:17:06.083" style="s2">It&#39;s all over now.</p>
<p begin="02:17:07.282" end="02:17:12.482" style="s2">Xiao, how long has it been since the sun</p>
<p begin="02:17:09.782" end="02:17:14.282" style="s2">over Lin Jiang felt this warm?</p>
<p begin="02:17:12.482" end="02:17:15.682" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five years, mom.</p>
<p begin="02:17:14.282" end="02:17:17.583" style="s2">Ever since the day I married into the</p>
<p begin="02:17:15.682" end="02:17:20.182" style="s2">Joe family, the sky above me has been</p>
<p begin="02:17:17.583" end="02:17:20.182" style="s2">overcast.</p>
<p begin="02:17:20.383" end="02:17:24.182" style="s2">At last, the sun&#39;s come out.</p>
<p begin="02:17:24.583" end="02:17:27.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="02:17:25.982" end="02:17:30.682" style="s2">Five whole years.</p>
<p begin="02:17:27.982" end="02:17:32.583" style="s2">I watched you suffer all this time.</p>
<p begin="02:17:30.682" end="02:17:34.782" style="s2">At last, that weight on our hearts has</p>
<p begin="02:17:32.583" end="02:17:37.982" style="s2">been lifted for good.</p>
<p begin="02:17:34.782" end="02:17:39.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, young madam, congratulations.</p>
<p begin="02:17:37.982" end="02:17:41.982" style="s2">I heard the verdict.</p>
<p begin="02:17:39.782" end="02:17:43.583" style="s2">It was so satisfying.</p>
<p begin="02:17:41.982" end="02:17:45.883" style="s2">Those three criminals finally got what</p>
<p begin="02:17:43.583" end="02:17:47.583" style="s2">they deserved.</p>
<p begin="02:17:45.883" end="02:17:49.883" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lao Xiao, you&#39;ve worked hard through all</p>
<p begin="02:17:47.583" end="02:17:51.982" style="s2">of this, too.</p>
<p begin="02:17:49.883" end="02:17:54.782" style="s2">Without your help gathering evidence,</p>
<p begin="02:17:51.982" end="02:17:56.982" style="s2">things wouldn&#39;t have gone so smoothly.</p>
<p begin="02:17:54.782" end="02:17:59.482" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was the least I could do.</p>
<p begin="02:17:56.982" end="02:18:01.482" style="s2">The former chairman was good to me.</p>
<p begin="02:17:59.482" end="02:18:04.883" style="s2">I&#39;ve been furious for years watching</p>
<p begin="02:18:01.482" end="02:18:07.083" style="s2">Xiao Li Hua throw his weight around.</p>
<p begin="02:18:04.883" end="02:18:09.682" style="s2">At last, I can give the former chairman</p>
<p begin="02:18:07.083" end="02:18:09.682" style="s2">an answer.</p>
<p begin="02:18:11.583" end="02:18:15.583" style="s2">Madam, these urgent documents just came</p>
<p begin="02:18:13.982" end="02:18:17.982" style="s2">in from the business bureau and the</p>
<p begin="02:18:15.583" end="02:18:17.982" style="s2">bank.</p>
<p begin="02:18:20.583" end="02:18:24.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are they?</p>
<p begin="02:18:21.982" end="02:18:26.482" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, the assets Xiao Li Hua illegally</p>
<p begin="02:18:24.782" end="02:18:30.383" style="s2">transferred have all been seized by</p>
<p begin="02:18:26.482" end="02:18:30.383" style="s2">court order and returned to your name.</p>
<p begin="02:18:33.982" end="02:18:40.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you now hold a decisive 75%</p>
<p begin="02:18:36.782" end="02:18:40.182" style="s2">controlling stake in the group.</p>
<p begin="02:18:41.282" end="02:18:44.982" style="s2">From now on, the group belongs to the</p>
<p begin="02:18:43.182" end="02:18:46.782" style="s2">Qin family.</p>
<p begin="02:18:44.982" end="02:18:49.182" style="s2">No one can threaten your position ever</p>
<p begin="02:18:46.782" end="02:18:49.182" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="02:18:50.682" end="02:18:52.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today,</p>
<p begin="02:18:53.282" end="02:18:56.984" style="s2">I&#39;ve finally gotten it all back.</p>
<p begin="02:19:01.284" end="02:19:05.384" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, now that Joe Li was been taken</p>
<p begin="02:19:03.584" end="02:19:09.184" style="s2">down, what should we do about his</p>
<p begin="02:19:05.384" end="02:19:09.184" style="s2">cronies and the company&#39;s mess?</p>
<p begin="02:19:10.384" end="02:19:14.784" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luo Xiao, notify all department heads.</p>
<p begin="02:19:13.284" end="02:19:15.984" style="s2">Call a general shareholders meeting and</p>
<p begin="02:19:14.784" end="02:19:16.984" style="s2">a board meeting for 9:00 tomorrow</p>
<p begin="02:19:15.984" end="02:19:18.784" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="02:19:16.984" end="02:19:20.584" style="s2">I&#39;ll chair them myself.</p>
<p begin="02:19:18.784" end="02:19:22.484" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And have the finance and legal teams</p>
<p begin="02:19:20.584" end="02:19:24.684" style="s2">work late tonight to secure and audit</p>
<p begin="02:19:22.484" end="02:19:26.584" style="s2">every project and financial transaction</p>
<p begin="02:19:24.684" end="02:19:27.984" style="s2">Joe Li was handled over the past few</p>
<p begin="02:19:26.584" end="02:19:30.084" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="02:19:27.984" end="02:19:32.284" style="s2">If they find anything suspicious, turn</p>
<p begin="02:19:30.084" end="02:19:33.584" style="s2">it over to the authorities.</p>
<p begin="02:19:32.284" end="02:19:35.684" style="s2">No one gets a pass.</p>
<p begin="02:19:33.584" end="02:19:37.084" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, young madam.</p>
<p begin="02:19:35.684" end="02:19:39.184" style="s2">I&#39;ll personally make sure it&#39;s done</p>
<p begin="02:19:37.084" end="02:19:41.984" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:19:39.184" end="02:19:45.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, I&#39;ll take care of the company.</p>
<p begin="02:19:41.984" end="02:19:45.284" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to worry about it.</p>
<p begin="02:19:45.384" end="02:19:48.685" style="s2">Now that the Xiao family matter is</p>
<p begin="02:19:47.184" end="02:19:51.384" style="s2">settled, there&#39;s something more</p>
<p begin="02:19:48.685" end="02:19:54.584" style="s2">important we need to do.</p>
<p begin="02:19:51.384" end="02:19:57.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you mean my mother&#39;s surgery?</p>
<p begin="02:19:54.584" end="02:19:59.084" style="s2">She can have the surgery now.</p>
<p begin="02:19:57.284" end="02:20:00.884" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You silly girl.</p>
<p begin="02:19:59.084" end="02:20:02.984" style="s2">Back then, Xiao Wei used your mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:20:00.884" end="02:20:04.384" style="s2">medication and surgery to threaten you</p>
<p begin="02:20:02.984" end="02:20:05.984" style="s2">and make you work like a slave for the</p>
<p begin="02:20:04.384" end="02:20:07.685" style="s2">Xiao family.</p>
<p begin="02:20:05.984" end="02:20:10.484" style="s2">But now we don&#39;t have to let anyone</p>
<p begin="02:20:07.685" end="02:20:11.685" style="s2">threaten us anymore.</p>
<p begin="02:20:10.484" end="02:20:13.384" style="s2">I&#39;ve already contacted the best</p>
<p begin="02:20:11.685" end="02:20:15.884" style="s2">cardiovascular and neurology specialists</p>
<p begin="02:20:13.384" end="02:20:15.884" style="s2">in the country.</p>
<p begin="02:20:20.384" end="02:20:24.784" style="s2">Xiao, stop pacing.</p>
<p begin="02:20:22.784" end="02:20:27.685" style="s2">Sit down and rest.</p>
<p begin="02:20:24.784" end="02:20:30.185" style="s2">You haven&#39;t had a sip of water all day.</p>
<p begin="02:20:27.685" end="02:20:32.185" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I can&#39;t sit still.</p>
<p begin="02:20:30.185" end="02:20:35.084" style="s2">Every time I close my eyes, I think</p>
<p begin="02:20:32.185" end="02:20:35.084" style="s2">about the past.</p>
<p begin="02:20:36.185" end="02:20:39.384" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be silly.</p>
<p begin="02:20:37.584" end="02:20:41.384" style="s2">That&#39;s all behind us.</p>
<p begin="02:20:39.384" end="02:20:44.384" style="s2">I&#39;m here now. I&#39;ve made sure you have</p>
<p begin="02:20:41.384" end="02:20:45.984" style="s2">the best doctors and the best medicine.</p>
<p begin="02:20:44.384" end="02:20:47.784" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="02:20:45.984" end="02:20:49.884" style="s2">Your mother will be all right.</p>
<p begin="02:20:47.784" end="02:20:51.685" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, thank you.</p>
<p begin="02:20:49.884" end="02:20:54.484" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for you, I don&#39;t think I</p>
<p begin="02:20:51.685" end="02:20:56.284" style="s2">could have held on.</p>
<p begin="02:20:54.484" end="02:20:59.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be silly.</p>
<p begin="02:20:56.284" end="02:21:01.186" style="s2">You&#39;re my in law and my daughter too.</p>
<p begin="02:20:59.586" end="02:21:03.286" style="s2">We help each other through that mess at</p>
<p begin="02:21:01.186" end="02:21:05.386" style="s2">the Xiao family home.</p>
<p begin="02:21:03.286" end="02:21:08.386" style="s2">From now on, we&#39;re the closest people in</p>
<p begin="02:21:05.386" end="02:21:08.386" style="s2">each other&#39;s lives.</p>
<p begin="02:21:11.586" end="02:21:17.086" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, how is my mother?</p>
<p begin="02:21:13.985" end="02:21:17.086" style="s2">Did the surgery go well?</p>
<p begin="02:21:17.485" end="02:21:22.286" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Ding, don&#39;t worry. The surgery was a</p>
<p begin="02:21:19.386" end="02:21:22.286" style="s2">great success.</p>
<p begin="02:21:22.485" end="02:21:25.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="02:21:23.886" end="02:21:27.386" style="s2">How is my mom now?</p>
<p begin="02:21:25.386" end="02:21:29.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve removed all the affected tissue</p>
<p begin="02:21:27.386" end="02:21:31.686" style="s2">and the blood vessels are flowing freely</p>
<p begin="02:21:29.186" end="02:21:33.485" style="s2">again. As long as she rests and follows</p>
<p begin="02:21:31.686" end="02:21:35.786" style="s2">her medication plan, her chronic</p>
<p begin="02:21:33.485" end="02:21:37.286" style="s2">condition should be completely cured.</p>
<p begin="02:21:35.786" end="02:21:40.086" style="s2">She&#39;ll be able to live a completely</p>
<p begin="02:21:37.286" end="02:21:40.086" style="s2">normal life.</p>
<p begin="02:21:42.786" end="02:21:46.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really, doctor?</p>
<p begin="02:21:44.386" end="02:21:48.086" style="s2">You&#39;re not just saying that?</p>
<p begin="02:21:46.386" end="02:21:50.186" style="s2">My mom is really going to be okay?</p>
<p begin="02:21:48.086" end="02:21:52.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We&#39;ve moved her to the ICU for</p>
<p begin="02:21:50.186" end="02:21:54.186" style="s2">observation. Once the anesthetic wears</p>
<p begin="02:21:52.485" end="02:21:57.086" style="s2">off, you can go in and see her.</p>
<p begin="02:21:54.186" end="02:21:57.086" style="s2">Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="02:22:14.186" end="02:22:19.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="02:22:16.586" end="02:22:23.186" style="s2">The doctor said the surgery went well.</p>
<p begin="02:22:19.586" end="02:22:23.186" style="s2">You won&#39;t have to suffer anymore.</p>
<p begin="02:22:25.786" end="02:22:29.286" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, Xiao.</p>
<p begin="02:22:27.586" end="02:22:30.686" style="s2">This is wonderful news.</p>
<p begin="02:22:29.286" end="02:22:32.485" style="s2">Don&#39;t cry. Your mother would be</p>
<p begin="02:22:30.686" end="02:22:35.186" style="s2">heartbroken to see you crying like this</p>
<p begin="02:22:32.485" end="02:22:35.186" style="s2">when she wakes up.</p>
<p begin="02:22:35.786" end="02:22:39.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:22:37.985" end="02:22:42.186" style="s2">I&#39;m not crying.</p>
<p begin="02:22:39.485" end="02:22:42.186" style="s2">I&#39;m just happy.</p>
<p begin="02:22:54.786" end="02:22:59.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao.</p>
<p begin="02:22:56.386" end="02:23:00.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here, mom.</p>
<p begin="02:22:59.485" end="02:23:03.188" style="s2">How are you</p>
<p begin="02:23:00.987" end="02:23:05.487" style="s2">Does anything still hurt?</p>
<p begin="02:23:03.188" end="02:23:07.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="02:23:05.487" end="02:23:11.587" style="s2">I feel warm all over.</p>
<p begin="02:23:07.688" end="02:23:11.587" style="s2">I haven&#39;t felt this good in years.</p>
<p begin="02:23:16.188" end="02:23:19.888" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shuying, lie still.</p>
<p begin="02:23:18.188" end="02:23:22.787" style="s2">You just had surgery.</p>
<p begin="02:23:19.888" end="02:23:22.787" style="s2">You need to rest.</p>
<p begin="02:23:26.787" end="02:23:31.188" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, don&#39;t fuss over me. Let the nurse</p>
<p begin="02:23:28.987" end="02:23:33.388" style="s2">take care of it. You&#39;ve been by my side</p>
<p begin="02:23:31.188" end="02:23:35.388" style="s2">every day for two weeks. You&#39;ve lost so</p>
<p begin="02:23:33.388" end="02:23:37.987" style="s2">much weight. It breaks my heart to see</p>
<p begin="02:23:35.388" end="02:23:39.787" style="s2">you like this.</p>
<p begin="02:23:37.987" end="02:23:41.388" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m not tired.</p>
<p begin="02:23:39.787" end="02:23:42.688" style="s2">As long as you&#39;re healthy, I could go</p>
<p begin="02:23:41.388" end="02:23:45.087" style="s2">without sleep and still feel full of</p>
<p begin="02:23:42.688" end="02:23:45.087" style="s2">energy.</p>
<p begin="02:23:47.188" end="02:23:50.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shuying, you&#39;re being discharged today.</p>
<p begin="02:23:49.587" end="02:23:53.587" style="s2">I came to take you home myself.</p>
<p begin="02:23:50.987" end="02:23:55.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yuru, why did you come all this way?</p>
<p begin="02:23:53.587" end="02:23:57.787" style="s2">You&#39;re so busy with work.</p>
<p begin="02:23:55.487" end="02:23:58.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao could have brought me home. I hate</p>
<p begin="02:23:57.787" end="02:24:00.487" style="s2">to trouble you.</p>
<p begin="02:23:58.587" end="02:24:01.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Shuying, no need to be so formal</p>
<p begin="02:24:00.487" end="02:24:03.087" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="02:24:01.487" end="02:24:05.287" style="s2">No matter how busy work gets, picking</p>
<p begin="02:24:03.087" end="02:24:07.487" style="s2">you up from the hospital comes first.</p>
<p begin="02:24:05.287" end="02:24:08.888" style="s2">Lao Xiao, get all the bags.</p>
<p begin="02:24:07.487" end="02:24:10.388" style="s2">The car is waiting downstairs.</p>
<p begin="02:24:08.888" end="02:24:11.787" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="02:24:10.388" end="02:24:12.987" style="s2">The car&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="02:24:11.787" end="02:24:14.787" style="s2">There are two more behind it with all</p>
<p begin="02:24:12.987" end="02:24:16.188" style="s2">the nutritional supplements.</p>
<p begin="02:24:14.787" end="02:24:18.888" style="s2">They&#39;ll go straight to the new villa.</p>
<p begin="02:24:16.188" end="02:24:22.287" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A new villa, Xiao? Are we going back to</p>
<p begin="02:24:18.888" end="02:24:22.287" style="s2">the Xiao family estate?</p>
<p begin="02:24:22.688" end="02:24:26.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the Xiao family estate was seized</p>
<p begin="02:24:24.787" end="02:24:29.087" style="s2">and auctioned off by the court.</p>
<p begin="02:24:26.987" end="02:24:30.688" style="s2">Mom and I bought a new villa.</p>
<p begin="02:24:29.087" end="02:24:33.188" style="s2">The three of us will live together from</p>
<p begin="02:24:30.688" end="02:24:33.188" style="s2">now on.</p>
<p begin="02:24:37.787" end="02:24:40.487" style="s2">A new villa.</p>
<p begin="02:24:41.987" end="02:24:44.787" style="s2">Welcome home.</p>
<p begin="02:24:52.188" end="02:24:57.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yuru,</p>
<p begin="02:24:54.388" end="02:25:00.388" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know how to thank you.</p>
<p begin="02:24:57.688" end="02:25:02.188" style="s2">When Xiao married into the Xiao family,</p>
<p begin="02:25:00.388" end="02:25:04.788" style="s2">I worried every day that she&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="02:25:02.188" end="02:25:06.388" style="s2">mistreated. I could never put my mind at</p>
<p begin="02:25:04.788" end="02:25:08.388" style="s2">ease.</p>
<p begin="02:25:06.388" end="02:25:09.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry, Shueying.</p>
<p begin="02:25:08.388" end="02:25:10.988" style="s2">Getting out of the hospital is a happy</p>
<p begin="02:25:09.688" end="02:25:13.388" style="s2">occasion.</p>
<p begin="02:25:10.988" end="02:25:15.688" style="s2">No tears.</p>
<p begin="02:25:13.388" end="02:25:18.188" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are Xiao is so lucky to have you in</p>
<p begin="02:25:15.688" end="02:25:20.388" style="s2">her life. Without you protecting and</p>
<p begin="02:25:18.188" end="02:25:23.288" style="s2">caring for her, she wouldn&#39;t be where</p>
<p begin="02:25:20.388" end="02:25:26.188" style="s2">she is today. Thank you on behalf of the</p>
<p begin="02:25:23.288" end="02:25:28.388" style="s2">Ding family.</p>
<p begin="02:25:26.188" end="02:25:29.788" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re wrong, Shueying.</p>
<p begin="02:25:28.388" end="02:25:31.388" style="s2">Xiao isn&#39;t the one who found a</p>
<p begin="02:25:29.788" end="02:25:33.888" style="s2">benefactor.</p>
<p begin="02:25:31.388" end="02:25:36.188" style="s2">I, Qin Yuru, am the one who found a</p>
<p begin="02:25:33.888" end="02:25:38.288" style="s2">wonderful daughter in Xiao.</p>
<p begin="02:25:36.188" end="02:25:39.788" style="s2">Without her by my side, that monster</p>
<p begin="02:25:38.288" end="02:25:42.188" style="s2">would have driven me to my death long</p>
<p begin="02:25:39.788" end="02:25:42.188" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="02:25:46.688" end="02:25:52.588" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;re such good friends.</p>
<p begin="02:25:49.088" end="02:25:52.588" style="s2">You can stop thanking each other now.</p>
<p begin="02:25:52.888" end="02:25:56.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Lihua has really gone down for good</p>
<p begin="02:25:54.588" end="02:25:58.288" style="s2">this time. I hear the court sentenced</p>
<p begin="02:25:56.688" end="02:26:00.888" style="s2">him to 15 years.</p>
<p begin="02:25:58.288" end="02:26:03.488" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmph. So what if he&#39;s fallen? He&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="02:26:00.888" end="02:26:05.588" style="s2">a criminal. But Qin Yuru is just a</p>
<p begin="02:26:03.488" end="02:26:06.788" style="s2">woman. What does she know about running</p>
<p begin="02:26:05.588" end="02:26:08.988" style="s2">a company?</p>
<p begin="02:26:06.788" end="02:26:11.088" style="s2">She called us all here today, probably</p>
<p begin="02:26:08.988" end="02:26:14.188" style="s2">just to go through the motions.</p>
<p begin="02:26:11.088" end="02:26:16.488" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. The Qin group only got where it</p>
<p begin="02:26:14.188" end="02:26:18.788" style="s2">is today because we old hands kept it</p>
<p begin="02:26:16.488" end="02:26:22.688" style="s2">afloat. If she dares threaten our</p>
<p begin="02:26:18.788" end="02:26:22.688" style="s2">interests, we can all walk away.</p>
<p begin="02:26:26.271" end="02:26:28.290" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="02:26:30.388" end="02:26:34.988" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, Zhao Lihua, Zhao Wei, and</p>
<p begin="02:26:33.388" end="02:26:37.188" style="s2">Jiang Min have been convicted by the</p>
<p begin="02:26:34.988" end="02:26:39.788" style="s2">court for breaking the law.</p>
<p begin="02:26:37.188" end="02:26:43.188" style="s2">Effective today, Zhao Lihua is removed</p>
<p begin="02:26:39.788" end="02:26:45.088" style="s2">from all his positions at the Qin group.</p>
<p begin="02:26:43.188" end="02:26:48.788" style="s2">I&#39;ve called everyone here today for one</p>
<p begin="02:26:45.088" end="02:26:50.488" style="s2">thing only, to reorganize the Qin group.</p>
<p begin="02:26:48.788" end="02:26:52.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director Qin, you haven&#39;t managed the</p>
<p begin="02:26:50.488" end="02:26:54.588" style="s2">company&#39;s operations in years. Isn&#39;t it</p>
<p begin="02:26:52.688" end="02:26:57.088" style="s2">rash to make such sweeping changes right</p>
<p begin="02:26:54.588" end="02:26:58.888" style="s2">away? If this hurts our stock price or</p>
<p begin="02:26:57.088" end="02:26:59.788" style="s2">business partnerships, can you take</p>
<p begin="02:26:58.888" end="02:27:01.388" style="s2">responsibility?</p>
<p begin="02:26:59.788" end="02:27:03.988" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rash?</p>
<p begin="02:27:01.388" end="02:27:07.689" style="s2">Ding Xiao, hand these out.</p>
<p begin="02:27:03.988" end="02:27:07.689" style="s2">Let our old hands take a good look.</p>
<p begin="02:27:08.289" end="02:27:11.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, chairwoman.</p>
<p begin="02:27:15.789" end="02:27:19.090" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, these are the results of the</p>
<p begin="02:27:17.289" end="02:27:20.489" style="s2">audit of the company accounts conducted</p>
<p begin="02:27:19.090" end="02:27:22.489" style="s2">by the legal and finance departments</p>
<p begin="02:27:20.489" end="02:27:25.090" style="s2">over the past two weeks. During Zhao</p>
<p begin="02:27:22.489" end="02:27:27.189" style="s2">Lihua&#39;s tenure, some people here abused</p>
<p begin="02:27:25.090" end="02:27:29.789" style="s2">their positions and helped him siphon</p>
<p begin="02:27:27.189" end="02:27:32.390" style="s2">off company assets through fake projects</p>
<p begin="02:27:29.789" end="02:27:36.989" style="s2">and inflated purchases.</p>
<p begin="02:27:32.390" end="02:27:40.090" style="s2">The total comes to 280 million yuan.</p>
<p begin="02:27:36.989" end="02:27:41.890" style="s2">Mr. Lu, Mr. Wang, Director Jiang, your</p>
<p begin="02:27:40.090" end="02:27:43.590" style="s2">signatures are on every one of these</p>
<p begin="02:27:41.890" end="02:27:45.090" style="s2">projects.</p>
<p begin="02:27:43.590" end="02:27:46.689" style="s2">We have evidence that you embezzled</p>
<p begin="02:27:45.090" end="02:27:47.989" style="s2">company funds and took commercial</p>
<p begin="02:27:46.689" end="02:27:51.090" style="s2">bribes.</p>
<p begin="02:27:47.989" end="02:27:51.090" style="s2">It&#39;s all been compiled.</p>
<p begin="02:27:52.090" end="02:27:57.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director Qin, Madam, we made a terrible</p>
<p begin="02:27:54.590" end="02:28:00.890" style="s2">mistake. Zhao Lihua forced us to do it.</p>
<p begin="02:27:57.789" end="02:28:03.590" style="s2">Please give us another chance.</p>
<p begin="02:28:00.890" end="02:28:05.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another chance?</p>
<p begin="02:28:03.590" end="02:28:06.890" style="s2">When you were bleeding the company dry,</p>
<p begin="02:28:05.390" end="02:28:10.890" style="s2">did you ever think about giving the Qin</p>
<p begin="02:28:06.890" end="02:28:12.189" style="s2">group a chance? Lao Zhao, get security.</p>
<p begin="02:28:10.890" end="02:28:14.890" style="s2">Hand these people over to the</p>
<p begin="02:28:12.189" end="02:28:14.890" style="s2">authorities.</p>
<p begin="02:28:18.989" end="02:28:22.989" style="s2">As for the rest of you, if you stay</p>
<p begin="02:28:21.090" end="02:28:26.989" style="s2">loyal and work for the Qin group from</p>
<p begin="02:28:22.989" end="02:28:28.890" style="s2">now on, I&#39;ll let bygones be bygones.</p>
<p begin="02:28:26.989" end="02:28:31.090" style="s2">But if anyone tries to pull anything</p>
<p begin="02:28:28.890" end="02:28:33.390" style="s2">behind my back, you&#39;ll end up just like</p>
<p begin="02:28:31.090" end="02:28:35.590" style="s2">Zhao Lihua and those people.</p>
<p begin="02:28:33.390" end="02:28:38.789" style="s2">Now, does anyone still object to my</p>
<p begin="02:28:35.590" end="02:28:38.789" style="s2">restructuring plan?</p>
<p begin="02:28:45.489" end="02:28:49.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, young Madam, the executives who</p>
<p begin="02:28:47.890" end="02:28:52.689" style="s2">colluded with Zhao Lihua have been taken</p>
<p begin="02:28:49.989" end="02:28:54.789" style="s2">in by the police for questioning.</p>
<p begin="02:28:52.689" end="02:28:56.590" style="s2">Everyone at the company is on edge,</p>
<p begin="02:28:54.789" end="02:28:59.489" style="s2">wondering who&#39;s going to take over as</p>
<p begin="02:28:56.590" end="02:28:59.489" style="s2">general manager.</p>
<p begin="02:29:00.689" end="02:29:04.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to wonder, Lao Zhao.</p>
<p begin="02:29:03.289" end="02:29:06.491" style="s2">Post this appointment notice on the</p>
<p begin="02:29:04.789" end="02:29:08.991" style="s2">company internet and notify every</p>
<p begin="02:29:06.491" end="02:29:08.991" style="s2">department.</p>
<p begin="02:29:09.391" end="02:29:13.991" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, that&#39;s a brilliant move.</p>
<p begin="02:29:12.091" end="02:29:15.591" style="s2">Everyone saw how well young Madam did</p>
<p begin="02:29:13.991" end="02:29:17.791" style="s2">just now.</p>
<p begin="02:29:15.591" end="02:29:21.191" style="s2">She absolutely deserves the position.</p>
<p begin="02:29:17.791" end="02:29:21.191" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what appointment notice?</p>
<p begin="02:29:25.491" end="02:29:30.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, starting today, you&#39;re no longer</p>
<p begin="02:29:28.191" end="02:29:33.191" style="s2">the Xiao family&#39;s daughter-in-law or</p>
<p begin="02:29:30.091" end="02:29:34.791" style="s2">anyone&#39;s appendage.</p>
<p begin="02:29:33.191" end="02:29:36.991" style="s2">I&#39;m officially appointing you vice</p>
<p begin="02:29:34.791" end="02:29:40.491" style="s2">president of Chen Group, in charge of</p>
<p begin="02:29:36.991" end="02:29:42.991" style="s2">all the company&#39;s core operations.</p>
<p begin="02:29:40.491" end="02:29:45.391" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vice president?</p>
<p begin="02:29:42.991" end="02:29:47.091" style="s2">Mom, isn&#39;t this a bit much?</p>
<p begin="02:29:45.391" end="02:29:49.091" style="s2">The old hands at the company already</p>
<p begin="02:29:47.091" end="02:29:50.691" style="s2">have their doubts about me.</p>
<p begin="02:29:49.091" end="02:29:52.691" style="s2">What if they think I got the job because</p>
<p begin="02:29:50.691" end="02:29:54.291" style="s2">of you?</p>
<p begin="02:29:52.691" end="02:29:55.791" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have the ability to earn this</p>
<p begin="02:29:54.291" end="02:29:58.791" style="s2">position.</p>
<p begin="02:29:55.791" end="02:30:00.691" style="s2">You graduated from a top university.</p>
<p begin="02:29:58.791" end="02:30:02.791" style="s2">I want everyone in Lin Jiang to see that</p>
<p begin="02:30:00.691" end="02:30:06.191" style="s2">Ding Xiao is a woman capable of running</p>
<p begin="02:30:02.791" end="02:30:06.191" style="s2">a trillion yuan empire.</p>
<p begin="02:30:10.191" end="02:30:14.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director Chen, we just saw Ding Xiao&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:30:12.691" end="02:30:17.091" style="s2">appointment notice on the company</p>
<p begin="02:30:14.591" end="02:30:19.291" style="s2">internet. Making her vice president</p>
<p begin="02:30:17.091" end="02:30:21.391" style="s2">right away, isn&#39;t that a little</p>
<p begin="02:30:19.291" end="02:30:23.691" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, Director Chen.</p>
<p begin="02:30:21.391" end="02:30:25.191" style="s2">The company has only just stabilized.</p>
<p begin="02:30:23.691" end="02:30:27.391" style="s2">This is the time to focus on steady</p>
<p begin="02:30:25.191" end="02:30:29.291" style="s2">growth. Putting such a young woman in</p>
<p begin="02:30:27.391" end="02:30:30.991" style="s2">the vice president seat might be hard</p>
<p begin="02:30:29.291" end="02:30:32.691" style="s2">for everyone to accept.</p>
<p begin="02:30:30.991" end="02:30:34.791" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the five-year new energy</p>
<p begin="02:30:32.691" end="02:30:36.591" style="s2">industry transition plan Xiao put</p>
<p begin="02:30:34.791" end="02:30:39.291" style="s2">together for Chen Group over the past</p>
<p begin="02:30:36.591" end="02:30:39.291" style="s2">two weeks.</p>
<p begin="02:30:43.391" end="02:30:47.191" style="s2">Is this project enough to earn Ding Xiao</p>
<p begin="02:30:45.591" end="02:30:49.091" style="s2">the vice president seat?</p>
<p begin="02:30:47.191" end="02:30:51.491" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More than enough. President Ding is</p>
<p begin="02:30:49.091" end="02:30:53.691" style="s2">truly impressive for someone so young.</p>
<p begin="02:30:51.491" end="02:30:55.891" style="s2">We were wrong to underestimate you. With</p>
<p begin="02:30:53.691" end="02:30:58.691" style="s2">President Ding leading us, Chen Group</p>
<p begin="02:30:55.891" end="02:30:58.691" style="s2">has a bright future.</p>
<p begin="02:31:00.991" end="02:31:05.991" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, sign this appointment letter.</p>
<p begin="02:31:03.991" end="02:31:08.591" style="s2">Starting today, you&#39;ll be President Ding</p>
<p begin="02:31:05.991" end="02:31:08.591" style="s2">of Chen Group.</p>
<p begin="02:31:15.992" end="02:31:20.893" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yuru, I&#39;m sorry about today. I said I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="02:31:18.893" end="02:31:23.192" style="s2">cook, but you all ended up doing</p>
<p begin="02:31:20.893" end="02:31:24.293" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="02:31:23.192" end="02:31:25.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shuying, you just got out of the</p>
<p begin="02:31:24.293" end="02:31:27.093" style="s2">hospital.</p>
<p begin="02:31:25.492" end="02:31:28.492" style="s2">Your only job right now is to rest and</p>
<p begin="02:31:27.093" end="02:31:30.093" style="s2">recover.</p>
<p begin="02:31:28.492" end="02:31:32.192" style="s2">Let the cooks and the staff handle the</p>
<p begin="02:31:30.093" end="02:31:34.192" style="s2">cooking and other chores.</p>
<p begin="02:31:32.192" end="02:31:36.893" style="s2">From now on, just relax and enjoy</p>
<p begin="02:31:34.192" end="02:31:36.893" style="s2">yourself here.</p>
<p begin="02:31:37.293" end="02:31:41.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what&#39;s the good news?</p>
<p begin="02:31:39.192" end="02:31:43.492" style="s2">You look so happy.</p>
<p begin="02:31:41.593" end="02:31:45.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were talking about you.</p>
<p begin="02:31:43.492" end="02:31:46.692" style="s2">Your mom was just telling me how proud</p>
<p begin="02:31:45.192" end="02:31:48.293" style="s2">she is of you.</p>
<p begin="02:31:46.692" end="02:31:50.293" style="s2">Now that you&#39;re a vice president, you</p>
<p begin="02:31:48.293" end="02:31:52.492" style="s2">seem so full of energy, like a real</p>
<p begin="02:31:50.293" end="02:31:54.593" style="s2">general.</p>
<p begin="02:31:52.492" end="02:31:57.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Back when Xiao was with</p>
<p begin="02:31:54.593" end="02:32:00.393" style="s2">the Ding family, she was always so</p>
<p begin="02:31:57.293" end="02:32:02.393" style="s2">timid. She wouldn&#39;t even dare speak up.</p>
<p begin="02:32:00.393" end="02:32:05.692" style="s2">Now I see her standing on her own two</p>
<p begin="02:32:02.393" end="02:32:08.492" style="s2">feet as her mother. I could die happy.</p>
<p begin="02:32:05.692" end="02:32:10.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t say things like that.</p>
<p begin="02:32:08.492" end="02:32:12.393" style="s2">You&#39;re doing just fine.</p>
<p begin="02:32:10.593" end="02:32:14.793" style="s2">You&#39;ll be there to watch me make Cheng</p>
<p begin="02:32:12.393" end="02:32:16.093" style="s2">Group bigger and stronger and enjoy the</p>
<p begin="02:32:14.793" end="02:32:18.192" style="s2">good life with me.</p>
<p begin="02:32:16.093" end="02:32:20.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Shuying.</p>
<p begin="02:32:18.192" end="02:32:21.793" style="s2">Don&#39;t say things like that again.</p>
<p begin="02:32:20.293" end="02:32:24.893" style="s2">The three of us are only just beginning</p>
<p begin="02:32:21.793" end="02:32:24.893" style="s2">to enjoy the good life.</p>
<p begin="02:32:28.293" end="02:32:33.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, young madam, and Mrs. Ding, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:32:30.492" end="02:32:36.692" style="s2">a happy day, a housewarming celebration.</p>
<p begin="02:32:33.192" end="02:32:36.692" style="s2">We can&#39;t celebrate without a drink.</p>
<p begin="02:32:39.393" end="02:32:42.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, thank you.</p>
<p begin="02:32:41.393" end="02:32:44.093" style="s2">Thank you both for always being there</p>
<p begin="02:32:42.992" end="02:32:46.192" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="02:32:44.093" end="02:32:48.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl, we&#39;re the ones who should be</p>
<p begin="02:32:46.192" end="02:32:50.992" style="s2">thanking you.</p>
<p begin="02:32:48.192" end="02:32:52.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao, Shuying.</p>
<p begin="02:32:50.992" end="02:32:54.593" style="s2">Back at the Xiao family&#39;s home, we were</p>
<p begin="02:32:52.593" end="02:32:55.692" style="s2">always under someone else&#39;s thumb.</p>
<p begin="02:32:54.593" end="02:32:58.192" style="s2">We couldn&#39;t even breathe without</p>
<p begin="02:32:55.692" end="02:33:00.593" style="s2">worrying what they&#39;d think.</p>
<p begin="02:32:58.192" end="02:33:02.393" style="s2">But from today on, in this new home and</p>
<p begin="02:33:00.593" end="02:33:05.593" style="s2">at Cheng Group, we&#39;ll be the ones</p>
<p begin="02:33:02.393" end="02:33:05.593" style="s2">calling the shots.</p>
<p begin="02:33:11.093" end="02:33:13.894" style="s2">Director Ding, here&#39;s the financial</p>
<p begin="02:33:12.492" end="02:33:15.593" style="s2">report for the new Energy Industrial</p>
<p begin="02:33:13.894" end="02:33:17.793" style="s2">Park for the first quarter.</p>
<p begin="02:33:15.593" end="02:33:18.693" style="s2">Our net profit is up 250% from the same</p>
<p begin="02:33:17.793" end="02:33:20.193" style="s2">period last year.</p>
<p begin="02:33:18.693" end="02:33:21.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve ranked first in Jiangcheng for</p>
<p begin="02:33:20.193" end="02:33:24.193" style="s2">corporate profits for three quarters in</p>
<p begin="02:33:21.793" end="02:33:24.193" style="s2">a row.</p>
<p begin="02:33:25.993" end="02:33:29.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excellent.</p>
<p begin="02:33:27.593" end="02:33:31.293" style="s2">Tell R and D and marketing to step up</p>
<p begin="02:33:29.593" end="02:33:33.093" style="s2">their investment</p>
<p begin="02:33:31.293" end="02:33:34.593" style="s2">and make sure the low carbon project</p>
<p begin="02:33:33.093" end="02:33:36.993" style="s2">we&#39;re coordinating with the government</p>
<p begin="02:33:34.593" end="02:33:39.993" style="s2">goes off without a hitch.</p>
<p begin="02:33:36.993" end="02:33:41.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director Ding, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="02:33:39.993" end="02:33:43.593" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s saying you&#39;re the youngest</p>
<p begin="02:33:41.693" end="02:33:44.793" style="s2">and most influential businesswoman in</p>
<p begin="02:33:43.593" end="02:33:46.793" style="s2">Linjiang.</p>
<p begin="02:33:44.793" end="02:33:49.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, enough flattery.</p>
<p begin="02:33:46.793" end="02:33:49.593" style="s2">Go get back to work.</p>
<p begin="02:33:51.593" end="02:33:56.493" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yuru, I never dreamed I&#39;d be living a</p>
<p begin="02:33:54.193" end="02:33:59.493" style="s2">life this wonderful.</p>
<p begin="02:33:56.493" end="02:34:01.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already satisfied, Shuying?</p>
<p begin="02:33:59.493" end="02:34:03.793" style="s2">Once things quiet down at the company,</p>
<p begin="02:34:01.793" end="02:34:05.793" style="s2">I&#39;ll have Xiao arrange a trip abroad for</p>
<p begin="02:34:03.793" end="02:34:07.793" style="s2">the two of us.</p>
<p begin="02:34:05.793" end="02:34:09.394" style="s2">We can go see the ocean.</p>
<p begin="02:34:07.793" end="02:34:11.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, all right.</p>
<p begin="02:34:09.394" end="02:34:14.394" style="s2">Whatever you say. With Xiao running the</p>
<p begin="02:34:11.593" end="02:34:16.993" style="s2">company, we can just enjoy ourselves.</p>
<p begin="02:34:14.394" end="02:34:16.993" style="s2">Hahaha.</p>
<p begin="02:34:22.493" end="02:34:27.093" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two moms talking about?</p>
<p begin="02:34:24.593" end="02:34:28.493" style="s2">You seem so happy.</p>
<p begin="02:34:27.093" end="02:34:30.193" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao,</p>
<p begin="02:34:28.493" end="02:34:31.793" style="s2">are you tired?</p>
<p begin="02:34:30.193" end="02:34:33.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all.</p>
<p begin="02:34:31.793" end="02:34:36.493" style="s2">We wrapped up a project successfully</p>
<p begin="02:34:33.593" end="02:34:39.093" style="s2">today, so I got you both presents.</p>
<p begin="02:34:36.493" end="02:34:41.993" style="s2">Mom, this is the scarf you like.</p>
<p begin="02:34:39.093" end="02:34:44.093" style="s2">Mom, I got you a massager.</p>
<p begin="02:34:41.993" end="02:34:46.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shouldn&#39;t spend so much money, dear.</p>
<p begin="02:34:44.093" end="02:34:48.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She bought them out of love.</p>
<p begin="02:34:46.394" end="02:34:50.493" style="s2">Just take them, Shuying.</p>
<p begin="02:34:48.593" end="02:34:50.993" style="s2">Xiao, I&#39;ll cook your favorite dishes</p>
<p begin="02:34:50.493" end="02:34:53.394" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:34:50.993" end="02:34:53.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:34:57.394" end="02:34:59.593" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="02:35:09.493" end="02:35:14.093" style="s2">Time flies.</p>
<p begin="02:35:10.894" end="02:35:14.093" style="s2">It&#39;s been five years already.</p>
<p begin="02:35:14.193" end="02:35:17.095" style="s2">Back then, you were as timid as a</p>
<p begin="02:35:15.795" end="02:35:18.694" style="s2">kitten.</p>
<p begin="02:35:17.095" end="02:35:20.595" style="s2">You were even afraid to look me in the</p>
<p begin="02:35:18.694" end="02:35:23.194" style="s2">eye.</p>
<p begin="02:35:20.595" end="02:35:24.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I was really scared back then.</p>
<p begin="02:35:23.194" end="02:35:26.895" style="s2">I was afraid I couldn&#39;t do things right,</p>
<p begin="02:35:24.995" end="02:35:28.595" style="s2">afraid of the Zhou family, and afraid of</p>
<p begin="02:35:26.895" end="02:35:30.995" style="s2">having no one to rely on in this cold</p>
<p begin="02:35:28.595" end="02:35:30.995" style="s2">city.</p>
<p begin="02:35:35.995" end="02:35:40.895" style="s2">Thank you, mom.</p>
<p begin="02:35:38.495" end="02:35:44.095" style="s2">Thank you for saving me and for teaching</p>
<p begin="02:35:40.895" end="02:35:47.694" style="s2">me how to love and how to grow stronger.</p>
<p begin="02:35:44.095" end="02:35:47.694" style="s2">You gave me a whole new life.</p>
<p begin="02:35:48.194" end="02:35:52.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl, you were brave enough all on</p>
<p begin="02:35:49.995" end="02:35:52.495" style="s2">your own.</p>
<p begin="02:35:52.595" end="02:35:57.694" style="s2">All I did was give you the chance you</p>
<p begin="02:35:54.595" end="02:35:57.694" style="s2">always deserved.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
